ldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Litecoin price up today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) surged by roughly 20% in the last 24 hours, climbing to around $120.50 on Jan. 16 as traders piled into the market following the buzz around Canary Capital\u8217\'20\'19s recent \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  exchange-traded fund (ETF) update.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/01929485-02b5-7c57-b844-449629ae7600"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Litecoin, Markets, Tech Analysis, Litecoin Price, Market Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD four-hour price chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Crypto market cheers first Litecoin ETF filing\par \par \uc2 Canary Capital has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/canary-amended-s-1-has-analysts-more-confident-litecoin-etf-is-next"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 filed an amended S-1 form}}}\uc2  for its proposed Canary Litecoin ETF, potentially positioning LTC as the next cryptocurrency to receive regulatory approval for an ETF in the US.\par \par \uc2 Bloomberg\uc2  analysts highlighted the significance of the Jan. 15 filing, suggesting it aligns with industry speculation that the \uc2 US Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  (SEC) is actively reviewing \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 -focused ETF applications.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis development supports our view that \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  is the most likely candidate for the next crypto \b \highlight22\uc2 ETF approval\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/EricBalchunas/status/1879662827943944264"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  Bloomberg ETF analyst \uc2 Eric Balchunas\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 However, he also cautioned that an upcoming leadership transition at the SEC introduces a \u8220\'20\'1Csignificant variable\u8221\'20\'1D that could influence the timeline and outcome.\par \par \uc2 ETF speculation has fueled sharp rallies across cryptocurrencies like XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ), Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ), and Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) in recent weeks.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/xrp-price-hits-seven-year-high-bullish-2025-outlook"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP hits 7-year high as optimism outweighs SEC appeal concerns}}}\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  is experiencing similar upward momentum, driven by expectations that ETF approvals could pave the way for increased institutional adoption.\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  whales and sharks accumulate LTC\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s gains today appear after a week of accumulation by its richest traders and investors.\par \par \uc2 Onchain data from Santiment {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/santimentfeed/status/1879673697298186531"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reveals}}}\uc2  that wallets holding at least 10,000 LTC have collectively added 250,000 LTC to their holdings over the past six days, signaling strong buying interest from influential market participants.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01946efd-7196-7bf2-bc60-4566b17dfd84"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Litecoin, Markets, Tech Analysis, Litecoin Price, Market Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s whale and shark token holdings vs. LTC price. Source: Santiment\par \par \uc2 The accumulation began on Jan. 9 and has aligned with \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s price 25% uptick.\par \par \uc2 This renewed demand from high-volume investors highlights growing optimism around \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s potential, particularly as ETF speculation continues to dominate headlines, further driving institutional and retail interest in the asset.\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  price eyes 30% gains\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s gains today are part of a breakout move emerging from its prevailing descending triangle pattern.\par \par \uc2 Descending triangles during uptrends are typically considered \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  reversal patterns. But, in some cases, they signal \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  continuation trends if the price breaks above their upper trendlines.\par \par \uc2 On Jan. 15, LTC broke above the triangle\u8217\'20\'19s upper trendline while accompanying rising volumes.\par \par \uc2 As a rule of technical analysis, the cryptocurrency can now rise by as much as the descending triangle\u8217\'20\'19s maximum height, thus eyeing $157 as its upside target by February, or 32% gains in the coming weeks.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01946f0a-2197-7cde-9688-bb31f7f99265"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Litecoin, Markets, Tech Analysis, Litecoin Price, Market Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD daily price chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Conversely, a pullback below the broken trendline would invalidate this setup, with immediate support near the 50-day exponential moving average (50-day EMA; the red wave) at around $105.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvNDFiODYyNjktMzE3NC00M2EyLTlkYzgtYTU3OWZlYjk2Y2I4.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020250116el1g0005o\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwg