\par\par \b \uc2 Crypto Price Analysis 1-15 BITCOIN: BTC, ETHEREUM: ETH, SOLANA: SOL, HEDERA: HBAR, CHAINLINK: LINK, APTOS: APT, INTERNET COMPUTER: ICP\b0\par\par\uc2 Amara Khatri \par \uc2 2,615 \uc2 words\par \uc2 15 January 2025\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2025, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 A Look At The Altcoin Market}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SEC Sues Elon Musk}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Gary Gensler Issues Dire Warning}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-7"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Hedera (HBAR) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Chainlink (LINK) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Aptos (APT) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-10"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Internet Computer (ICP) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 The cryptocurrency sector rose by 2.29% to $3.36 trillion as markets recovered, driven by a resurgent Bitcoin (BTC) crossed the $97,000 mark, up over 2% in the past 24 hours. BTC briefly dropped below $90,000 earlier in the week, spooking markets and leading to a considerable decline among cryptocurrencies. However, it rebounded to reclaim crucial levels and is trading just above the $97,000 level.\par \par \uc2 Other altcoins have risen as well, with Ethereum (ETH) up almost 2% as it looks to reclaim the $3,300 level. Meanwhile, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/XRP-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  has surged nearly 11% as its legal battle with the \uc2 Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  (SEC) entered a crucial phase. Notable gains were also registered by Solana (SOL), {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/DOGE-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE)}}}\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/ADA-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 )}}}\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/XLM-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Stellar (XLM),}}}\uc2  Toncoin (TON), Chainlink (LINK), and Hedera (HBAR).\par \par \uc2 A Look At The Altcoin Market\par \par \uc2 Altcoins displayed a mix of trends over the past 24 hours, with some registering substantial gains while others struggled to build momentum thanks to growing selling pressure. Ethereum (ETH) registered a significant increase, rising almost 3% to settle above $3,200. The world\u8217\'20\'19s second-largest cryptocurrency is trading around the $3,230 mark. The increase is because of increased institutional demand for Ethereum staking and Layer2 solutions. Dogecoin (DOGE) registered an increase of almost 6% following a surge in open interest, indicating growing speculative activity. Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) also outperformed expectations and is trading above $1, up almost 7%.\par \par \uc2 SEC Sues \uc2 Elon Musk\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 United States Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  (SEC) has filed a lawsuit against \uc2 Elon Musk\uc2 , alleging he failed to disclose his purchase of over 5% of \uc2 Twitter\uc2  (now X) shares within the legal timeframe. The SEC alleged that Musk\u8217\'20\'19s delayed disclosure allowed the \uc2 Tesla\uc2  CEO to purchase additional shares at lower prices, allowing him to potentially underpay by $150 million. The SEC is seeking disgorgement of the gains, a civil penalty, and a permanent injunction against future securities law violations. Musk\u8217\'20\'19s lawyer, Alex Spiro, stated,\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis is an admission that the SEC cannot bring an actual case because Musk has done nothing wrong, and everyone sees this sham for what it is.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Gary Gensler\uc2  Issues Dire Warning\par \par \uc2 Outgoing Securities and Exchange Commission Chair \uc2 Gary Gensler\uc2  has issued a dire warning about the crypto industry, calling it a ticking time bomb of failures. He stated that crypto\u8217\'20\'19s speculative nature exposed investors to significant risk and that many projects lack a solid foundation and are likely to fail over time. Gensler stated during an interaction,\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI\u8217\'20\'19ve been around finance for over four decades. And everything in the markets trades on a mixture of fundamentals and sentiment at any given time. I\u8217\'20\'19ve never seen a field that\u8217\'20\'19s so much wrapped up in sentiment and not so much about fundamentals.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Gensler also highlighted the risk of growing pump-and-dump schemes, stating,\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAnd these 10,000 to 15,000 projects\u8212\'20\'14 many of them will not survive. They\u8217\'20\'19re like venture capital investments. They\u8217\'20\'19re not going to survive, but there\u8217\'20\'19re also a fair number of small pump-and-dump schemes and other things in this. And, of course, we\u8217\'20\'19ve lived through a few years where they became notorious, but they\u8217\'20\'19re in jail, the Sam Bankman-Frieds and the CZs and the Do Kwons, where tens of billions of dollars were lost by investors.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Gensler has been a vocal critic of the crypto space and has called for greater oversight, citing a lack of transparency and failure to protect investors. The SEC initiated over 100 enforcement actions under Gensler\u8217\'20\'19s leadership, including against prominent players like \uc2 Coinbase\uc2 . Gensler is reportedly taking steps to ensure his regulatory policies endure even after he has stepped down. According to former SEC official John Reed Stark, Gensler has promoted top crypto-focused attorneys to senior roles, ensuring a hardline enforcement stance that could continue even after he steps down as SEC Chair.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/BTC-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC)}}}\uc2  has registered a sharp recovery over the past couple of sessions after facing significant selling pressure at the beginning of the week, with sellers driving the price to an intraday low of $89,397. However, buyers bought the dip, pushing the price back above $90,000. The move highlighted a risk appetite among traders despite the release of Consumer Price Index (CPI) data on the horizon. The \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  had taken a hawkish stance in December, indicating fewer rate cuts in 2025, increasing market sensitivity to inflation data. A higher-than-expected inflation reading could reinforce the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s hawkish stance and add downward pressure on BTC.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2025/01/crypto-price-analysis-1-14-bitcoin-btc-ethereum-eth-solana-sol-ripple-xrp-arbitrum-arb-filecoin-fil-injective-inj"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  is attempting to reverse the losses incurred last week when it witnessed a dramatic decline. BTC surged past $100,000 on Monday (January 6), rising 3.99% to $102,228. However, market sentiment changed on Tuesday, and BTC plummeted over 5% to slip below $100,000 and the 50-day SMA to $97,019. The price dropped to an intraday low of $92,456 on Wednesday, falling below the 20-day SMA as selling pressure intensified. However, it recovered from this level to settle at $95,121, ultimately registering a drop of almost 2%. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment persisted on Thursday as BTC dropped 2.53% and settled at $92,710.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/CBLQvd9L/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Despite the overwhelming \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment, BTC recovered on Friday, registering an increase of 2.27% and settling at $97,818. With the 50-day SMA acting as a dynamic resistance level, BTC lost momentum on Saturday, registering a marginal decline and dropping to $94,452. However, it registered a marginal increase on Sunday to end the weekend positively. The current week began with selling pressure registering a sharp rise as BTC plummeted below $90,000 to an intraday low of $89,397. However, it recovered from this level to reclaim $90,000 and settle at $94,492, ultimately registering only a marginal decline. Buyers returned to the market on Tuesday as market sentiment changed. As a result, BTC rose by 2.19% to go above the 20-day SMA and settle at $96,556. The current session sees BTC marginally up as buyers look to push it above the 50-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 If BTC can get past the 50-day SMA, we could see the price test $100,000 again, with expectations of a rally following Donald Trump\u8217\'20\'19s inauguration.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/ETH-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum (ETH)}}}\uc2  is attempting to reclaim the $3,300 level as it rebounds after dropping to an intraday low of $2,927 on Monday. ETH has been trading in a downward trajectory since Tuesday (January 7), when it fell over 8% to slip below the 20 and 50-day SMAs and the $3,500 price level to settle at $3,381. ETH continued to drop on Wednesday, falling to an intraday low of $3,217 before recovering and settling at $3,327, ultimately registering a decline of 1.62%. Selling pressure intensified on Thursday as ETH dropped just over 3% to $3,220. The price recovered on Friday, rising 1.45% to an intraday high of $3,321 before settling at $3,267.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/TeC8SKnN/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buyers retained control on Saturday as ETH registered a marginal increase to settle at $3,283. However, sentiment changed on Sunday, and ETH dropped 0.53% to end the weekend at $3,226. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment registered a substantial increase on Monday as ETH plummeted below $3,000 to an intraday low of $2,927, briefly slipping below the 200-day SMA. However, buyers bought the dip, propping the price above $3,000. ETH ultimately ended Monday at $3,137, registering a drop of almost 4%. ETH recovered on Tuesday, rising nearly 3% to $3,226. The current session sees ETH marginally down as buyers and sellers struggle to establish control.\par \par \uc2 ETH faces several resistance levels if it wants to reclaim the $3,500 level. The first level sits at $3,300. If this level is crossed, the next resistance sits around $3,400, where the 20-day SMA is also positioned.\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  (SOL) has recovered over the past couple of sessions as buyers look to push it above $190 towards the crucial $200 level. SOL has been \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  since failing to go beyond the 50-day SMA and dropped 7.38% on Tuesday to settle at $202. The price continued to fall on Wednesday, briefly slipping below the 20-day SMA to an intraday low of $188. However, it recovered from this level to go above the 20-day SMA and settle at $197. Selling pressure registered a substantial increase on Thursday as SOL slipped below the 20-day SMA after a drop of 6.33% and settled at $185. Despite the selling pressure, SOL recovered on Friday, rising to an intraday high of $193 before settling at $187.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/zH69n7uk/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL experienced \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  over the weekend as buyers and sellers attempted to establish control. Buyers ultimately gained the upper hand as SOL registered marginal increases on Saturday and Sunday to end the weekend at $188. SOL plummeted to an intraday low of $169 on Monday as market sentiment turned \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 . However, buyers bought the dip, pushing SOL back above $180. SOL ultimately settled at $182, registering a drop of almost 3%. Buyers returned to the market on Tuesday as SOL rose 2.57% to $187. The current session sees SOL up just under 1% as it looks to go past $190. If SOL can breach this level, it will look to move past the 20-day SMA and $200.\par \par \uc2 Hedera (HBAR) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Hedera (HBAR) has gone past the 20-day SMA during the ongoing session, as it looks to consolidate above $0.30. HBAR had dipped below the 20-day SMA on Wednesday after falling to an intraday low of $0.266. The price recovered from this level and settled at $0.285, ultimately registering a drop of 1.25%. Sellers retained control on Thursday, pushing HBAR down by 5.56% to $0.269. However, with the 50-day SMA acting as a dynamic support level, HBAR recovered on Friday, rising over 4% to $0.281.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/FtyBToDL/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price continued to push higher on Saturday, rising to $0.292. However, it could not move past the 20-day SMA and was back in the red on Sunday, falling almost 5% to $0.278. The current week began with HBAR experiencing considerable \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  as buyers and sellers attempted to establish control. Buyers attempted to push beyond the 20-day SMA, while sellers attempted to drive HBAR below support levels. As a result, the price reached an intraday high of $0.289 and fell to an intraday low of $0.255. HBAR ultimately settled at $0.276, registering a drop of 0.95%. The price recovered on Tuesday, rising over 4% to $0.287. HBAR has move past the 20-day SMA during the ongoing session and is up almost 7%, trading around $0.307.\par \par \uc2 Chainlink (LINK) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/LINK-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Chainlink (LINK)}}}\uc2  struggled to break out of a narrow range as buyers looked to build momentum and push the price beyond the 20-day SMA. The price has struggled to build momentum after registering a substantial drop the previous week. LINK fell below the 20 and 50-day SMAs on Tuesday after registering a fall of over 10% and settling at $21.38. LINK continued to fall on Wednesday, dropping over 4% to $20.45. The price fell below the crucial $20 support level on Thursday, falling almost 4% and settling at $19.65. However, it recovered on Friday to register an increase of 3.03% and settle at $20.24.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/XhDqlL6N/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment returned over the weekend as LINK registered a marginal decline on Saturday before falling almost 2% on Sunday, slipping below $20 and settling at $19.83. Selling pressure intensified on Sunday as LINK plummeted to an intraday low of $17.87. It recovered from this level as buyers bought the dip and ultimately settled at $19.36, a drop of 2.37%. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment returned on Tuesday as LINK rose almost 5% to reclaim $20 and settle at $20.30. The current session sees LINK up just over 1% as it looks to move past the 20-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 Aptos (APT) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Aptos (APT)\u8217\'20\'19s bull run abruptly halted on Tuesday as it lost momentum after reaching an intraday high of $10.65. As a result, sellers took over, driving the price down over 5% to $9.65. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment intensified on Wednesday as APT fell below the 20-day SMA after a drop of almost 7% and settled at $9.01. Sellers retained control on Thursday, as APT fell below $9 and settled at $8.65 after a drop of almost 4%. With the 200-day SMA acting as support, APT recovered on Friday, rising nearly 6% to reclaim $9 and settle at $9.14. However, it could not move past the 20-day SMA and fell back in the red on Saturday, registering a marginal decline.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/c4600qUu/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 APT continued to drop on Sunday, dropping over 3% to slip below $9 and settle at $8.82. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment intensified on Monday as APT fell to an intraday low of $7.94, going below the 200-day SMA and $8. However, it recovered from this level to reclaim $8 and settle at $8.46. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment returned on Tuesday as APT rose 6.55% to move past the 200-day SMA and settle at $9.01. The current session sees APT marginally down as sellers look to dive it below $9. On the other hand, buyers will look to keep the price above $9 and attempt to move past the 20-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 Internet Computer (ICP) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Internet Computer (ICP) reported a dramatic decline last week, slipping below key support levels and moving averages. The price dipped below the 50-day SMA on Tuesday, falling almost 10% to $11.02. Sellers retained control on Wednesday as ICP dropped to an intraday low of $10.37. However, it recovered from this level to settle at $10.87, ultimately registering a drop of 1.36%. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment intensified on Thursday as ICP went below the 20-day SMA, dropping almost 7% to $10.12. The price recovered on Friday as it raced to an intraday high of $10.85. However, it could not go past the 20-day SMA and dropped to settle at $10.35.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/lK7rtSWe/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buyers retained control on Saturday as ICP rose 1.26% to $10.48. However, it was back in the red on Sunday, dropping over 2% to end the weekend at $10.23. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment intensified on Monday as ICP dropped to an intraday low of $9.31, below the $9.90 support level. The price recovered from this level to settle at $9.78, a drop of 4.40%. Buyers returned to the market on Tuesday as ICP rose almost 5% to reclaim $10 and settle at $10.42. The current session sees ICP up nearly 2% and trading around $10.42.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020250116el1f00010\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 VanEck\par \b \uc2 VanEck\uc2  submits Onchain Economy ETF application to the SEC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Vince Quill \par \uc2 439 \uc2 words\par \uc2 15 January 2025\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2025. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Asset management firm \uc2 VanEck\uc2  has submitted an application for an ETF investing in \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  companies and \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  instruments.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjUtMDEvMDE5NDZiYWEtYTg3Ny03MmI1LWI3YjgtMTJiNGZmZWNhMWMx.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 VanEck submits Onchain Economy ETF application to the SEC}}}\par \par \uc2 Asset manager \uc2 VanEck\uc2  submitted an application to the \uc2 US Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  for the \u8220\'20\'1COnchain Economy\u8221\'20\'1D exchange-traded fund (ETF) on Jan. 15, a now-deleted social media comment from \uc2 VanEck\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s head of digital assets research, Matthew Sigel, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/matthew_sigel/status/1879575107108315408"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 revealed}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/768847/000076884725000010/vaneckonchaineconomyetf485.htm"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 According}}}\uc2  to the filing, the fund will invest in crypto firms across the industry, including software developers, mining companies, crypto exchanges, infrastructure builders, payment firms and other businesses in the crypto sector.\par \par \uc2 The asset manager defined these as \u8220\'20\'1CDigital Transformation Companies,\u8221\'20\'1D writing:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CDigital Transformation Companies are selected based on a combination of fundamental analysis, market trends, the company\u8217\'20\'19s strategic positioning within the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  ecosystem, and valuation.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The fund will also invest in \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  instruments such as commodity futures contracts but will not invest in digital assets directly by holding crypto. \uc2 VanEck\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s application is one of the latest ETF filings in anticipation of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/everything-know-pro-crypto-sec-chair-paul-atkins"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 new leadership at the SEC}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01946b84-0de9-73f5-be34-1a179db3e6d0"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 VanEck\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s application for the Onchain Economy ETF. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/768847/000076884725000010/vaneckonchaineconomyetf485.htm#i2ca46f867e3e4e56bcabf0f924c9d933_19"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SEC}}}\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-extends-timeline-bitwise-crypto-index-etf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SEC postpones listing decision for Bitwise crypto index ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 Financial firms file a bevy of crypto ETF applications\par \par \uc2 Following the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/live-countdown-us-elections-2024-crypto-industry"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reelection of President-elect Donald Trump}}}\uc2  in the United States, and in anticipation of a friendlier regulatory climate, several asset managers and financial firms have filed or updated SEC applications for crypto ETFs.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  manager {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitwise-files-for-10-crypto-index-etf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitwise submitted an application}}}\uc2  for the 10 Crypto Index Fund ETF in November 2024.\par \par \uc2 The index includes Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), SOL ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ), XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ), Avalanche\u8217\'20\'19s AVAX ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ), Chainlink\u8217\'20\'19s LINK ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/chainlink-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) token, Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s native \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) currency, Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ), Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/uniswap-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) and Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ).\par \par \uc2 ETF provider {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/wisdomtree-files-s-1-xrp-spot-etf-sec"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 WisdomTree filed for}}}\uc2  an XRP (XRP) ETF in December 2024, joining the ranks of \uc2 21Shares\uc2 , Canary Capital, and Bitwise.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  management firm Grayscale also {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/grayscale-files-spot-solana-etf-sec"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 applied for a Solana ETF}}}\uc2  in December. The firm petitioned the SEC for approval to convert its existing \uc2 Grayscale Solana Trust\uc2  into an exchange-traded fund.\par \par \uc2 That same month, asset manager REX Financial debuted the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/rex-launches-crypto-stock-income-etf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 REX Crypto Equity Premium Income ETF}}}\uc2 , which relies on a covered-call strategy of writing options against crypto stocks to generate income.\par \par \uc2 More recently, Bitwise submitted a regulatory filing to the SEC proposing to list the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitwise-etf-tracks-big-bitcoin-holding-companies"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitwise Bitcoin Standard Corporations ETF}}}\uc2 , which would invest in companies with large Bitcoin holdings.\par \par \uc2 Magazine: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/bitcoin-etf-coinbase-honeypot-hackers-government-trezor-ceo/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin ETFs make Coinbase a \u8216\'20\'18honeypot\u8217\'20\'19 for hackers and governments: Trezor CEO}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjUtMDEvMDE5NDZiYWEtYTg3Ny03MmI1LWI3YjgtMTJiNGZmZWNhMWMx.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020250115el1f000e2\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 1/15: BTC, ETH, XRP, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , XLM, SUI\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,756 \uc2 words\par \uc2 15 January 2025\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2025. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s relief rally is extending toward $100,000 and multiple altcoins are chasing new all-time highs. Is the bull market back in full swing?\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjUtMDEvMDE5NDZiMDAtZTRmZi03ZGRlLWE5NmYtOTdlOGVmZTQ0M2Uz.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 1/15: BTC, ETH, XRP, BNB, SOL, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, XLM, SUI}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) extended its recovery on Jan. 13, with the bulls challenging the crucial overhead resistance at $100,000. Risk assets received a boost following the latest Consumer Price Index report, which was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2025/01/14/stock-market-today-live-updates.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 lower}}}\uc2  than economists\u8217\'20\'19 expectations.\par \par \uc2 ARK Invest said in \u8220\'20\'1CThe Bitcoin Monthly\u8221\'20\'1D report that Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s monthly \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  in December was relatively low compared to its yearly \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 , suggesting that Bitcoin has not reached the mania phase yet. That {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-volatility-upside-2025-ark"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 signals a further upside in 2025}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Another \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  projection was from CryptoQuant, which said in its latest weekly report that \u8220\'20\'1Cfavorable regulatory, monetary and cyclical conditions\u8221\'20\'1D could keep the capital flowing into Bitcoin, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-inflows-trump-new-249k-btc-price-target-2025"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pushing its price to at least $145,000}}}\uc2  in 2025.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01946afa-1e90-71a6-9c47-d53c51763244"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Stellar, Bitcoin Price, \b  \highlight22Volatility\b0 \highlight22 , XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, CNBC, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, SUI}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Fundstrat Capital chief investment officer Tom Lee said in a CNBC interview on Jan. 13 that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-could-dip-under-70k-current-price-good-entry-point-fundstrat"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 investors will not lose money buying near $90,000}}}\uc2 . He added that Bitcoin is poised to be \u8220\'20\'1Cone of the best-performing assets of the year.\u8221\'20\'1D However, Lee did not rule out Bitcoin dropping to $70,000 or even to the $50,000 range.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin surge above $100,000, pulling select altcoins higher? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin bounced off sharply from the $90,000 support on Jan. 13, indicating that the traders are buying the dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01946afa-b559-7e7a-90ff-3f66b2c1f9fe"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Stellar, Bitcoin Price, \b  \highlight22Volatility\b0 \highlight22 , XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, CNBC, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, SUI}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USDT pair has reached the downtrend line, which is expected to pose a substantial challenge. If the price turns down from the downtrend line, the bears will again attempt to sink the pair to $90,000.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price breaks above the downtrend line, it will signal an advantage to buyers. The pair could rise to $102,724 and subsequently to $108,353. A break above this resistance could propel the pair to $126,706.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bears to sustain Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) below the neckline of the head-and-shoulders pattern suggests that the breakdown on Jan. 13 may have been a bear trap.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01946afb-492a-78fa-8d05-d44e488e509f"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Stellar, Bitcoin Price, \b  \highlight22Volatility\b0 \highlight22 , XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, CNBC, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, SUI}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The ETH/USDT pair started a relief rally, which has reached the 20-day exponential moving average ($3,374). If buyers drive the price above the 20-day EMA, the next stop is likely to be the 50-day simple moving average ($3,566) and later $3,745.\par \par \uc2 Time is running out for the bears. If they want to make a comeback, they will have to pull the price back below the neckline. If they manage to do that, the pair could plunge to $2,850. Buyers are expected to vigorously defend the $2,850 level.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) successfully held the retest of the breakout level from the triangle on Jan. 13, indicating that bulls remain in control.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01946afb-daba-7722-a649-8a76cfa813c8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Stellar, Bitcoin Price, \b  \highlight22Volatility\b0 \highlight22 , XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, CNBC, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, SUI}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The up move continued and has risen above the overhead resistance of $2.91. If the price maintains above $2.91, it will signal the start of the next leg of the uptrend. The XRP/USDT pair could then travel toward the target objective of $4.84.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price fails to sustain above $2.91, it will indicate that the bears are active at higher levels. That could tempt the short-term buyers to book profits, pulling the pair to the 20-day EMA ($2.44).\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the uptrend line on Jan. 13, indicating that the bulls are fiercely defending the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01946afc-7427-7bd9-8758-8927b31dbcc5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Stellar, Bitcoin Price, \b  \highlight22Volatility\b0 \highlight22 , XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, CNBC, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, SUI}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($698) is flattening out, and the relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) is near the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand. If the price sustains above the moving averages, the likelihood of a rally to $745 increases.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price fails to maintain above the moving averages, it suggests selling on rallies. The BTC/USDT pair could then fall to the uptrend line. A break and close below the uptrend line opens the doors for a fall to $635.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) fell below the uptrend line on Jan. 13, but the long tail on the candlestick suggests solid buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01946afd-0c09-7238-b4c8-023dd8167422"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Stellar, Bitcoin Price, \b  \highlight22Volatility\b0 \highlight22 , XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, CNBC, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, SUI}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair has risen to the 20-day EMA ($196), which is an important level to watch out for. If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA with strength, it suggests that bears remain in control. The pair may then retest the support at $170.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, a rise above the 20-day EMA will suggest that the bears may be booking profits. The pair could then climb to the 50-day SMA ($209). A break and close above this resistance could drive the pair to $223.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers successfully held the $0.30 level in Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ), indicating demand at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01946afd-a77d-73b5-8e3e-b4be40e36b5d"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Stellar, Bitcoin Price, \b  \highlight22Volatility\b0 \highlight22 , XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, CNBC, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, SUI}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.35) on Jan. 14, signaling that the DOGE/USDT pair may swing inside the $0.30 to $0.40 range for a few more days. If buyers propel the price above $0.40, the pair could surge toward $0.48.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bears are trying to take charge. A break and close below $0.30 could open the doors for a fall to $0.23.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) dipped below the uptrend line on Jan. 13, but the bears could not sustain the lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01946afe-53c2-789d-8838-6bb2d87ef925"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Stellar, Bitcoin Price, \b  \highlight22Volatility\b0 \highlight22 , XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, CNBC, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, SUI}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair started a recovery that has risen above the 50-day SMA ($1.01). Both moving averages have flattened out, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is just above the midpoint, suggesting that the pair may reach the resistance line.\par \par \uc2 Buyers will gain the upper hand on a break and close above the triangle. If that happens, the pair may rise to $1.33. Alternatively, if the price turns down sharply from the resistance line, it will suggest that the pair may remain inside the triangle for a while.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/xrp-price-snaps-8-year-downtrend-vs-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP price snaps 8-year downtrend vs Bitcoin as predictions target $14}}}\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) plunged below the strong support at $35 on Jan. 13 but found support near $32.31.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01946afe-f919-77e7-b175-2350087df4f3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Stellar, Bitcoin Price, \b  \highlight22Volatility\b0 \highlight22 , XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, CNBC, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, SUI}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The recovery gained momentum and rose above the 20-day EMA ($38.70), signaling that the bears are losing their grip. The AVAX/USDT pair could rally to $45, which is likely to act as a stiff hurdle.\par \par \uc2 Sellers will have to quickly pull the price back below the 20-day EMA if they want to retain the advantage. The pair could retest the critical support zone between $35 and $32.31. If this zone gives way, the pair could drop to $30 and then $27.\par \par \uc2 Stellar price analysis\par \par \uc2 Stellar ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2  ) has formed an inverted H&S pattern, which will complete on a break and close above the neckline.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01946aff-a05e-78a8-9e57-4d9c27fc9b5f"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Stellar, Bitcoin Price, \b  \highlight22Volatility\b0 \highlight22 , XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, CNBC, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, SUI}}}\par \par \uc2 XLM/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 If that happens, the XLM/USDT pair is likely to pick up momentum and rally toward the overhead resistance at $0.64. The bears are expected to defend the level aggressively, but if the bulls prevail, the pair could rally toward $0.86.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the neckline, it will signal that the bears are fiercely defending the level. The pair could then drop to the $0.37 level, signaling a possible consolidation in the near term.\par \par \uc2 Sui price analysis\par \par \uc2 Sui ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/sui-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SUI}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 50-day SMA ($4.35) on Jan. 15, and the bulls are trying to maintain the price above the 20-day EMA ($4.70).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01946b00-5ef7-7f55-9e8f-ed770051413b"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Stellar, Bitcoin Price, \b  \highlight22Volatility\b0 \highlight22 , XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, CNBC, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, SUI}}}\par \par \uc2 SUI/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, it will signal that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying at lower levels. That will improve the prospects of a rally to the overhead resistance at $5.37. If this level is taken out, the SUI/USDT pair may ascend to $5.82.\par \par \uc2 This optimistic view will be negated in the near term if the price turns down and breaks below the 50-day SMA. That signals the start of a deeper correction to $3.94 and later to $3.50.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjUtMDEvMDE5NDZiMDAtZTRmZi03ZGRlLWE5NmYtOTdlOGVmZTQ0M2Uz.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020250115el1f000ba\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
