ttps://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvZTIzMDE1ZGQtODcyOC00YjI3LTgzYjctODgxYTY1YjUwMTlh.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Cardano price down today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) price traded in a second straight daily \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  session on Jan. 13, dropping 7% over the last 24 hours to trade at $0.930. A \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  technical setup and several onchain signals suggest that \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  could see a deeper correction in the coming days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01945ed2-2138-746b-b3f0-94f5df24789e"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, SEC, Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Altcoin Watch}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/ {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/ym2N7tLW/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s look at the factors driving \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price down today.\par \par \uc2 Risk-off mode and broader crypto market sell-off\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment on Jan. 13 was not only exclusive to Cardano. The overall cryptocurrency market has also been {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-the-crypto-market-down-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 experiencing a downturn}}}\uc2 , with a significant sell-off in risk assets as markets continue to price in a more hawkish stance by the \uc2 US Federal Reserve\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price#:~:text=ETH's%20value%20drastically%20increased%20in,assets%20in%20the%20crypto%20space."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) prices traded in red on Monday after declining more than 0.8% and 2% in the past 24 hours.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01945ed2-8b6a-7f37-923d-1ef754ebbd34"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, SEC, Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Altcoin Watch}}}\par \par \uc2 24-hour performance of top-cap cryptocurrencies: Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Other top-cap cryptocurrencies, including BNB Chain\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2 , XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ), and Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ), have also posted significant losses over the last 24 hours.\par \par \uc2 Similarly, the total crypto market cap has dropped by 1.73% over the last 24 hours to at $3.25 trillion at the time of publication.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-1-10-btc-eth-xrp-bnb-sol-doge-ada-avax-sui-ton"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 1/10: BTC, ETH, XRP, BNB, SOL, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SUI, TON}}}\par \par \uc2 This market drawdown comes as a series of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-s-trump-trade-dented-by-rising-yields-and-strong-us-dollar"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 stronger-than-expected US macroeconomic}}}\uc2  data dented hopes of capital inflows into the crypto space.\par \par \uc2 As a result, futures markets predict that the Fed will now be less likely to cut interest rates as much or as quickly as previously thought. The latest data from \uc2 CME Group\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cmegroup.com/markets/interest-rates/cme-fedwatch-tool.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 FedWatch Tool}}}\uc2  put the odds of even a small 0.25% cut at the Fed\u8217\'20\'19s January meeting at just 2.7%.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01945ed3-140f-70b6-9554-93d4f819a768"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, SEC, Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Altcoin Watch}}}\par \par \uc2 Fed target rate probabilities. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cmegroup.com/markets/interest-rates/cme-fedwatch-tool.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CME Group}}}\par \par \uc2 The sentiment suggests that there is a growing expectation of fewer rate cuts in 2025 than previously anticipated, with market participants now pricing in only 1-2 cuts for the year.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CInterest rate futures are now pricing in a new low of 1-2 rate cuts in 2025,\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/KobeissiLetter/status/1878643706124964026"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  capital markets commentator The Kobeissi Letter in a Jan. 13 post on X, adding:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CRate hikes could be back on the table, and markets aren\u8217\'20\'19t liking it.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Weak onchain metrics underlie \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s downside\par \par \uc2 Data from \uc2 Artemis\uc2  reveals that the drop in \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price coincides with a drop in investors\u8217\'20\'19 interest and liquidity on the Cardano chain.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s daily DEX trading volume fell from $31.3 million on Dec. 12, 2024, to $4.9 million on Jan. 12, the lowest level since Nov. 7.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01945ed3-8f51-721a-a5e6-d557a94993dd"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, SEC, Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Altcoin Watch}}}\par \par \uc2 DEX trading volume on Cardano. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://app.artemis.xyz/project/cardano?tab=fundamentals"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Artemis}}}\par \par \uc2 Similarly, daily active addresses decreased by 70% from approximately 96,700 to 29,500 over the same period.\par \par \uc2 Additional data from DefiLlama suggests that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/explained/what-is-total-value-locked-tvl-in-crypto-and-why-does-it-matter"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 total value locked}}}\uc2  (TVL) on the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/a-beginners-guide-to-the-cardano-network-and-the-ada-ecosystem"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano}}}\uc2  network plummeted from $701.4 million on Dec. 3, 2024, to $492.7 million on Jan. 13.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01945ed3-dc40-7a3b-9940-9e560a3c08a3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, SEC, Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Altcoin Watch}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano total value locked, USD. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://defillama.com/chain/Cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DefiLlama}}}\par \par \uc2 The decline in daily active addresses, DEX volume and TVL coincides with \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s 30% \b \highlight22\uc2 price drop\b0 \highlight\uc2  over the same period.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  bull flag places downward target at $0.72\par \par \uc2 As shown below, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price technicals show a bear flag pattern on the four-hour candle chart.\par \par \uc2 A {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/how-to-trade-bull-and-bear-flag-patterns#:~:text=A%20bear%20flag%20pattern%20is,is%20the%20bear%20flag%20itself."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 bear flag}}}\uc2  is a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  continuation setup that forms after the price consolidates inside an up-sloping range following a sharp price decline.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01945ed4-4d56-7c24-9120-b2a28bf3a47e"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, SEC, Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Altcoin Watch}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD four-hour chart. Source: Cointelegraph/ {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/AteNLDiz/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bear flag broke down during the Asian trading hours on Jan. 13 when the price slipped below the lower trendline on the flag at $0.945.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price could now drop by as much as the previous downtrend\u8217\'20\'19s height. This puts the lower target for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price at $0.726\u8212\'20\'14 levels last seen in mid-November 2024.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvZTIzMDE1ZGQtODcyOC00YjI3LTgzYjctODgxYTY1YjUwMTlh.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020250113el1d0002w\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
