\par\par \b \uc2 Crypto Weekly Roundup: DOJ To Dump Bitcoin, Canada Boots Trudeau, & More\b0\par\par\uc2 Amara Khatri \par \uc2 522 \uc2 words\par \uc2 12 January 2025\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2025, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Altcoins}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Technology}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Business}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Web3}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-7"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22Regulation\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 It is a crucial week for crypto in the US as the DOJ prepares to sell $6.5 billion worth of Bitcoin seized from the Silk Road, which could have a significant impact on the market. In \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 Coinbase\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s legal battle with the SEC advances, and Canada\u8217\'20\'19s pro-crypto \uc2 Pierre Poilievre\uc2  emerges as a frontrunner to replace \uc2 Justin Trudeau\uc2 . Let\u8217\'20\'19s dig deeper\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 U.S. Department of Justice\uc2  (DOJ) has secured legal clearance to sell approximately {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2025/01/65-billion-bitcoin-sale-doj-to-liquidate-silk-road-assets"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $6.5 billion}}}\uc2  worth of Bitcoin, which was confiscated from assets associated with the Silk Road marketplace.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum\par \par \uc2 Ethereum, the second-largest cryptocurrency by market capitalization, recently experienced a significant {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2025/01/ethereum-gas-fees-in-2024-whats-driving-the-recent-surge"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 surge in gas fees}}}\uc2 , which affected users and developers across its ecosystem.\par \par \uc2 Altcoins\par \par \uc2 The cryptocurrency market thrives on the next big opportunity, and insiders are closely monitoring the presale of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2025/01/crypto-insiders-are-watching-this-presale-heres-what-you-need-to-know"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Lightchain AI}}}\uc2 , a blockchain project poised to revolutionize the industry.\par \par \uc2 These {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2025/01/the-7-best-crypto-presales-to-create-generational-wealth-during-the-2025-bull-run"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 seven crypto}}}\uc2  presales provide the best prospects for those wishing to maximize their returns in the next bull run.\par \par \uc2 The market for altcoins is increasingly {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2025/01/hedge-funds-targeting-altcoins-for-new-ath-rally-cardano-intelmarkets-and-polkadot-lead-interest"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 attracting hedge funds}}}\uc2  with exemplary platforms like Cardano \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , IntelMarkets (INTL), and Polkadot (DOT). Over time, these assets are finding their own specialization areas as the market expands at an unprecedented rate.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2025/01/uniswap-teams-with-venmo-near-price-rises-investors-flock-to-lightchain-ai-presale-in-the-january"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Uniswap}}}\uc2  has teamed up with Venmo, marking a major milestone in the crypto industry. Meanwhile, NEAR\u8217\'20\'19s price has risen due to growing investor interest.\par \par \uc2 Technology\par \par \uc2 Starknet, a zero-knowledge (ZK) layer-2 scaling solution for Ethereum, has announced the launch of a new software called {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2025/01/starknets-sn-stack-will-allow-developers-to-build-custom-chains"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Starknet (SN) Stack}}}\uc2 , allowing developers to build custom chains using Starknet\u8217\'20\'19s zero-knowledge technology.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  developers have proposed a new {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2025/01/new-solana-proposal-aims-to-fix-scalability-issues-plaguing-network"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 hashing system}}}\uc2  that changes how the \uc2 Solana\uc2  blockchain verifies, traces, and interacts with user accounts.\par \par \uc2 Business\par \par \uc2 Marking its first major political contribution in the U.S., Circle has donated {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2025/01/pro-crypto-president-trump-receives-1m-usdc-donation-from-circle"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $1 million in USDC}}}\uc2  to President-elect \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 's inaugural fund.\par \par \uc2 Banking giant {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2025/01/standard-chartered-to-launch-crypto-services-in-europe"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Standard Chartered}}}\uc2  is launching crypto services in Europe after obtaining a \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  license in Luxembourg under the MiCA regulatory framework.\par \par \uc2 Ripple\uc2  is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2025/01/ripple-announces-partnership-with-chainlink-to-boost-rlusd-stablecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 partnering}}}\uc2  with Chainlink in an effort to enhance the adoption and utility of its RLUSD stablecoin across the decentralized finance (DeFi) ecosystem.\par \par \uc2 Web3\par \par \uc2 Cardano has announced a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2025/01/cardano-and-fc-barcelona-partnership-to-revolutionize-fan-engagement"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 partnership}}}\uc2  with FC Barcelona, one of the biggest football clubs in the world, to revolutionize fan engagement and create global opportunities for the club.\par \par \uc2 In cryptocurrency trading, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2025/01/high-leverage-in-crypto-is-insanely-risky-but-playing-it-safe-can-still-bring-big-rewards"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 leverage}}}\uc2  amplifies both potential profits and risks, making it crucial to understand its mechanics before use.\par \par \uc2 Regulation\par \par \uc2 A US federal judge has allowed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2025/01/coinbase-secures-legal-pause-in-sec-dispute-with-interlocutory-appeal"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coinbase}}}\uc2  to pursue an interlocutory appeal in its legal battle with the SEC, pausing the ongoing case and escalating the dispute to a higher court.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2025/01/trudeau-out-poilievre-in-polymarket-bets-signal-conservative-takeover"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Pierre Poilievre}}}\uc2 , leader of Canada\u8217\'20\'19s Conservative Party and a vocal cryptocurrency supporter, has emerged as the frontrunner to succeed \uc2 Justin Trudeau\uc2  as Canada\u8217\'20\'19s next prime minister.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020250113el1c0000p\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
