par \uc2 Tokens such as Cardano, which aims for growth and lasting power, Tron, famous for fast deals and Lightchain AI, that joins blockchain with smart thinking are at the front. These plans give a strong blend of trust, new ideas, and huge growth chances making them worth seeing as the market keeps changing.\par \par \uc2 Top Must-Have Cryptos for 2025\par \par \uc2 As we look ahead to 2025, several cryptocurrencies are poised forsignificant growth.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) - Renowned for its research-driven approach, Cardano emphasizes sustainability, scalability, and interoperability. The implementation of the Hydra Layer 2 scaling solution enhances its transaction speed and network capacity, making it a strong contender for decentralized applications and DeFi projects. Analysts predict that \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  could reach new all-time highs by early 2025, with some estimates suggesting a potential price of $7.\par \par \uc2 Tron\uc2  (TRX) - Tron has established itself in the blockchain ecosystem by focusing on content sharing, decentralized applications, and smart contracts. Its high transaction throughput and low fees attract developers and users alike. As Tron continues to expand its partnerships and enhance its platform, TRX is well-positioned for substantial growth in the near future.\par \par \uc2 Lightchain AI (LCAI) -Lightchain AI is an emerging project that integrates artificial intelligence with blockchain technology, aiming to create a decentralized platform for AI-driven applications such as predictive analytics and data optimization.\par \par \uc2 The project has garnered significant attention, raising over $9.4 million during itspresale stages, with tokens priced at $0.004. Thisearly-stage investment opportunity has attracted investors seeking high-growth potential in the evolving AI-blockchain landscape.\par \par \uc2 Investors should conduct thorough research and consider market \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  when evaluating these cryptocurrencies for potential investment.\par \par \uc2 Why Everyone\u8217\'20\'19s Talking About Lightchain AI\par \par \uc2 Lightchain AI is making waves for good reason. By combining blockchain and artificial intelligence, it tackles key market challenges and offers game-changing solutions for developers and businesses.\par \par \uc2 Its tokenomics are built for long-term success, with a total supply of 10 billion tokens strategically allocated: 40% for presale, 28.5% for staking rewards, 15% for liquidity, 5% for marketing, 6.5% for the treasury, and 5% for the team.\par \par \uc2 Lightchain AI is addressing big issues like scalability and privacy, putting it in a prime position to lead the way in decentralized intelligence and real-world blockchain applications.\par \par \uc2 For investors, this could be a golden opportunity. With a successful presale, an ambitious roadmap, and the potential for massive growth,Lightchain AI is shaping up to be the breakout crypto of 2025. If you\u8217\'20\'19re looking to stay ahead of the curve, this is a project you\u8217\'20\'19ll want to keep in your portfolio.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://lightchain.ai"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://lightchain.ai}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://lightchain.ai/lightchain-whitepaper.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://lightchain.ai/lightchain-whitepaper.pdf}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/LightchainAI"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://x.com/LightchainAI}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.me/LightchainProtocol"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.me/LightchainProtocol}}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored article and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020250111el1a0001e\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 1/10: BTC, ETH, XRP, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , SUI, TON\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,777 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 January 2025\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2025. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin remains stuck between $90,000 and $100,000, indicating a tough battle between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjUtMDEvMDE5NDUxMjItYzJlMy03MjE1LWFhYTktMTgwZTAwMmJkMDUx.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 1/10: BTC, ETH, XRP, BNB, SOL, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SUI, TON}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) made a solid recovery on Jan. 10, and the bulls are trying to maintain the price above $94,000. This suggests that the bulls continue to view the dips near $90,000 as a buying opportunity. Blocktrends head of research Cau\u234\'00\'EA Oliveira wrote in a Jan. 8 CryptoQuant post that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-whales-scoop-34k-btc-after-december-dump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 large players were buying Bitcoin just below $95,000}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 A Bitwise survey of 430 financial advisers conducted between Nov. 14 and Dec. 20 shows that 56% of the respondents are {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/financial-advisors-more-likely-invest-crypto-donald-trump-president-bitwise-survey"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 more likely to invest in cryptocurrencies in 2025}}}\uc2  following Donald Trump\u8217\'20\'19s United States presidential election victory. Additionally, among the advisers who are already investing, 99% plan to \u8220\'20\'1Ceither maintain or increase\u8221\'20\'1D their crypto exposure this year.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/0194518a-dc1e-7476-88be-1380bf22fcc5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, SUI}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The arrival of new investors could be good news for both Bitcoin and altcoins. Real Vision co-founder and CEO \uc2 Raoul Pal\uc2  said in a post on X that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-go-banana-singularity-everything-goes-up-real-vision-ceo"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 crypto markets are headed}}}\uc2  to a phase where \u8220\'20\'1Ceverything goes up, followed by a bigger consolidation.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 What are the critical resistance levels to watch out for in Bitcoin and altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin turned up from $91,203 on Jan. 9, indicating that the bulls are aggressively defending the $90,000 support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/0194510f-8e04-7df1-a5c7-48a09ca6f7fe"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, SUI}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The first test for the bulls on the upside will be at the moving averages. If the price turns down sharply from the moving averages, the risk of a break below $90,000 increases. The BTC/USDT pair could then slump to $85,000. Buyers are expected to defend the $85,000 to $90,000 zone with all their might because a break and close below it will signal a short-term trend change.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the first sign of strength will be a break and close above the downtrend line. The pair may then rise to $102,725 and subsequently to $108,353.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has formed a head-and-shoulders pattern, which will be completed on a break and close below the neckline.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01945110-1fe6-723d-995f-7456e4dda3e1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, SUI}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 As the neckline is sloping up, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pattern is relatively less reliable, but traders should not neglect it. The downsloping 20-day exponential moving average ($3,451) and the relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) in the negative territory indicate that bears hold the edge. If the price turns down from the current level or the 20-day EMA and breaks below the neckline, the ETH/USDT pair risks falling to $2,850.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent the downside, they will have to drive the price above the 20-day EMA. The pair could then climb to $3,745.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been trading inside a symmetrical triangle pattern, indicating a balance between supply and demand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01945110-aac9-7378-850c-10874a469c04"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, SUI}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA ($2.29) and the RSI near the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. If the price breaks and closes above the resistance line, it will signal that the bulls have overpowered the bears. That may start a rally to $2.73 and later to $2.91.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, a break and close below the support line will suggest that the XRP/USDT pair may have topped out in the near term. The pair may then tumble to $1.62.\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) closed below the 50-day simple moving average ($691) on Jan. 9, but the bears are struggling to sustain the lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01945111-3053-77a7-b15f-00e702b1f723"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, SUI}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to push the price above the moving averages. If they manage to do that, the BNB/USDT pair could challenge the overhead resistance at $745. A break and close above $745 could propel the pair to $794. The bears will try to defend the level with all their might, but if the bulls prevail, the next stop could be $935.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will signal that the bears are trying to take charge. That could sink the pair to the solid support at $635.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has rebounded off the uptrend line, indicating that the bulls continue to defend the level aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01945111-baf0-7a6d-8aa2-4ccfd0d3cd48"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, SUI}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to push and maintain the price above the 50-day SMA ($215) to indicate a comeback. Until then, every relief rally is likely to be sold into.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the risk of a break below the uptrend line increases. There is support at $175, but the level is likely to be broken. The \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could then plummet to $155. Such a move will signal that the pair may continue oscillating inside the large range between $116 and $260 for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been consolidating between $0.30 and $0.40 for the past few days, indicating buying on dips and selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01945112-4b32-7a61-841b-5e0aa7a52bd4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, SUI}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The DOGE/USDT pair is trying to move up but is likely to face selling at the 20-day EMA ($0.34). If the price turns down sharply from $0.34, the $0.30 level will be in danger of breaking down. The pair may then slump to $0.27.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, a break and close above the 20-day EMA will keep the range-bound action intact. The pair may then attempt a rally to the overhead resistance of $0.40. Buyers will have to clear this hurdle to gain the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has turned up from the uptrend line, indicating that the lower levels are attracting buyers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01945112-def3-76cf-93c8-1e03450118fd"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, SUI}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The relief rally is expected to face selling at the moving averages. If the price turns down from the moving averages, the possibility of a break below the uptrend line increases. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could then plunge to $0.80.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if buyers kick the price above the 50-day SMA ($1.01), it will suggest that the selling pressure is reducing. The pair may climb to $1.15, where the bears are expected to mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-bitcoin-price-stuck"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Bitcoin price stuck?}}}\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) is attempting to bounce off the strong support near $35. but the relief rally is likely to be sold into.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01945113-6d41-775b-9b3c-996834a4b37b"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, SUI}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level or the 20-day EMA ($39.72), it will suggest that the bears remain in command. That will increase the likelihood of a break below $33.60. The next support on the downside is $30.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if buyers drive the price above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the AVAX/USDT pair may stay range-bound between $35 and $45 for a few days. Buyers will be back in the game on a close above $45.\par \par \uc2 Sui price analysis\par \par \uc2 Sui ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/sui-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SUI}}}\uc2  ) is finding support at the 20-day EMA ($4.64), indicating that the sentiment remains positive, and traders are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01945114-050d-7fa3-808a-6c7a6bcb6fd1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, SUI}}}\par \par \uc2 SUI/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers are trying to push the price to the overhead resistance at $5.37. If this level gets taken out, it will signal the resumption of the uptrend. The SUI/USDT pair may then attempt a rally to $5.82.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the upside, they will have to yank the price below the 50-day SMA ($4.21). If they manage to do that, it will signal that a short-term top is in place. The pair may slide to $4 and later to $3.50.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/toncoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TON}}}\uc2  ) has been gradually slipping toward the strong support zone between $4.72 and $4.44.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01945114-93fb-73e4-a1aa-d99d05fb7ad0"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, SUI}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers are expected to fiercely defend the support zone. If the price bounces off the support zone, the TON/USDT pair could reach the 20-day EMA ($5.57). The sellers will try to retain the advantage by halting the recovery at the 20-day EMA. If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the bears will make another attempt to sink the pair below $4.44.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, a break and close above the moving averages will suggest that the pair may remain range-bound between $4.44 and $7.20 for some time.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjUtMDEvMDE5NDUxMjItYzJlMy03MjE1LWFhYTktMTgwZTAwMmJkMDUx.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020250110el1a000b9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley1