ed the broader crypto market trend by selling off sharply, but the altcoin still holds the bulk of its 300% gains, which it accumulated in the last part of 2024. The altcoin managed to avoid a deeper correction between Jan. 7 and Jan. 9, as it continues to consolidate near its descending trendline, eyeing a potential breakout above the key resistance range between $2.50 and $2.60.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01944be7-9630-773d-b1ce-5bc78fec705d"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple, XRP, Markets, Price Analysis, Market Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP 1-week chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 XRP price sits in a key decision-making zone\par \par \uc2 While majors like Bitcoin {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 (BTC)}}}\uc2 , Ether {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 (ETH)}}}\uc2 , and Solana {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 (SOL)}}}\uc2  threaded to previous swing lows over the past 24 hours, XRP fought to hold a position above $2.30, which is the point of control (POC) for the altcoin since it breached $2 on Dec. 1. A position above POC implies that bulls remain in control of overall price action.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01944bf6-6ad0-7dd3-b049-3771efb1f815"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple, XRP, Markets, Price Analysis, Market Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP 4-hour chart analysis by Valeriya. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 Valeriya, a crypto and forex trader, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/valeriyaApex/status/1877082327853183422"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  that the XRP price is currently in a key decision-making zone. The trader explained that the altcoin\u8217\'20\'19s upward rejection or bounce from the $2.15 to $2.20 level indicates the \u8220\'20\'1Cintentions of major players.\u8221\'20\'1D The trader added,\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIf the support zone resists, aggressive growth is expected with the nearest target of $2.91, where the liquidity of sellers is concentrated.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Additionally, Valeriya mentioned that traders should closely monitor XRP\u8217\'20\'19s price action as the \u8220\'20\'1Casset is preparing for a powerful movement.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Likewise, Daan Crypto, a crypto analyst, said that the altcoin pair \u8220\'20\'1Ccan be great to trade\u8221\'20\'1D as XRP has historically respected most of its technical levels. The trader highlighted the formation of a triangle/pennant formation on XRP\u8217\'20\'19s 4-hour chart, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/DaanCrypto/status/1877325196257829205"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 suggesting}}}\uc2  that these types of patterns have a higher probability of breaking upward during bull markets.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ripple-s-rlusd-stablecoin-to-list-imminently-on-more-exchanges-says-monica-long"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Related: Ripple\u8217\'20\'19s RLUSD stablecoin to list \u8216\'20\'18imminently\u8217\'20\'19 on more exchanges \u8212\'20\'14 Exec}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP crowd sentiment hints at optimism\par \par \uc2 Besides a favorable market structure, XRP\u8217\'20\'19s ecosystem has also witnessed a series of positive events that could lure in speculators. \uc2 Ripple\uc2 's president recently stated that an XRP spot \b \highlight22\uc2 ETF approval\b0 \highlight\uc2  could be coming up \u8220\'20\'1Cvery soon.\u8221\'20\'1D Meanwhile, \uc2 Ripple\uc2  CEO \uc2 Brad Garlinghouse\uc2  recently {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/bgarlinghouse/status/1876783603603939438"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 shared}}}\uc2  an image with President-elect \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 , which stirred the likelihood of an XRP rally after Trump\u8217\'20\'19s inauguration on Jan. 20.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01944bfd-6c37-7223-a52e-09d4f9f682e1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple, XRP, Markets, Price Analysis, Market Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP\u8217\'20\'19s crowd sentiment analysis. Source: Santiment\par \par \uc2 These factors have improved the crowd sentiment for XRP, as data from Santiment {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://insights.santiment.net/read/sentiment-wildly-different-between-crypto-s-top-market-caps-8375?utm_source=twitter&utm_medium=post&utm_campaign=twitter_wildly_different_sentiments_insight_b_010825/&fpr=twitter"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 highlighted}}}\uc2  a rise in the positive sentiment score. It is important to note that the index was much higher during the end of November 2024, but it is currently improving again.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01944c20-80b7-7abe-8e46-e64481fd19d1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple, XRP, Markets, Price Analysis, Market Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP 4-hour chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 From a technical perspective, XRP has converged within trendlines over the past few weeks, with the price maintaining a position above the 200-day EMA level. With a potential breakout above the descending trendline, the altcoin will likely attempt to clear liquidity levels around $2.42 and $2.50, which may fuel a rally toward a new all-time high above $2.90.\par \par \uc2 However, a confirmed daily breakout above resistance levels is $2.50, and $2.60 remains critical.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-1-8-btc-eth-xrp-bnb-sol-doge-ada-avax-sui-link"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Related: Price analysis 1/8: BTC, ETH, XRP, BNB, SOL, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SUI, LINK}}}\par \par \uc2 This article is for general information purposes and is not intended to be and should not be taken as legal or investment advice. The views, thoughts, and opinions expressed here are the author\u8217\'20\'19s alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjUtMDEvMDE5NDRiZGYtYWI0Yi03OWFmLTljMzMtMjY4OGNiODE3MTE1.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020250109el19000dx\par }\page {\par\fs20\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price\par \b \uc2 Why is Cardano price down today?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Nancy Lubale \par \uc2 698 \uc2 words\par \uc2 9 January 2025\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2025. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Cardano faces selling pressure, and weakening onchain metrics point to further downside.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvZTIzMDE1ZGQtODcyOC00YjI3LTgzYjctODgxYTY1YjUwMTlh.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Cardano price down today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) continued its losing streak on Jan. 9, dropping 8% over the last 24 hours to trade at $0.918. A weakening technical structure and several onchain signals suggest that \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  could slip lower in the near term.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01944aae-ab6c-7e91-ba7b-8f1dded71940"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, SEC, Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Altcoin Watch}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/ {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/K3mlGi00/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s look at the factors driving Cardano price down today.\par \par \uc2 Reducing network activity weighs down \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/a-beginners-guide-to-the-cardano-network-and-the-ada-ecosystem"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano network}}}\uc2  has seen a remarkable drop in user engagement since the beginning of December. Data from \uc2 Artemis\uc2  shows that the number of daily active addresses on the Cardano blockchain has dropped from 96,700 on Dec. 3 to around 38,200 on Jan. 9.\par \par \uc2 Similarly, daily transactions have declined from approximately 144,300 to 54,600 over the same period.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01944aaf-3592-7950-a660-88d45ec8017d"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, SEC, Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Altcoin Watch}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily active addresses and transactions on the Cardano network. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://app.artemis.xyz/project/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Artemis}}}\par \par \uc2 Additional data from DefiLlama reveals that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/explained/what-is-total-value-locked-tvl-in-crypto-and-why-does-it-matter"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 total value locked}}}\uc2  (TVL) on Cardano also decreased in December.\par \par \uc2 The chart below shows that the TVL fell by over 31.5% from about $708.9 million on Dec. 3 to approximately $485 million at the time of publication. The TVL dropped by $105 million between Jan. 7 and Jan. 9, representing an 18% decline in less than 72 hours.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01944ab1-04e5-757f-a38a-802cc5421f3e"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, SEC, Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Altcoin Watch}}}\par \par \uc2 TVL on Cardano. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://defillama.com/chain/Cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DefiLlama}}}\par \par \uc2 Among the leading projects in Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s DeFi ecosystem, LenFi\u8212\'20\'14a decentralized open-source lending and borrowing protocol\u8212\'20\'14stands out, with its TVL dropping by 53% over the last month and 10% in the past 24 hours.\par \par \uc2 Other Cardano-based protocols, such as Liqwid (lending), Minswap (DEX), and Indigo (lending), also registered TVL declines of 6.5%, 9% and 8.7,% respectively, over the past 24 hours.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01944ab1-81dc-7406-8163-7b6b22655c1c"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, SEC, Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Altcoin Watch}}}\par \par \uc2 Performance of top DeFi protocols on Cardano. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://defillama.com/chain/Cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DefiLlama}}}\par \par \uc2 The declining network activity and reducing TVL on Cardano indicate diminished user interaction, decreasing demand for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  tokens and negatively impacting its price.\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/explained/what-is-open-interest-in-the-crypto-futures-market"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 open interest}}}\uc2  (OI) has also decreased by over 17% over the last three days, reaching $1.10 billion on Jan. 9. The current decrease in OI coincides with the ongoing \b \highlight22\uc2 price drop\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which infers a waning interest from futures traders.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-1-8-btc-eth-xrp-bnb-sol-doge-ada-avax-sui-link"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 1/8: BTC, ETH, XRP, BNB, SOL, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SUI, LINK}}}\par \par \uc2 Technical \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price correction?\par \par \uc2 The technical setup reveals \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  in a technical price correction within a bull flag, as shown on the weekly chart below. If the support provided by the lower boundary of the flag at $0.782 holds, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  could bounce back to continue its uptrend.\par \par \uc2 The technical pattern will be confirmed once the price breaks above the upper boundary of the flag at $1.072, clearing the way for a rise toward the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  target of the flag at $4.40.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01944ab2-2f04-7135-a4eb-6cd27d699761"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, SEC, Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Altcoin Watch}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD weekly chart. Source: Cointelegraph/ {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/8uTQOeCS/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The same chart also shows that \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price faces resistance levels at $1.00 and $1.50, with some analysts predicting further downside if current support levels break.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1C\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  showing weakness at $0.92,\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/Viv_Kumar_/status/1877287434704023862"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  pseudonymous technical analyst Kwantxbt in a Jan. 9 post on X.\par \par \uc2 The analyst said those considering long positions should probably \u8220\'20\'1Cwait for confirmation of support at $0.85\u8221\'20\'1D before making any move.\par \par \uc2 If this support is lost, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  could drop toward the 200-week simple moving average (SMA) at $0.763 and later to the psychological level at $0.60.\par \par \uc2 The daily relative strength index has dropped from 63 to 44 over the last three days, suggesting increasing selling momentum that threatens to pull \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  lower in the near term.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvZTIzMDE1ZGQtODcyOC00YjI3LTgzYjctODgxYTY1YjUwMTlh.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020250109el190005t\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
