\par\par \b \uc2 Coinbase Whales Switches From DOGE to Cardano ( \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 ) for Incoming Rally, But His Biggest Bag Is This $0.14 Crypto\b0\par\par\uc2 Adrian Barkley \par \uc2 691 \uc2 words\par \uc2 7 January 2025\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2025, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) Rally Capped at $0.38 After 20% Weekly Pump}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) Attracts Utility Investors Amid New Developments}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DTX Exchange (DTX) Tops Investment Charts After $11.3M Presale}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Key Takeaways}}}\par \par \uc2 Due to positive market sentiment before Trump's inauguration ceremony, Dogecoin started the New Year on a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  note. Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) also broke the $1 threshold to continue on the road to higher gains this January. However, according to data by \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  exchange, major flow from DOGE to \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  is witnessed due to its upcoming ground-breaking developments.\par \par \uc2 Furthermore, as capital rotates from Dogecoin (DOGE) after \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  gains, another altcoin leads the investment funnel due to its competing performance and utility against Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ). This makes this $0.14 altcoin the next moonshot crypto to acquire before its upcoming \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  listing after Trump takes office.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) Rally Capped at $0.38 After 20% Weekly Pump\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price has surged more than 20% in the past week due to \uc2 Elon Musk\uc2  actively promoting the meme culture and New Year hype. Over $413 million of DOGE tokens have been accumulated since the start of January, indicating \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum for Dogecoin, as this month is considered one of the best 30 days for the DOGE price trend.\par \par \uc2 Source: CoinMarketCap\par \par \uc2 However, technical data shows strong resistance for Dogecoin at the $0.38 price level, and the dropping trading volume suggests weakened \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pressure due to profit-booking. This trend has caused the DOGE to slow down below a strong price ceiling and is expected to consolidate to immediate support levels before the January 10 court order for Donald Trump.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Attracts Utility Investors Amid New Developments\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) is emerging as a major alternative for Dogecoin as profit makers start rotating capital amid ongoing developments. The expansion of the Lace wallet and \uc2 Charles Hoskinson\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s plans for Bitcoin integration in 2025 make the Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) ecosystem the center of attention for global traders under a crypto-friendly Congress.\par \par \uc2 Experts believe Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) will react bullishly after Trump officially takes office on January 20, reclaiming the 2021 highs with a historic comeback. Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) has already gained over 23% in the last 7 days, and it sees the $1.39 price level as the next \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  target amid increasing market optimism and trading volume.\par \par \uc2 DTX Exchange (DTX) Tops Investment Charts After $11.3M Presale\par \par \uc2 DTX Exchange (\uc2 DTX\uc2 ) is setting a new benchmark in the trading industry with its innovative technologies and commitment to redefining traditional trading practices with its hybrid approach. The project has gained significant momentum, raising an impressive $11.3 million during the 7th batch of its public presale.\par \par \uc2 With a focus on delivering a seamless trading experience, the \uc2 DTX\uc2  platform caters to novice and experienced traders, enabling them to maximize profits with 1000x leverage. \uc2 DTX\uc2  offers access to over 120,000 digital assets across stocks, cryptocurrencies, bonds, commodities, and CFDs, powered by its hybrid VulcanX Layer-1 blockchain.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://dtxexchange.com/?utm_source=cryptodaily&utm_medium=Abiroua&utm_campaign=53"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DTX Exchange}}}\uc2  continues to lead the market with groundbreaking features such as quant and algo trading, advanced risk management and automation, and a 3% VIP Rebate Program, designed to promote participation in the platform\u8217\'20\'19s growth. Global investors eager to capitalize on its early-stage price of $0.14 see its path toward $1 following the platform\u8217\'20\'19s mainnet launch after Trump\u8217\'20\'19s inauguration.\par \par \uc2 Key Takeaways\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) whales shift capital into Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) for utility-driven gains in the upcoming price rally. However, the spotlight increasingly turns to DTX Exchange (DTX), an innovative platform blending advanced trading features with robust decentralized security. \uc2 DTX\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s hybrid approach and commitment to revolutionizing trading practices make it a compelling choice for those aiming to capitalize on the next major crypto breakout.\par \par \uc2 Learn more:\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://presale.dtxexchange.com/login"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Buy Presale}}}\par \par \uc2 Visit DTX Website\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.me/DTXExchange"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Join The DTX Community}}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored article and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020250108el1700005\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cardano\par \b \uc2 Why is Cardano ( \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 ) price up today?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Nancy Lubale \par \uc2 874 \uc2 words\par \uc2 7 January 2025\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2025. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Activity within Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s DeFi ecosystem has surged and the steady increase in TVL could be a contributing factor in \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTEvMDE5MzA2ZWEtZDcwYy03ZjY2LWJlMDYtMWRlNjQ4NzFlNDVl.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) price up today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has steadily recovered, rising 36% since dropping to $0.83 on Dec. 30, 2024. The swift rebound has led to a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  position above its 50-day simple moving average, possibly triggering its next leg higher.\par \par \uc2 At the time of writing, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's price is trading at $1.30, which is up 5% over the last 24 hours.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/019440be-4429-7412-9d8c-15ac3aa8662d"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Trading, Altcoin Watch}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/ {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/hxn7M5q3/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s look at the factors driving \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price higher today.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price rises alongside Bitcoin, Ethereum\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment was not only exclusive to Cardano as crypto prices also recovered across the board, buoyed by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/trump-presidential-victory-paves-way-100k-bitcoin-end-2024"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/trump-presidential-victory-paves-way-100k-bitcoin-end-2024}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-tops-101k-microstrategy-buy-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s return above the $100,00 level}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), the largest cryptocurrency by market capitalization, led the gains and has jumped 8% over the last week to set a new three-week high of around $102,760 on Jan. 7. Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has risen more than 0.5% over the last 24 hours to trade above $3,660.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/019440bf-c7ac-79ac-a937-78d66b431e5b"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Trading, Altcoin Watch}}}\par \par \uc2 24-hour performance of top-cap cryptocurrencies: Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Other top-cap cryptocurrencies, including BNB Chain\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2 , XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ), and Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ), have also posted significant gains over the last 24 hours.\par \par \uc2 Similarly, the total {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-the-crypto-market-up-today#:~:text=Favorable%20macroeconomic%20conditions,rise%20in%20the%20crypto%20market."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 crypto market cap has increased}}}\uc2  by 2% over the last 24 hours and 10% year-to-date to $3.58 trillion at the time of publication.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-1-06-spx-dxy-btc-eth-xrp-bnb-sol-doge-ada-avax"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 1/06: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, XRP, BNB, SOL, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX}}}\par \par \uc2 This performance comes from general positive sentiment in the cryptocurrency market, possibly influenced by broader economic factors or political events.\par \par \uc2 For instance, with the upcoming inauguration of Donald Trump on Jan. 20, there\u8217\'20\'19s increasing optimism that this could lead to a more friendly regulatory environment for cryptocurrencies, including \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/top-people-in-crypto-and-blockchain-2022/michael-saylor"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Michael Saylor}}}\uc2 , an ardent Bitcoin advocate, has been quoted in social media posts suggesting that under Trump, there would be an end to the \u8221\'20\'1Dwar on crypto\u8221\'20\'1D with more pro-crypto and pro-business policies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/019440c1-e02f-74ca-9ad3-b76a02b2fd20"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Trading, Altcoin Watch}}}\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/alx/status/1873029826598330421"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ALX}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano TVL recovers by 36%\par \par \uc2 DeFi\uc2  protocols on the Cardano Network have also significantly increased since Dec. 31, improving investor trust. Data from DefiLlama {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://defillama.com/chain/Cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 indicates}}}\uc2  that \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s total locked value (TVL) rose from $423 million to $579 million in seven days, marking 36.8% weekly gains.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/019440ca-7f21-754b-ae82-3b21dba013e8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Trading, Altcoin Watch}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s TVL chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://defillama.com/chain/Cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DefiLlama}}}\par \par \uc2 The rise in TVL was led by Liqwid (lending), Minswap (DEX), and Indigo (lending), which registered increases of 35%, 27% and 29% in locked value, respectively, over the past seven days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/019440ca-cb42-7068-b0d2-763a19ba6933"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Trading, Altcoin Watch}}}\par \par \uc2 TVL of top 10 DeFi protocols on Cardano. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://defillama.com/chain/Cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DeFiLama}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s open interest (OI) has also {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.coinglass.com/BitcoinOpenInterest"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 increased}}}\uc2  by 10.75% over the past day, reaching $1.43 billion on Jan. 7, surpassing the $1.18 billion reached on Dec. 9. The current increase in OI coincides with price growth, which infers a continued interest from futures traders.\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s onchain activity is also rising, evidenced by an increase in daily transactions, as per {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://app.artemis.xyz/project/cardano?tab=fundamentals"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 data from Artemis}}}\uc2 , and progress on the Lace Wallet, Midnight, and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-ceo-delayed-upgrades-boring-papers"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CIP-1694 projects}}}\uc2 .\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price in a V-shaped recovery\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s price action has nurtured a V-shaped recovery chart pattern on the daily chart since Dec. 2, as shown below.\par \par \uc2 A V-shaped recovery is a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pattern formed when an asset experiences a sharp price increase after a steep decline. It is completed when the price moves up to the resistance at the top of the V formation.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  appears to be on a similar trajectory. It currently trades above a crucial demand zone between $1.00 and $1.12, where the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) is currently sitting.\par \par \uc2 This suggests that increased buying from the current levels will likely see \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA price rise\b0 \highlight\uc2  above the $1.23 neckline to complete the V-shaped pattern. Higher than that, the next logical move would be the $1.33 range high reached on Dec. 3, 2024, representing a 17% uptick from the current price.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/019440cb-75f5-785a-b8ed-b4135b860977"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Trading, Altcoin Watch}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/ {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/AQO3gWUs/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Several analysts are optimistic about \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s price recovery, with some setting targets as high as $15 for this cycle.\par \par \uc2 However, X user \u8220\'20\'1CBest analysts\u8221\'20\'1D provided a more conservative prediction, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/best_analysts/status/1876551355671986559"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 saying}}}\uc2  that the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair could top at $5 this cycle.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1C\b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  prediction for Cardano (ADAUSD) suggests a potential rise to $3 and a cycle top at $5.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/019440cb-f2ff-7717-96aa-9ab3f75b510f"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Trading, Altcoin Watch}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD weekly chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/best_analysts/status/1876551355671986559"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Best Analysts}}}\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTEvMDE5MzA2ZWEtZDcwYy03ZjY2LWJlMDYtMWRlNjQ4NzFlNDVl.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020250107el170008k\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 XRP USD\par \b \uc2 XRP market cap of $500B 'possible' within 6 weeks, says veteran trader\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Biraajmaan Tamuly \par \uc2 671 \uc2 words\par \uc2 7 January 2025\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2025. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 XRP price is attempting to break above a descending trendline and a successful rally above $2.72 will open the possibility of a new all-time high in Q1 2025.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjUtMDEvMDE5NDNmODgtZWZkNi03Y2RlLTlkODgtZjc4ZTRhZDExOGNm.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP market cap of $500B 'possible' within 6 weeks, says veteran trader}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 (XRP)}}}\uc2  price is attempting to close a daily candle above its descending resistance trendline, which previously capped the altcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price action.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01943f97-a2da-7be9-a15d-8ef0b1741715"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple, XRP, Price Analysis, Market Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP 1-day chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 Successive breaks above the trendline and resistance range between $2.48 and $2.60 will be a strong signal from the bulls, potentially leading to a breakout above $2.72.\par \par \uc2 XRP half-mast flag hints at 260% gains ahead\par \par \uc2 Likewise, one market analyst believes that XRP is primed for a major breakout over the next few weeks, but timing will be key.\par \par \uc2 In a recent X post, Peter Brandt, a veteran trader, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/PeterLBrandt/status/1876409091507032513"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 explained}}}\uc2  that XRP\u8217\'20\'19s half-mast flag on the weekly chart should undergo completion in the next six weeks.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/xrp-price-chart-bull-flag-15-open-interest"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Related: XRP price chart 'bull flag' targets $15 amid increasing open interest}}}\par \par \uc2 A half-mast flag is a neutral pattern that can lead to a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  or \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outcome. The half-mast period is considered a consolidation in the middle of a trend before continuation.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01943fa3-63f6-7250-a98e-309ee8ccda80"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple, XRP, Price Analysis, Market Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP analysis by Peter Brandt. Source: X.com\par \par \uc2 As illustrated in the chart, Brandt says that XRP\u8217\'20\'19s market cap reaching $500 billion is possible if the pattern undergoes a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  completion. That is a 262% gain or a price target of $6.40. Although, the trader warns,\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis flag in $XRP needs to rock and roll soon, otherwise it will likely morph into something else TBD.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Similarly, Mikybull, a crypto trader, also mentioned that an XRP breakout is \u8220\'20\'1Cimminent,\u8221\'20\'1D as the altcoin formed a bull flag pattern on the 1-day chart. Based on Fibonacci extension lines, the trader {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/MikybullCrypto/status/1876515279217312240"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 outlined}}}\uc2  an immediate target of $3.74.\par \par \uc2 However, the long-term target {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/xrp-price-chart-bull-flag-15-open-interest"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 could be as high as $15}}}\uc2  if the flagpole\u8217\'20\'19s height is considered, which is a 514% rise from XRP\u8217\'20\'19s current value.\par \par \uc2 XRP price can \u8220\'20\'1Cmove fast above $2.45\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 XRP must clear the current resistance range between $2.48 and $2.60 to reach the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  price targets like $3.74 and $6.40 over the next few weeks.\par \par \uc2 This range has capped the price action at $2.60 three times, with a liquidity sweep just above the upper resistance on Dec. 17.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01944014-9a46-7583-b762-f5f976305ba6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple, XRP, Markets, Market Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP 4-hour chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 So, even though the XRP price is well-positioned for a rally, Brandt\u8217\'20\'19s warning should be heeded, as a breakdown is also possible if this resistance remains in place.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-1-06-spx-dxy-btc-eth-xrp-bnb-sol-doge-ada-avax"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Related: Price analysis 1/06: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, XRP, BNB, SOL, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX}}}\par \par \uc2 Dom, an order flows market analyst, says that XRP has been stuck in the mid-range for six weeks with a point of control (POC) of around $2.45 based on the Volume Weighted Average Price (VWAP) metric. He noted:\par \par \uc2 The profile is starting to look very balanced indicating a break is soonAny dip into the orange VWAP bands, I will be bidding for longsFull acceptance over $2.45 and things likely start moving fast.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/0194401c-3b2c-7b8d-b9cb-8e8c58e0555a"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple, XRP, Markets, Market Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP order flow analysis by Dom. Source: X.com\par \par \uc2 But first, XRP bulls must secure a daily close above $2.45 to break the $2.60 target. This will directly bring the mentioned price targets of $3.74 and $6.40 into play over the coming weeks.\par \par \uc2 This article is for general information purposes and is not intended to be and should not be taken as legal or investment advice. The views, thoughts, and opinions expressed here are the author\u8217\'20\'19s alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjUtMDEvMDE5NDNmODgtZWZkNi03Y2RlLTlkODgtZjc4ZTRhZDExOGNm.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020250107el170005o\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
