\par\par \b \uc2 Crypto Price Analysis 1-6 BITCOIN: BTC, ETHEREUM: ETH, SOLANA: SOL, DOGECOIN: DOGE, RIPPLE: XRP, INJECTIVE: INJ, BITTENSOR: TAO\b0\par\par\uc2 Amara Khatri \par \uc2 2,389 \uc2 words\par \uc2 6 January 2025\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2025, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple CEO Hails Pro-Crypto Congress}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Michael Saylor Hints At Monday BTC Purchase}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 What\u8217\'20\'19s In Store For Bitcoin (BTC) In 2025?}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-7"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple (XRP) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Injective (INJ) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-10"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bittensor (TAO) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) has seen a marginal uptick after spending most of the weekend below $98,000. The world\u8217\'20\'19s largest cryptocurrency has climbed above $99,000 and is currently trading around $99,100 as bulls set their sights on reclaiming $100,000. BTC is up just over 1% in the past 24 hours and almost 6% over the past week as markets look to gather momentum and start the new year positively.\par \par \uc2 Despite BTC\u8217\'20\'19s positive start, the crypto market remains mixed, with cryptocurrencies like Ethereum (ETH) and \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) registering marginal gains. However, \uc2 Solana\uc2  (SOL) and Dogecoin (DOGE) are currently in the red, down almost 1%. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/LINK-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Chainlink (LINK)}}}\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/ADA-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 )}}}\uc2 , Toncoin (TON), {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/XLM-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Stellar (XLM)}}}\uc2 , Polkadot (DOT), Uniswap (UNI), and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/LTC-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Litecoin (LTC)}}}\uc2  registered notable increases.\par \par \uc2 Ripple\uc2  CEO Hails Pro-Crypto Congress\par \par \uc2 Ripple\uc2  CEO \uc2 Brad Garlinghouse\uc2  has hailed the most pro-crypto Congress in US history, boosting optimism for regulatory clarity in crypto and blockchain. The pro-crypto Republicans have a 219-215 majority in the House and a 53-47 majority in the Senate. However, last year\u8217\'20\'19s SAB 121 vote underscored bipartisan support for crypto. The vote suggested US policymaker resistance to crypto and blockchain tech, with Anthony Scaramucci stating that all Democrats under 60 voted against the bill.\par \par \uc2 Furthermore, the SEC vs \uc2 Ripple\uc2  case remains in focus as the January 15 deadline approaches. Market watchers expect the SEC to file its appeal-related opening brief by January 15 days before SEC Chair \uc2 Gary Gensler\uc2  steps down. According to former SEC lawyer Mark Fagel, the SEC could proceed with the appeal under Gensler but withdraw it once the new administration assumes office.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe appeal will continue for now, and that process takes about a year. But there is the possibility that a new administration decides to move to dismiss the appeal. That\u8217\'20\'19s not something I recall happening before, but it\u8217\'20\'19s possible and maybe likely.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 An SEC overhaul could support the withdrawal of the appeal, with internal rules mandating that an agency vote, not the Chair alone, determines whether an appeal should continue or be withdrawn.\par \par \uc2 Michael Saylor Hints At Monday BTC Purchase\par \par \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2  founder \uc2 Michael Saylor\uc2  posted the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2025/01/crypto-price-analysis-1-3-bitcoin-btc-ethereum-eth-solana-sol-chainlink-link-algorand-algo-internet-computer-icp-ethena-ena"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC)}}}\uc2  price chart from the SaylorTracker website on January 5. Saylor typically posts the chart before purchasing (BTC) the following day. Saylor had posted the same chart on December 29, and \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2  purchased 2,138 BTC on December 30. \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2  is looking to purchase more BTC as part of its 21/21 plan to finance the acquisition of $42 billion in BTC by issuing $21 billion in equity and $21 billion in fixed-income securities.\par \par \uc2 What\u8217\'20\'19s In Store For Bitcoin (BTC) In 2025?\par \par \uc2 The crypto market is buzzing after Bitcoin (BTC)\u8217\'20\'19s stellar performance in 2024, with experts optimistic about the year ahead. Market watchers are hopeful that 2025 will see regulatory clarity, technological advancements, and greater institutional adoption. BTC doubled its market capitalization in 2024, with major altcoins also registering stellar growth.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe crypto market had an excellent run in 2024, with its market cap doubling within the year. Continuing the momentum, we have started the new year on a positive note, with all major tokens up as much as 18% in a day.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Experts expect global regulatory changes to play a crucial role in Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s growth. Countries like Canada, China, the Middle East, and the EU have taken steps to ease restrictions and create a friendly environment to foster crypto's growth. A pro-crypto administration in the US is also set to play a crucial role in the global growth of crypto through increased institutional activity and spot Bitcoin ETFs.\par \par \uc2 Markets also expect significant technological advancements in 2025, boosting the adoption and relevance of blockchain technology in the real world. Newer sectors like AI will also see considerable growth in 2025, driving innovation. Experts have also offered predictions for BTC in 2025. While some have predicted the world\u8217\'20\'19s largest cryptocurrency could reach $150,000 by the end of the year, others have predicted it could hit $200,000.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/BTC-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC)}}}\uc2  remained relatively muted over the first weekend of the new year but managed to register marginal increases and prevent sellers from exerting influence. BTC\u8217\'20\'19s price action has picked up marginally during the ongoing session as bulls eye the $100,000 price level. Analysts believe BTC is in a consolidation phase, and markets are looking for a catalyst that could drive prices higher. Analysts expect Donald Trump\u8217\'20\'19s inauguration to boost prices. However, the excitement around a pro-crypto administration has mellowed, with markets waiting to see what a pro-crypto administration can accomplish.\par \par \uc2 BTC dipped below the 50-day SMA on Friday (December 27) when it dropped to $94,241 but recovered on Saturday to reclaim $95,000 and settle at $95,077. BTC was back in the red on Sunday, falling almost 2% and settling at $93,477. BTC experienced considerable \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Monday as buyers and sellers struggled to establish control. Sellers ultimately gained the upper hand as BTC dipped almost 1% and settled at $92,625. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment returned on Tuesday as BTC surged to an intraday high of $96,159. However, it could not go past the 50-day SMA and dropped to $93,383, ultimately registering an increase of 0.82%.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/Dt22YKjX/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buyers retained control on Wednesday as BTC registered an increase of just over 1% and settled at $94,373. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment intensified on Thursday as BTC rose almost 2.60% to go above $95,000 and settle at $96,823. With \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment persisting, BTC crossed the 20 and 50-day SMAs on Friday after registering an increase of just over 1%. The price remained relatively muted over the weekend as BTC registered only a marginal increase. However, buyers prevented sellers from taking control, with BTC ending the weekend at $98,312. The current session sees BTC up by 1.14% and trading around $99,500 as buyers eye the $100,000 mark.\par \par \uc2 BTC faces strong resistance at $100,000. If the price is rejected at this level and sellers retake control, BTC could drop to its support level of $90,000. On the other hand, if BTC crosses $100,000, its next stop will be its all-time high. Should it go above this level, we could see the beginning of another bull run.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/ETH-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum (ETH)}}}\uc2  has managed to jump above the 20 and 50-day SMAs and go above $3,500, breaking out of its recent price range. ETH had registered a substantial drop on Boxing Day, falling almost 5% to slip below the 50-day SMA and settling at $3,333. Buyers attempted a recovery on Friday as ETH reached an intraday high of $3,436. However, it lost momentum after reaching this level and fell to $3,330. ETH recovered over the weekend, rising over 2.15% on Saturday and settling at $3,402. However, it was back in the red on Sunday, dropping by 1.46% and settling at $3,352.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/4KMBM8a5/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH saw considerable \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Monday as buyers and sellers struggled to establish control. However, buyers ultimately gained the upper hand as ETH registered a marginal increase and settled at $3,558. ETH rose to an intraday high of $3,448 on Tuesday but lost momentum, dropping to $3,333, ultimately registering a decline of 0.74%. Sentiment changed on Wednesday as buyers returned to the market, registering an increase of 0.69% and settling at $3,356. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment intensified on Thursday as ETH rose almost 3% and settled at $3,452. The price surged past $3,500 and the 20 and 50-day SMAs on Friday, registering an increase of 4.51% and settling at $3,607.\par \par \uc2 Buyers retained control on Saturday, pushing ETH up by 1.37% to $3,657. However, it was back in the red on Sunday, dropping by 0.61% to $3,634. The current session sees ETH marginally up as buyers and sellers struggle to establish control.\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  (SOL) registered a sharp increase of 6.12% on Saturday (December 28) as it surged past $190 and settled at $195. However, it was back in the red on Sunday, dropping almost 3% and settling at $189. Monday saw SOL experience significant \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  as buyers and sellers struggled to establish control. Buyers ultimately won as SOL registered an increase of 0.72% and settled at $191. SOL surged to an intraday high of $199 on Tuesday. However, it lost momentum after reaching this level and fell to $189, registering a decline of just over 1%. Buyers returned to the market on Wednesday as SOL registered an increase of 2.62% and moved to $194.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/3OyRfry0/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment intensified substantially on Thursday as SOL surged past $200 and the 20-day SMA after registering an increase of over 7% and settled at $208. Buyers retained control on Friday as SOL registered an increase of almost 5% and settled at $217. However, with the resistance at $220 coming into play, SOL lost momentum on Saturday and registered a marginal drop. Selling pressure increased on Sunday as SOL dropped by 1.52% and settled at $213. SOL is currently up just over 1% as buyers look to build momentum and push above $220.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/DOGE-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE)}}}\uc2  ended the previous weekend on a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  note, dropping almost 3% and settling at $0.314. Monday saw a marginal decline as sellers retained control. However, DOGE recovered on Tuesday to register an increase of 0.89% and settle at $0.316. Buyers retained control on Wednesday as the price rose by 2.50% and moved to $0.324. DOGE continued to push higher on Thursday, registering an increase of 4.35% and settling at $0.338.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/lAc6lLih/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment intensified considerably on Friday as DOGE surged over 12% to move past the 20-day SMA and settle at $0.379. Buyers retained control on Saturday as DOGE registered an increase of almost 4% to go above the 50-day SMA and settle at $0.394. However, it was back in the red on Sunday, dropping over 3% and settling at $0.382. The current session sees DOGE marginally down as sellers look to drive it below the 50-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/XRP-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple (XRP)}}}\uc2  had been trading in a downward trajectory since the beginning of December, dropping to a low of $2.09 on Sunday (December 29). The price continued to fall on Monday, registering a drop of almost 2% and settling at $2.05. However, it recovered from this level on Tuesday, registering an increase of 1.23% and settling at $2.08. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment intensified substantially on Wednesday as XRP registered an increase of almost 12% to go above the 20-day SMA and settle at $2.32. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment waned on Thursday as XRP approached the resistance at $2.40. As a result, it registered an increase of just over 3% and settled at $2.40.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/gvKLrBkL/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP went above $2.40 on Friday after registering an increase of 2.21% and moving to $2.45. However, sellers returned to the market over the weekend as the price dropped by 1.35% on Saturday and 0.90% on Sunday. As a result, XRP fell below $0.40 and settled at $2.39. The current session sees XRP down by almost 1% as buyers look to drive the price lower.\par \par \uc2 Injective (INJ) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Injective (INJ) went past key resistance levels and moving averages as its price surged after dropping to an intraday low of $19.03 on Wednesday. INJ started the previous week in the red, dropping 1.50% after reaching an intraday high of $22.68. The price continued to drop on Tuesday, falling just over 2% to $19.59. Sentiment changed on Wednesday as INJ registered an increase of almost 5% and moved to $20.52. Buyers retained control on Thursday as INJ registered a rise of 5.76% and moved to $21.70.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/MmsPXl2Z/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment intensified on Friday as INJ went past the 20 and 200-day SMAs and settled at $23.03 after an increase of 6.16%. Momentum waned a little on Saturday as INJ registered a rise of 2.41% and settled at $23.59. However, it increased substantially on Sunday as the price rose by 7.65% and settled at $25.39. The current session sees INJ up almost 2% as buyers look to push it above the 50-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 Bittensor (TAO) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Bittensor (TAO) slipped below $450 on Tuesday after registering a decline of 2.47% and settling at $440. However, it rebounded from this level on Wednesday, surging almost 11% and settling at $489, just below the 20-day SMA. Buyers retained control on Thursday as TAO went above the 20-day SMA and $500 to settle at $521 after registering an increase of 6.61%. TAO went above the 50-day SMA on Friday after registering an increase of almost 6% and settling at $552, but not before reaching an intraday high of $571.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/SX9pAzxc/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buyers retained control on Saturday as TAO rose to an intraday high of $586. However, they lost momentum after reaching this level as the price dropped to $559 after an increase of 1.38%. TAO registered a marginal rise on Sunday to end the weekend on a positive note at $563. However, TAO is back in the red during the current session, with its price down almost 2.50% as sellers look to drive it below the 50-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020250107el1600014\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 1/06: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, XRP, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,781 \uc2 words\par \uc2 6 January 2025\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2025. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin bulls made their intentions clear by pushing the price above $100,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjUtMDEvMDE5NDNjNjEtMjg5Ny03YTU1LThhMGMtNTNiM2JiMzQ0Yzhh.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 1/06: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, XRP, BNB, SOL, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has risen above $100,000 for the first time in 2025. Continued buying by the biggest corporate Bitcoin holder may have boosted sentiment. \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2  revealed on Jan. 6 that it {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/microstrategy-2025-bitcoin-buy-1k-btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 bought 1,070 Bitcoin on Dec. 30\u8211\'20\'1331}}}\uc2 , 2024, for $101 million at an average price of $94,004. The latest purchase increased the firm\u8217\'20\'19s holding to 447,470 Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 Metalplanet CEO Simon Gerovich said in a post on X that the firm plans to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/metaplanet-bitcoin-holdings-10000-btc-in-2025"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 increase its Bitcoin holdings from 1,762 to 10,000}}}\uc2  in 2025.\par \par \uc2 Buying was also seen in cryptocurrency investment products in the first three days of the year. \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  report shows {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-etp-2025-start-585-million-inflows-coinshares"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $585 million in inflows in 2025}}}\uc2 , extending the massive $44 billion inflows in 2024.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01943c5a-dcaf-70aa-970a-d40644680726"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 While analysts are \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the long term, they are uncertain about a sharp move in Bitcoin in the near term. 10x Research\u8217\'20\'19s founder Markus Thielen said in a Jan. 5 report that Bitcoin could end January {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-momentum-trump-inaugurated-could-stalled"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 in the $97,000 to $98,000 range}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s rally above $100,000 pull altcoins higher? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index (SPX) bounced off the neckline of the head-and-shoulders pattern on Jan. 3, and the bulls pushed the price above the moving averages on Jan. 6.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01943c5b-aa5e-7a06-83ab-e39260e300ee"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day exponential moving average (5,967) is flattening out, and the relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) has risen into positive territory, indicating that the selling pressure is decreasing. Buyers will try to push the price to 6,050 and then to 6,100. Sellers are expected to fiercely defend the 6,050 to 6,100 zone, but if the bulls prevail, the index could surge toward 6,347.\par \par \uc2 The bears will have to sink the price back below the moving averages to gain the upper hand. The index could then retest the neckline.\par \par \uc2 US dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The US dollar Index (DXY) rose to 109.53 on Jan. 2, but the bulls are finding it difficult to sustain the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01943c5c-582c-789a-b8d3-020e4fdd4678"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears pulled the price to the 20-day EMA (107.77), which is an important support to watch out for. If the rebound off the 20-day EMA sustains, it will signal demand at lower levels. The bulls will then try to push the price to 111.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, a break and close below the 20-day EMA will signal that the buyers are rushing to the exit. That could deepen the correction to the 50-day simple moving average (106.42).\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has broken above the crucial resistance at $100,000, indicating that the bulls are back in the game.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01943c5c-e1f9-7dc9-b8b0-f12ee188cb96"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price maintains above $100,000, the BTC/USDT pair could accelerate toward the all-time high of $108,353. This level may witness strong selling by the bears, but if the bulls maintain pressure, the pair may resume the uptrend. The next target on the upside is $126,706.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price fails to sustain above $100,000, it will signal that the breakout may have been a bull trap. The bears will have to sink the price below the moving averages to clear the path for a decline to $90,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above $3,555 on Jan. 3, completing a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  ascending triangle formation.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01943c5d-6cb2-7445-a325-38bdf7fc2264"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($3,529) has started to turn up, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is in positive territory, indicating that the bulls are in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat. The pattern target of the breakout from the ascending triangle is $3,894.\par \par \uc2 Sellers are likely to have other plans. They will try to pull the price back below $3,555. If they do that, the short-term aggressive bulls may get trapped. That could sink the ETH/USDT pair to the uptrend line.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) is facing selling from the bears at the resistance line, but the bulls have not allowed the price to dip below the 20-day EMA ($2.29).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01943c5d-f6ec-7072-bcb5-14fae84b8522"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 That increases the likelihood of a break above the resistance line. If that happens, the XRP/USDT pair could rally to $1.73 and eventually to $2.91. Sellers are expected to fiercely defend the $2.91 level.\par \par \uc2 Time is running out for the bears. They will have to pull the price below the 20-day EMA to keep the pair stuck inside the triangle for some more time. The bears will seize control on a break and close below the support line.\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) remains stuck between the 20-day EMA ($703) and the overhead resistance of $722, indicating a tough battle between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01943c5e-88fc-719d-8b8f-8e46c5320380"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The gradually rising 20-day EMA and the RSI just above the midpoint give a slight advantage to buyers. Usually, a tight consolidation is followed by increased \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 . If the price breaks above $722, the BNB/USDT pair could pick up momentum and rally toward $794.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, a fall below the 20-day EMA will suggest that the bulls have given up. The 50-day SMA ($685) may act as support but is likely to be broken. The pair may then slump toward $635.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has broken out of the 50-day SMA ($219), indicating that the bulls are attempting to extend the recovery.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01943c5f-20aa-71a7-a1ae-3d81f076f1b7"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA ($205) and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the positive territory indicate that buyers have an edge. If the price sustains above the 50-day SMA, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could climb to $235 and then to $247.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will signal that bears remain sellers on rallies. The pair could descend to the support line, where buyers are expected to step in.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/xrp-price-chart-bull-flag-15-open-interest"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP price chart 'bull flag' targets $15 amid increasing open interest}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) rose and closed above the 50-day SMA ($0.38) on Jan. 4, signaling that the selling pressure is reducing.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01943c5f-b54c-7afb-a898-cd7337f12fa1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to pull the price back below the 50-day SMA on Jan. 5, but the bulls held their ground. If buyers drive the price above $0.40, the DOGE/USDT pair could rise to $0.43 and later to $0.48.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down and breaks below the 50-day SMA, it will suggest profit-booking by the bulls. The pair may then slide to the 20-day EMA ($0.35). That will signal a possible consolidation between $0.30 and $0.43.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) recovery is facing resistance near $1.12, but a positive sign is that the bulls have not ceded ground to the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01943c60-32fc-7bc6-b0a8-a6da428a9a9f"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping up, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is above 62, indicating that the path of least resistance is to the upside. If buyers drive the price above $1.12, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could jump to $1.20. The bears are expected to defend the $1.20 level, but if the bulls pierce the resistance, the rally could reach $1.32.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, a break below $1.05 will suggest that the bulls are losing their grip. The pair may then fall to the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) has broken out of the 50-day SMA ($43.23) on Jan. 6, indicating that the bulls are attempting a comeback.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01943c60-c619-782e-8f72-b989e8d83e7a"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The relief rally is likely to face resistance in the zone between the 50% Fibonacci retracement level of $44.70 and the 61.8% retracement level of $47.31. If the price turns down from the overhead zone, the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair could drop to the 20-day EMA ($40.97). A strong bounce off the 20-day EMA will signal a change in sentiment from selling on rallies to buying on dips.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the upside, they will have to swiftly pull the price back below the 20-day EMA. If they do that, the pair risks falling to $35.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjUtMDEvMDE5NDNjNjEtMjg5Ny03YTU1LThhMGMtNTNiM2JiMzQ0Yzhh.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020250106el16000ba\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 AI models predict the ultimate crypto portfolio for 2025\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Shiraz Jagati \par \uc2 1,276 \uc2 words\par \uc2 5 January 2025\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2025. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Here\u8217\'20\'19s a look at the different coins AI predicts will dominate the crypto landscape in 2025.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjUtMDEvMDE5NDM2Y2QtMzM0Yy03NDM1LWFkNjEtYjJjYjBkM2YxMGYw.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AI models predict the ultimate crypto portfolio for 2025}}}\par \par \uc2 With artificial intelligence {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/9-examples-of-artificial-intelligence-in-finance"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 emerging as a transformative force in finance}}}\uc2 , a number of investors have begun to recognize the potential of this technology in shaping their portfolios.\par \par \uc2 In fact, a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.mercer.com/insights/investments/portfolio-strategies/ai-in-investment-management-survey/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 recent survey}}}\uc2  revealed that 54% of all investment managers have already implemented AI within their investment research, while another 37% intend to adopt it soon.\par \par \uc2 So, what exactly is AI saying about crypto in 2025? There are a number of popular AI models \u8212\'20\'14 namely ChatGPT, \uc2 Perplexity\uc2  and Microsoft Copilot \u8212\'20\'14 that have made some surprising predictions for crypto this year.\par \par \uc2 Here are just a few:\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC)\par \par \uc2 * ChatGPT: $175,000\u8211\'20\'13$350,000\par \par \uc2 * \uc2 Perplexity\uc2 : $75,500\u8211\'20\'13$200,000\par \par \uc2 * Copilot: $175,000\u8211\'20\'13$350,000\par \par \uc2 Factors driving Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price\par \par \uc2 * Institutional adoption: Each AI model highlighted the critical role of institutional adoption, particularly emphasizing the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-etfs-near-110-b-milestone-as-analyst-calls-200k-btc-in-2025"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 impact of Bitcoin exchange-traded funds (ETFs)}}}\uc2 , such as those led by \uc2 BlackRock\uc2 . They noted that such financial instruments facilitate access for institutional and retail investors, driving demand and bolstering Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) legitimacy.\par \par \uc2 * Supply scarcity: The models all cited Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s halving mechanism as a pivotal factor, particularly the April 2024 halving that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-halving-2024-completion-confirmed"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reduced miner rewards}}}\uc2  from 6.25 BTC to 3.125 BTC. Historically, these reductions have resulted in price surges, reinforcing the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outlook of the AI models.\par \par \uc2 * Macroeconomic trends: \uc2 Perplexity\uc2  and Copilot noted that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/trump-bitcoin-us-reserve-asset-day-one-how-high-will-btc-price-go"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 favorable macroeconomic conditions}}}\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 such as the election of a pro-crypto US administration and a dovish \uc2 US Federal Reserve\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 could lay the groundwork conducive for another Bitcoin rally in 2025.\par \par \uc2 2. Ether (ETH)\par \par \uc2 * ChatGPT: Above $6,000\par \par \uc2 * \uc2 Perplexity\uc2 : $2,670\u8211\'20\'13$10,000\par \par \uc2 * Microsoft Copilot: $5,000\u8211\'20\'13$10,000\par \par \uc2 Factors driving Ether\u8217\'20\'19s price\par \par \uc2 * Ethereum 2.0 and technological upgrades: All three models emphasized the importance of Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s technological advancements, particularly its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/articles/ethereum-upgrades-a-beginners-guide-to-eth-2-0"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 transition to Ethereum 2.0}}}\uc2  alongside other improvements in scalability, energy efficiency and transaction costs.\par \par \uc2 * Burgeoning DeFi and layer-2 ecosystem: Each model also recognized Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s foundational role in decentralized finance (DeFi) and its expanding layer-2 ecosystem as a critical driver of demand and future price jumps.\par \par \uc2 * Institutional and regulatory adoption: \uc2 Perplexity\uc2  and ChatGPT agreed that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-validators-up-30-year-institutional-adoption"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 growing institutional interest}}}\uc2  and a favorable regulatory environment stand to play a significant role in boosting Ether adoption and, consequently, Ether\u8217\'20\'19s price over the coming few months.\par \par \uc2 3. Solana (SOL)\par \par \uc2 * ChatGPT: $500\u8211\'20\'13$725\par \par \uc2 * \uc2 Perplexity\uc2 : $166\u8211\'20\'13$555\par \par \uc2 * Copilot: $400\u8211\'20\'13$500\par \par \uc2 Factors driving \uc2 Solana\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s price\par \par \uc2 * Ecosystem growth: All three models highlighted \uc2 Solana\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s recent {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-adds-1-billion-worth-stablecoins-december"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 capital inflows}}}\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-flips-ethereum-top-ecosystem-new-developers"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 developer engagement}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-institutional-favorite-paypal"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 increasing adoption}}}\uc2  of native projects and tokens as critical drivers for its continued price appreciation.\par \par \uc2 * Institutional and strategic adoption: Each model pointed to \uc2 Solana\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) growing presence in institutional finance and strategic partnerships. Collaborations with major entities such as \uc2 PayPal\uc2 , Stripe and \uc2 BlackRock\uc2 -affiliated partners were recognized as key factors in reinforcing the project\u8217\'20\'19s growing adoption.\par \par \uc2 * Technological breakthroughs: While \uc2 Perplexity\uc2  emphasized \uc2 Solana\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s high throughput and low transaction costs as foundational advantages, ChatGPT highlighted {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-happened-crypto-this-weekend"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 integrations}}}\uc2  with the Firedancer Validator Client as a key factor driving the ecosystem\u8217\'20\'19s scalability and overall usability in the near term.\par \par \uc2 4. Tron (TRX)\par \par \uc2 * ChatGPT: $1.00\u8211\'20\'13$1.10\par \par \uc2 * \uc2 Perplexity\uc2 : $0.2971\u8211\'20\'13$0.378147\par \par \uc2 * Microsoft Copilot: Up to $0.73\par \par \uc2 Factors driving \uc2 Tron\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s price\par \par \uc2 * DeFi ecosystem and total value locked (TVL) metrics: Each model highlighted \uc2 Tron\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s position as the third-largest blockchain by TVL as driving substantial engagement and trust from users and investors.\par \par \uc2 * Bridging DeFi and TradFi: \uc2 Perplexity\uc2  and ChatGPT emphasized \uc2 Tron\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s growing community of over 15 million active users and stable DeFi platforms like JustLend and JustStables. On the other hand, Microsoft Copilot underscored this growth with a 64% surge in active addresses, reflecting heightened interest from both users and developers.\par \par \uc2 * Technological advancements: All of the AI models cited {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/articles/what-is-tron-trx-and-how-does-it-work-a-beginners-guide"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tron}}}\uc2  \u8217\'20\'19s scalability \u8212\'20\'14 particularly, its ability to process up to 2,000 transactions per second \u8212\'20\'14 and ongoing protocol upgrades as drivers for future price appreciation.\par \par \uc2 * Financial performance and fee dominance: ChatGPT and Copilot highlighted \uc2 Tron\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s financial success, citing its $240 million in monthly revenue milestone and its $1.3 billion in fee collection over the course of H2 2024 (surpassing Ethereum).\par \par \uc2 5. XRP\par \par \uc2 * ChatGPT: $5\u8211\'20\'13$7\par \par \uc2 * \uc2 Perplexity\uc2 : $1.44\u8211\'20\'13$4.44, with an extended target of $5.25\par \par \uc2 * Microsoft Copilot: $4.45 by mid-2025 and up to $27.50 by the end of 2025\par \par \uc2 Factors driving XRP\u8217\'20\'19s price\par \par \uc2 * Regulatory clarity: The resolution of the \uc2 US Securities and Exchange Commission{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/articles/the-sec-vs-ripple-lawsuit-everything-you-need-to-know#:~:text=However%2C%20the%20ruling%20also%20found,an%20October%202024%20deadline%20looming."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 lawsuit against Ripple Labs}}}\uc2  was highlighted by \uc2 Perplexity\uc2  and ChatGPT as being a much-needed regulatory driver to help boost XRP\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) institutional and retail confidence.\par \par \uc2 * Cross-border payment use case: All of the AI models agreed on XRP\u8217\'20\'19s established position as a bridge currency for fast, cost-effective cross-border transactions.\par \par \uc2 * Market positioning: Copilot noted XRP\u8217\'20\'19s climb to the third-largest cryptocurrency by market capitalization and surpassing BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) as a reflection of its growing prominence, while \uc2 Perplexity\uc2  and Microsoft Copilot pointed to increased whale activity and partnerships with major financial institutions as indicators of robust institutional adoption.\par \par \uc2 * RLUSD launch: Microsoft Copilot and ChatGPT highlighted the launch of \uc2 Ripple\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/rlusd-stablecoin-increase-demand-xrp-axelar-co-founder"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 RLUSD stablecoin}}}\uc2  as a potential long-term price driver for XRP.\par \par \uc2 6. Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 )\par \par \uc2 * ChatGPT: $2.42\u8211\'20\'13$3.20.\par \par \uc2 * \uc2 Perplexity\uc2 : $2.50\u8211\'20\'13$3.00\par \par \uc2 * Copilot: Expressed optimism for surpassing the $1 mark, with no specific upper limit provided.\par \par \uc2 Factors driving Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s price\par \par \uc2 * Expanding smart contract ecosystem: ChatGPT and Microsoft Copilot noted that the deployment of nearly 100,000 new smart contracts in 2024, the introduction of Plutus v3 and the Chang Hard Fork have not only enhanced Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s functionality, efficiency and overall market demand but also primed it for a solid financial showing in 2025.\par \par \uc2 * Community-led projects: \uc2 Perplexity\uc2  highlighted Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s vibrant community and initiatives like Project Catalyst as major contributors to its growth and governance.\par \par \uc2 7. Avalanche (AVAX)\par \par \uc2 * ChatGPT: $56\u8211\'20\'13$84\par \par \uc2 * \uc2 Perplexity\uc2 : $29.02\u8211\'20\'13$95.11\par \par \uc2 * \uc2 Microsoft\uc2  Copilot: $60 (mid-2025) to $100+ (end of 2025).\par \par \uc2 Factors driving Avalanche\u8217\'20\'19s price\par \par \uc2 * Recent upgrades and increased scalability: All of the models cited the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/avalanche-9000-goes-live-testnet-unlocks-rewards-builders"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Avalanche9000 upgrade}}}\uc2  as a primary reason for Avalanche\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) continued growth, especially since it reduces layer-1 deployment costs (by 99.9%) and C-Chain transaction fees (by 96%). Similarly, Microsoft Copilot highlighted the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/avalanche-introduces-evergreen-subnets-to-connect-institutions-on-blockchain"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 introduction of Subnets}}}\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 enabling independent yet interconnected blockchains to boost scalability and reliability \u8212\'20\'14 as another growth driver for \uc2 AVAX\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 * High throughput: \uc2 Perplexity\uc2  and Copilot cited {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/articles/avalanche-avax-ecosystem"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Avalanche}}}\uc2  \u8217\'20\'19s ability to process up to 6,500 transactions per second as a reason for more developers and users entering the ecosystem (thus, in turn, leading to future price appreciation).\par \par \uc2 * Decentralization: ChatGPT noted that Avalanche\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.avax.network/blog/avalanche-watch-april-2024"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 155,000 delegating addresses}}}\uc2  have made it one of the most decentralized blockchains on the market.\par \par \uc2 8. Kaspa (KAS)\par \par \uc2 * ChatGPT: $2\u8211\'20\'13$5\par \par \uc2 * \uc2 Perplexity\uc2 : $0.101 and $0.344, with a stretched target of $0.566\par \par \uc2 * Copilot: up to $0.42\par \par \uc2 Factors driving Kaspa\u8217\'20\'19s price\par \par \uc2 * GhostDAG protocol: All of the AI models highlighted Kaspa\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/articles/kaspa-kas-blockchain-how-does-it-work"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 unique GhostDAG protocol}}}\uc2  as its primary USP, noting that it allows for unparalleled transaction speeds and rapid block generation.\par \par \uc2 * DAG framework: Copilot further noted that the platform\u8217\'20\'19s Directed Acyclic Graph (DAG) structure enables it to handle high transaction throughput efficiently, making it an appealing choice for developers and investors alike in the new year.\par \par \uc2 This article is for general information purposes and is not intended to be and should not be taken as legal or investment advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjUtMDEvMDE5NDM2Y2QtMzM0Yy03NDM1LWFkNjEtYjJjYjBkM2YxMGYw.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020250106el1500009\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
