ncentives to developers, it aims to accelerate the creation of transformative decentralized applications. Analysts predict that Lightchain AI\u8217\'20\'19s strong fundamentals and innovative approach could lead to 2$ price in 2025, making it a potentially high-growthinvestment opportunity this January.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://lightchain.ai"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://lightchain.ai}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://lightchain.ai/lightchain-whitepaper.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://lightchain.ai/lightchain-whitepaper.pdf}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/LightchainAI"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://x.com/LightchainAI}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.me/LightchainProtocol"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.me/LightchainProtocol}}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored article and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020250106el150000u\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 AI models predict the ultimate crypto portfolio for 2025\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Shiraz Jagati \par \uc2 1,276 \uc2 words\par \uc2 5 January 2025\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2025. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Here\u8217\'20\'19s a look at the different coins AI predicts will dominate the crypto landscape in 2025.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy9mYTAyNjE3OWU3Njk3ZWRjYThjZGM5ZGZkYjBkOGZlMC5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AI models predict the ultimate crypto portfolio for 2025}}}\par \par \uc2 With artificial intelligence {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/9-examples-of-artificial-intelligence-in-finance"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 emerging as a transformative force in finance}}}\uc2 , a number of investors have begun to recognize the potential of this technology in shaping their portfolios.\par \par \uc2 In fact, a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.mercer.com/insights/investments/portfolio-strategies/ai-in-investment-management-survey/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 recent survey}}}\uc2  revealed that 54% of all investment managers have already implemented AI within their investment research, while another 37% intend to adopt it soon.\par \par \uc2 So, what exactly is AI saying about crypto in 2025? There are a number of popular AI models \u8212\'20\'14 namely ChatGPT, \uc2 Perplexity\uc2  and Microsoft Copilot \u8212\'20\'14 that have made some surprising predictions for crypto this year.\par \par \uc2 Here are just a few:\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC)\par \par \uc2 * ChatGPT: $175,000\u8211\'20\'13$350,000\par \par \uc2 * \uc2 Perplexity\uc2 : $75,500\u8211\'20\'13$200,000\par \par \uc2 * Copilot: $175,000\u8211\'20\'13$350,000\par \par \uc2 Factors driving Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price\par \par \uc2 * Institutional adoption: Each AI model highlighted the critical role of institutional adoption, particularly emphasizing the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-etfs-near-110-b-milestone-as-analyst-calls-200k-btc-in-2025"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 impact of Bitcoin exchange-traded funds (ETFs)}}}\uc2 , such as those led by \uc2 BlackRock\uc2 . They noted that such financial instruments facilitate access for institutional and retail investors, driving demand and bolstering Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) legitimacy.\par \par \uc2 * Supply scarcity: The models all cited Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s halving mechanism as a pivotal factor, particularly the April 2024 halving that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-halving-2024-completion-confirmed"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reduced miner rewards}}}\uc2  from 6.25 BTC to 3.125 BTC. Historically, these reductions have resulted in price surges, reinforcing the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outlook of the AI models.\par \par \uc2 * Macroeconomic trends: \uc2 Perplexity\uc2  and Copilot noted that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/trump-bitcoin-us-reserve-asset-day-one-how-high-will-btc-price-go"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 favorable macroeconomic conditions}}}\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 such as the election of a pro-crypto US administration and a dovish \uc2 US Federal Reserve\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 could lay the groundwork conducive for another Bitcoin rally in 2025.\par \par \uc2 2. Ether (ETH)\par \par \uc2 * ChatGPT: Above $6,000\par \par \uc2 * \uc2 Perplexity\uc2 : $2,670\u8211\'20\'13$10,000\par \par \uc2 * Microsoft Copilot: $5,000\u8211\'20\'13$10,000\par \par \uc2 Factors driving Ether\u8217\'20\'19s price\par \par \uc2 * Ethereum 2.0 and technological upgrades: All three models emphasized the importance of Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s technological advancements, particularly its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/articles/ethereum-upgrades-a-beginners-guide-to-eth-2-0"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 transition to Ethereum 2.0}}}\uc2  alongside other improvements in scalability, energy efficiency and transaction costs.\par \par \uc2 * Burgeoning DeFi and layer-2 ecosystem: Each model also recognized Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s foundational role in decentralized finance (DeFi) and its expanding layer-2 ecosystem as a critical driver of demand and future price jumps.\par \par \uc2 * Institutional and regulatory adoption: \uc2 Perplexity\uc2  and ChatGPT agreed that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-validators-up-30-year-institutional-adoption"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 growing institutional interest}}}\uc2  and a favorable regulatory environment stand to play a significant role in boosting Ether adoption and, consequently, Ether\u8217\'20\'19s price over the coming few months.\par \par \uc2 3. Solana (SOL)\par \par \uc2 * ChatGPT: $500\u8211\'20\'13$725\par \par \uc2 * \uc2 Perplexity\uc2 : $166\u8211\'20\'13$555\par \par \uc2 * Copilot: $400\u8211\'20\'13$500\par \par \uc2 Factors driving \uc2 Solana\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s price\par \par \uc2 * Ecosystem growth: All three models highlighted \uc2 Solana\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s recent {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-adds-1-billion-worth-stablecoins-december"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 capital inflows}}}\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-flips-ethereum-top-ecosystem-new-developers"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 developer engagement}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-institutional-favorite-paypal"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 increasing adoption}}}\uc2  of native projects and tokens as critical drivers for its continued price appreciation.\par \par \uc2 * Institutional and strategic adoption: Each model pointed to \uc2 Solana\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) growing presence in institutional finance and strategic partnerships. Collaborations with major entities such as \uc2 PayPal\uc2 , Stripe and \uc2 BlackRock\uc2 -affiliated partners were recognized as key factors in reinforcing the project\u8217\'20\'19s growing adoption.\par \par \uc2 * Technological breakthroughs: While \uc2 Perplexity\uc2  emphasized \uc2 Solana\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s high throughput and low transaction costs as foundational advantages, ChatGPT highlighted {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-happened-crypto-this-weekend"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 integrations}}}\uc2  with the Firedancer Validator Client as a key factor driving the ecosystem\u8217\'20\'19s scalability and overall usability in the near term.\par \par \uc2 4. Tron (TRX)\par \par \uc2 * ChatGPT: $1.00\u8211\'20\'13$1.10\par \par \uc2 * \uc2 Perplexity\uc2 : $0.2971\u8211\'20\'13$0.378147\par \par \uc2 * Microsoft Copilot: Up to $0.73\par \par \uc2 Factors driving \uc2 Tron\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s price\par \par \uc2 * DeFi ecosystem and total value locked (TVL) metrics: Each model highlighted \uc2 Tron\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s position as the third-largest blockchain by TVL as driving substantial engagement and trust from users and investors.\par \par \uc2 * Bridging DeFi and TradFi: \uc2 Perplexity\uc2  and ChatGPT emphasized \uc2 Tron\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s growing community of over 15 million active users and stable DeFi platforms like JustLend and JustStables. On the other hand, Microsoft Copilot underscored this growth with a 64% surge in active addresses, reflecting heightened interest from both users and developers.\par \par \uc2 * Technological advancements: All of the AI models cited {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/articles/what-is-tron-trx-and-how-does-it-work-a-beginners-guide"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tron}}}\uc2  \u8217\'20\'19s scalability \u8212\'20\'14 particularly, its ability to process up to 2,000 transactions per second \u8212\'20\'14 and ongoing protocol upgrades as drivers for future price appreciation.\par \par \uc2 * Financial performance and fee dominance: ChatGPT and Copilot highlighted \uc2 Tron\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s financial success, citing its $240 million in monthly revenue milestone and its $1.3 billion in fee collection over the course of H2 2024 (surpassing Ethereum).\par \par \uc2 5. XRP\par \par \uc2 * ChatGPT: $5\u8211\'20\'13$7\par \par \uc2 * \uc2 Perplexity\uc2 : $1.44\u8211\'20\'13$4.44, with an extended target of $5.25\par \par \uc2 * Microsoft Copilot: $4.45 by mid-2025 and up to $27.50 by the end of 2025\par \par \uc2 Factors driving XRP\u8217\'20\'19s price\par \par \uc2 * Regulatory clarity: The resolution of the \uc2 US Securities and Exchange Commission{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/articles/the-sec-vs-ripple-lawsuit-everything-you-need-to-know#:~:text=However%2C%20the%20ruling%20also%20found,an%20October%202024%20deadline%20looming."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 lawsuit against Ripple Labs}}}\uc2  was highlighted by \uc2 Perplexity\uc2  and ChatGPT as being a much-needed regulatory driver to help boost XRP\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) institutional and retail confidence.\par \par \uc2 * Cross-border payment use case: All of the AI models agreed on XRP\u8217\'20\'19s established position as a bridge currency for fast, cost-effective cross-border transactions.\par \par \uc2 * Market positioning: Copilot noted XRP\u8217\'20\'19s climb to the third-largest cryptocurrency by market capitalization and surpassing BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) as a reflection of its growing prominence, while \uc2 Perplexity\uc2  and Microsoft Copilot pointed to increased whale activity and partnerships with major financial institutions as indicators of robust institutional adoption.\par \par \uc2 * RLUSD launch: Microsoft Copilot and ChatGPT highlighted the launch of \uc2 Ripple\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/rlusd-stablecoin-increase-demand-xrp-axelar-co-founder"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 RLUSD stablecoin}}}\uc2  as a potential long-term price driver for XRP.\par \par \uc2 6. Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 )\par \par \uc2 * ChatGPT: $2.42\u8211\'20\'13$3.20.\par \par \uc2 * \uc2 Perplexity\uc2 : $2.50\u8211\'20\'13$3.00\par \par \uc2 * Copilot: Expressed optimism for surpassing the $1 mark, with no specific upper limit provided.\par \par \uc2 Factors driving Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s price\par \par \uc2 * Expanding smart contract ecosystem: ChatGPT and Microsoft Copilot noted that the deployment of nearly 100,000 new smart contracts in 2024, the introduction of Plutus v3 and the Chang Hard Fork have not only enhanced Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s functionality, efficiency and overall market demand but also primed it for a solid financial showing in 2025.\par \par \uc2 * Community-led projects: \uc2 Perplexity\uc2  highlighted Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s vibrant community and initiatives like Project Catalyst as major contributors to its growth and governance.\par \par \uc2 7. Avalanche (AVAX)\par \par \uc2 * ChatGPT: $56\u8211\'20\'13$84\par \par \uc2 * \uc2 Perplexity\uc2 : $29.02\u8211\'20\'13$95.11\par \par \uc2 * \uc2 Microsoft\uc2  Copilot: $60 (mid-2025) to $100+ (end of 2025).\par \par \uc2 Factors driving Avalanche\u8217\'20\'19s price\par \par \uc2 * Recent upgrades and increased scalability: All of the models cited the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/avalanche-9000-goes-live-testnet-unlocks-rewards-builders"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Avalanche9000 upgrade}}}\uc2  as a primary reason for Avalanche\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) continued growth, especially since it reduces layer-1 deployment costs (by 99.9%) and C-Chain transaction fees (by 96%). Similarly, Microsoft Copilot highlighted the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/avalanche-introduces-evergreen-subnets-to-connect-institutions-on-blockchain"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 introduction of Subnets}}}\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 enabling independent yet interconnected blockchains to boost scalability and reliability \u8212\'20\'14 as another growth driver for \uc2 AVAX\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 * High throughput: \uc2 Perplexity\uc2  and Copilot cited {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/articles/avalanche-avax-ecosystem"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Avalanche}}}\uc2  \u8217\'20\'19s ability to process up to 6,500 transactions per second as a reason for more developers and users entering the ecosystem (thus, in turn, leading to future price appreciation).\par \par \uc2 * Decentralization: ChatGPT noted that Avalanche\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.avax.network/blog/avalanche-watch-april-2024"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 155,000 delegating addresses}}}\uc2  have made it one of the most decentralized blockchains on the market.\par \par \uc2 8. Kaspa (KAS)\par \par \uc2 * ChatGPT: $2\u8211\'20\'13$5\par \par \uc2 * \uc2 Perplexity\uc2 : $0.101 and $0.344, with a stretched target of $0.566\par \par \uc2 * Copilot: up to $0.42\par \par \uc2 Factors driving Kaspa\u8217\'20\'19s price\par \par \uc2 * GhostDAG protocol: All of the AI models highlighted Kaspa\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/articles/kaspa-kas-blockchain-how-does-it-work"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 unique GhostDAG protocol}}}\uc2  as its primary USP, noting that it allows for unparalleled transaction speeds and rapid block generation.\par \par \uc2 * DAG framework: Copilot further noted that the platform\u8217\'20\'19s Directed Acyclic Graph (DAG) structure enables it to handle high transaction throughput efficiently, making it an appealing choice for developers and investors alike in the new year.\par \par \uc2 This article is for general information purposes and is not intended to be and should not be taken as legal or investment advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy9mYTAyNjE3OWU3Njk3ZWRjYThjZGM5ZGZkYjBkOGZlMC5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020250105el150005l\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
