\par\par \b \uc2 Crypto Price Analysis 1-3 BITCOIN: BTC, ETHEREUM: ETH, SOLANA: SOL, CHAINLINK: LINK. ALGORAND: ALGO, INTERNET COMPUTER: ICP, ETHENA: ENA\b0\par\par\uc2 Amara Khatri \par \uc2 2,710 \uc2 words\par \uc2 3 January 2025\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2025, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Should Crypto Rein In Expectations?}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC Could Hit $135,000 In 2025}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Moscow\u8217\'20\'19s Crypto Pivot}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 January To See Major Token Unlock}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-7"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Chainlink (LINK) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Algorand (ALGO) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-10"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Internet Computer (ICP) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-11"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethena (ENA) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 The crypto market has gotten off to a flying start to 2025, recovering from recent losses as investor optimism returns. Bitcoin (BTC) crossed $95,000, reaching an intraday high of $97,721 before registering a marginal drop and dropping to its current level of $96,712. The asset is up almost 2% over the past 24 hours. Ethereum (ETH) is up by 1.40%, while \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) is up by 3% as it looks to push towards $3.\par \par \uc2 With investor optimism returning, almost all cryptocurrencies registered substantial gains, including Solana (SOL), {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/DOGE-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE)}}}\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/ADA-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 )}}}\uc2 , Avalanche (AVAX), Toncoin (TON), {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/XLM-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Stellar (XLM)}}}\uc2 , Hedera (HBAR), and others. The crypto market cap jumped 1.90% and currently sits at $3.41 trillion.\par \par \uc2 Should Crypto Rein In Expectations?\par \par \uc2 Crypto investors are going into 2025 with huge expectations following \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s victory in the US elections. Stakeholders now want access to the global banking system and an end to lawsuits against major crypto companies by the \uc2 United States Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  (SEC). Expectations of a Bitcoin strategic reserve have also boosted market sentiment. However, the crypto community could be disappointed as geopolitics plans to take its own course.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 European Union\uc2  has cracked down on crypto with new rules requiring large stablecoins that facilitate trades in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2025/01/crypto-price-analysis-01-02-bitcoin-btc-ethereum-eth-solana-sol-dogecoin-doge-ripple-xrp-injective-inj-uniswap-uni"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC)}}}\uc2 , Ethereum (ETH), and other crypto assets to park 60% of their reserves in bank accounts. According to \uc2 Paolo Ardoino\uc2 , Tether Holdings Ltd. Chief Executive, believes such a high level of exposure could create a systemic risk. However, non-compliance with the EU\u8217\'20\'19s mandate could make USDT, the world\u8217\'20\'19s largest stablecoin, inaccessible to European investors.\par \par \uc2 Countries in Asia also have their own plans for blockchain and crypto. China and Russia want to use blockchain to counter the Dollar\u8217\'20\'19s hegemony and the idea of decentralized finance (DeFi). With so many factors to consider, 2025 could become a tumultuous year for crypto.\par \par \uc2 BTC Could Hit $135,000 In 2025\par \par \uc2 A Russian expert claimed that Bitcoin (BTC) could hit $135,000 in 2025, while another stated that it could become a \u8220\'20\'1Csuper currency\u8221\'20\'1D for Moscow. The claims of BTC reaching $135,000 were made by Evgeny Shatov. However, Shatov believes a slowdown could come after BTC reaches this level, with a consolidation phase expected later in the year.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBitcoin is making a smooth move into the distribution zone. And altcoin season is starting on the market. A range of scenarios are now potentially possible. But, most likely, the growth of the bitcoin price in the first half of the year will slow down.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 He also noted that BTC\u8217\'20\'19s dominance index stands at almost 57%, increasing by almost 7% since the beginning of the year.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CApparently, this phase has come to an end. And the index will continue to fall against the backdrop of an increase in the number of altcoins and growth in their total capitalization. For comparison: in 2017, this index fluctuated around 90%. And during 2021, it fell from 60% to 40%. As such, the market is gradually entering a phase of altcoin growth.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Moscow\u8217\'20\'19s Crypto Pivot\par \par \uc2 Russia\u8217\'20\'19s crypto pivot looks set to continue in 2025, with columnist Olga Samofalova stating the country had found a super currency in Bitcoin. Samofalova stated that Russia urgently needed a currency for cross-border payments following sanctions by the United States and other Western nations. While discussing the digital ruble, the columnist noted that it could be tracked the same way as non-cash currencies, adding it was impossible to track BTC transactions, allowing Russia to evade sanctions.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CHowever, Bitcoin is a super currency in this regard. Bitcoin does not depend on the \uc2 Russian Central Bank\uc2 , or any other central bank, or on the policies of the \uc2 US Federal Reserve\uc2  or the White House. It is issued through mining according to a pre-established algorithm and without the intervention of any central bank. How can sanctions be imposed here? There\u8217\'20\'19s no way. In terms of bypassing sanctions, Bitcoin simply has no equal.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 January To See Major Token Unlock\par \par \uc2 According to data from Tokenomist, the crypto industry faces approximately $7 billion in token unlocks in January. Token unlocks gradually release tokens into the market and prevent sell-offs by early investors and team members. However, it still has a substantial impact on prices. January will witness a mix of cliff unlocks and steady releases. Cliff unlocks are large one-time releases, while linear unlocks distribute the tokens throughout the month.\par \par \uc2 The first week of the month will see $1 billion worth of unlocks, with another $3.7 billion to be unlocked between January 13 and 19. The market has already seen the unlock of 64.19 million SUI tokens worth $270 million on January 1. ZetaChain also unlocked 54 million ZETA tokens worth $42 million to fund growth initiatives and advisory roles. Other significant unlocks set to occur in January include Kaspas (182.23 million), Ethena (12 million), Optimism (31.34 million), Solana ($14M worth of tokens daily), \uc2 Worldcoin\uc2  ($12.4M worth of tokens daily), Celestia ($5.1M worth of tokens daily), Avalanche ($4.02M worth of tokens daily), and Polkadot ($2.94M worth of tokens daily).\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 The crypto markets have started the year on a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  note, with {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/BTC-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC)}}}\uc2  surpassing $95,000 after witnessing a considerable decline at the end of 2024. After finding support around $92,000, BTC bulls are aiming for the $100,000 mark again. If the support level holds and BTC continues its current rally, it will retest the $100,000 level again. A successful close above this level could see the asset retest its all-time high, set in December, and potentially push on to $110,000.\par \par \uc2 Looking at the price chart, BTC dipped to $95,691 on Thursday after registering a substantial drop of almost 4% from the 20-day SMA. Buyers attempted a recovery on Friday but were unsuccessful, as sellers took control, pushing BTC below the 50-day SMA and $95,000 to $94,827. BTC recovered on Saturday as the price rose by 0.89% and settled at $95,077. However, it could not move past the 50-day SMA, falling back into the red on Sunday and dropping almost 2% to $93,477.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/2gLivB7t/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Sellers retained control on Monday as BTC started the current week with a drop of 0.91% and settled at $92,625. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment returned on Tuesday as BTC surged to an intraday high of $96,159. However, it lost momentum after being rejected at the 50-day SMA thanks to considerable selling pressure. As a result, BTC dropped back to $93,383, registering an increase of 0.82%. Buyers retained control on Wednesday, rising just over 1% and settling at $94,373. Thursday saw buyer activity increase as BTC rose by 2.60% and settled at $96,823. However, it could not go above the 50-day SMA as buyers lost momentum. The current session sees BTC down by almost 1%, trading around $95,998.\par \par \uc2 If sellers retain control BTC could drop to the $92,000 support level. If the price recovers from this level, it could retest the $100,000 level. If it continues to push higher, we could see a retest of its all-time high.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/ETH-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum (ETH)}}}\uc2  has been trading in a narrow range since Wednesday after failing to move past the 50-day SMA. As a result, ETH registered a substantial drop on Thursday, dropping almost 5% and settling at $3,333. Buyers attempted a recovery on Friday as ETH rose to an intraday high of $3,436 before losing momentum. As a result, ETH dropped to $3,331, registering a marginal drop. The price recovered on Saturday, registering an increase of 2.14% to go above $3,400 and settle at $3,402. However, it was back in the red on Sunday, dropping by 1.46% and settling at $3,352.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/FbSxZHDx/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH experienced considerable \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Monday as buyers and sellers struggled to establish control. As a result, the price reached an intraday high of $3,433 and dropped to an intraday low of $3,298 before settling at $3,358. However, buyers lost momentum on Tuesday despite reaching an intraday high of $3,448, dropping by 0.74% and settling at $3,333. ETH recovered on Wednesday, rising by 0.68% to $3,356. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment intensified on Thursday as ETH registered an increase of 2.83% to reach an intraday high of $3,505 before settling at $3,451. With the 20 and 50-day SMAs acting as resistance, ETH is back in the red during the ongoing session, down almost 1% and trading around $3,450.\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  (SOL) finally surged past $200 on Thursday as \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment picked up, with buyers now eying the $220 price level. SOL was quite \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  leading up to the current week, falling to $184 on Friday. However, it made a strong recovery on Saturday, registering an increase of over 6% and settling at $195. Sunday saw sellers return to the market as SOLl dropped almost 3% and settled at $189. SOL experienced considerable \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Monday as buyers and sellers jostled for control. As a result, SOL fell to an intraday low of $185 and rose to an intraday high of $196 before settling at $191, an increase of 0,72%.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/Vt698SpZ/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL reached an intraday high of $199 on Tuesday as buyers attempted to surpass $200. However, they fell short as SOL lost momentum, allowing sellers to take control. As a result, SOL fell just over 1% and settled at $189. Buyers returned to the market on Wednesday, with SOL registering an increase of 2.62% and settling at $194. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment intensified substantially on Thursday as SOL rocketed past $200 and the 20-day SMA, registering a rise of 7.26% and settling at $208. The current session sees SOL marginally down as buyers and sellers struggle to establish control.\par \par \uc2 If sellers retain control, SOL could dip below $200. On the other hand, if buyers regain control and push above $210, SOL could retest the resistance at $220. A break above this level could see a jump toward $250.\par \par \uc2 Chainlink (LINK) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/LINK-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Chainlink (LINK)}}}\uc2  failed to go above the 20-day SMA last week, losing momentum after reaching $25.42 on Tuesday. As a result, sellers took over, pushing the price down by almost 4% on Wednesday to $24.42. Selling pressure grew on Thursday as LINK fell over 7% and settled at $22.66. LINK attempted a recovery on Friday as it rose to an intraday high of $23.64. However, it lost momentum after reaching this level and fell almost 5% to $21.54. The price recovered on Saturday, rising just over 2% and moving to $21.97 before dropping by 4.70% on Sunday and ending the weekend at $20.94.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/CQe15ljb/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Sellers retained control as LINK began the current week, falling 1.74%, going below the 50-day SMA, and settling at $20.57. The price continued to drop on Tuesday, slipping below its support level and settling at $19.99. However, it recovered on Wednesday to register an increase of 8.55% to reclaim $20 and go above the 50-day SMA to settle at $21.70. Buyers retained control on Thursday, pushing LINK up by 1.64% to $22.05. The current session sees LINK down 1.30% as sellers look to drive it below the 20-day SMA and the $20 support level.\par \par \uc2 Algorand (ALGO) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Algorand (ALGO) was quite \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  last week after failing to go above $0.40 on Tuesday. As a result, sellers took over on Tuesday, driving the price down just over 4% on Wednesday to $0.380. Sellers retained control on Thursday as ALGO fell over 9% and settled at $0.346. Buyers attempted a recovery on Friday as ALGO rose to an intraday high of $0.346 before losing momentum and dropping almost 4% to $0.333. The price recovered on Saturday, increasing by 3.15% and settling at $0.344. However, it was back in the red on Sunday, dropping by 5.43% to go below the 50-day SMA and settle at $0.325.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/P5K6L8tQ/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The current week began with ALGO experiencing considerable \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  as sellers attempted to drive it lower while buyers attempted to reclaim lost ground. Buyers ultimately gained the upper hand, pushing the price up almost 1% to $0.328. ALGO remained positive on Tuesday despite experiencing \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 , rising 1.70% and settling at $0.333. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment intensified considerably on Wednesday, surging almost 13% to go above the 20 and 50-day SMAs and settling at $0.377. Buyers retained control on Thursday, rising nearly 4% and settling at $0.391. The current session sees ALGO up over 4% and trading around $0.410.\par \par \uc2 Internet Computer (ICP) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Internet Computer (ICP) dropped below the 50-day SMA on Thursday after registering a drop of almost 8% and settling at $10.30. Sellers retained control on Friday, thwarting an attempted recovery and driving the price down by just over 1% to $10.19. ICP recovered on Saturday, registering a rise of almost 5% and moving to $10.67. However, it was back in the red on Sunday, dropping nearly 5% and settling at $10.14. ICP faced significant \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Monday as buyers and sellers attempted to establish control. Sellers ultimately gained the upper hand and pushed ICP down by 1.28% to $10.01.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/Sf2Puai8/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 ICP slipped below $10 on Tuesday, falling to $9.87 after a drop of 1.40%. However, it recovered on Wednesday, surging over 6% to reclaim $10 and settle at $10.48. Buyers retained control on Thursday as ICP registered an increase of 1.81% to settle at $10.67, just short of the 20-day SMA. ICP has gone above the 20-day SMA and $11 in the current session and is up almost 5% to trade around $11.16. If buyers retain control, we could see ICP test the resistance at $11.50 and go above the 50-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 Ethena (ENA) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Ethena (ENA) is struggling to go above the 20-day SMA as it faces considerable resistance at this level. ENA dipped below the 20-day SMA on Wednesday after registering a decline of 2.84% and settling at $1.02. Selling pressure intensified substantially on Thursday as ENA dropped by 9.50% to go below $1 and settle at $0.927. Buyers attempted a recovery on Friday as the price rose to an intraday high of $0.993. However, it lost momentum after reaching this level and dropped by 2.34% to $0.906. The weekend began with a sharp recovery as ENA rose over 4% to $0.946. Despite a positive showing on Saturday, ENA was back in the red on Sunday, registering a marginal drop to end the weekend at $0.944.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/6KPItmbo/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The current week began with ENA surging to an intraday high of $1.02 before settling at $0.953. It was back in the red on Tuesday, dropping over 5% and settling at $0.905. However, \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment returned on Wednesday as ENA registered an increase of almost 6% and moved to $0.958. ENA continued to push higher on Thursday, rising nearly 8% to reclaim $1 and settle at $1.03. The current session sees ENA up almost 1%, trading above the 20-day SMA at $1.04.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020250104el130000b\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 1/3: BTC, ETH, XRP, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , LINK, TON\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,689 \uc2 words\par \uc2 3 January 2025\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2025. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin opened the year with a bang and looks set to reclaim the $100,000 level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjUtMDEvMDE5NDJkMGItMGM0ZC03MWVlLTgxYjYtZDI4MGY4MWJjYzEy.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 1/3: BTC, ETH, XRP, BNB, SOL, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, LINK, TON}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) bulls are maintaining the pressure and are likely to test the stiff overhead resistance at $100,000 soon. Although the recovery has been strong, the relief rally on Jan. 2 was greeted by profit booking by the United States spot Bitcoin exchange-traded fund investors. The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/blackrock-ibit-record-outflow-331-million-january-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETFs witnessed $242.3 million in outflows}}}\uc2 , per Farside Investors data.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s hesitation to cross above $100,000 has not altered its long-term view. Steno Research said in a research note that 2025 is likely to be the best year for cryptocurrency markets ever. They expect {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/2025-crypto-best-year-yet-steno-research"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin to hit more than $150,000}}}\uc2  and Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) to cross $8,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01942cf2-7182-77d6-a0af-1ea1c8dfbbc8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Chainlink, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Even if Bitcoin dips, analysts view it as a buying opportunity. Investment research firm Bravo Research said in its latest Macro Report on Dec. 31 that Bitcoin could \u8220\'20\'1Ccatch down to stocks\u8217\'20\'19 weakness.\u8221\'20\'1D However, Bravos considers the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/parabolic-bitcoin-a-buy-80k-btc-price-stocks-research"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 dip to $80,000 as a buying opportunity}}}\uc2  for the next leg higher.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin rise above $100,000, pulling the altcoins higher? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has recovered to the moving averages, indicating that the bulls are defending the $90,000 level with all their might.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01942cf2-f220-72f9-85bb-5598a40477f7"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Chainlink, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages have flattened out, and the relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) is just above the midpoint, indicating a possible consolidation in the near term. The BTC/USDT pair could swing between $100,000 and $90,000 for some time.\par \par \uc2 If buyers thrust the price above $100,000, the pair is likely to retest the all-time high at $108,353. Alternatively, a break and close below $90,000 will clear the path for a decline to the solid support at $85,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether is forming a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  ascending triangle pattern, which will complete on a close above $3,555.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01942cf3-90e1-7dec-b07a-dd0a573284b3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Chainlink, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day exponential moving average ($3,478) and the RSI just above the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. If the price closes above $3,555, the ETH/USDT pair may jump to the pattern target of $3,894.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup will be negated if the price turns down and breaks below the uptrend line. That could pull the price down to $3,100 and later to $3,000. Buyers are expected to defend the $3,000 level with vigor.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the support line of the symmetrical triangle pattern on Dec. 31 and reached the resistance line on Jan. 3.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01942cf4-34d2-7e84-8458-5b1059b049cf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Chainlink, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 Sellers are expected to aggressively defend the resistance line. If the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA ($2.24), it will suggest that the XRP/USDT pair may remain inside the triangle for a while.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, a break and close above the triangle will signal that the uncertainty has resolved in favor of the bulls. That increases the possibility of a rally to the overhead resistance at $2.91.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) price is squeezed between the 20-day EMA ($698) and the overhead resistance at $722.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01942cf4-e007-7108-873d-b79e367550d1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Chainlink, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 Generally, a tight consolidation is followed by a range expansion, but it is difficult to predict the direction of the breakout. If the price breaks and closes above $722, it will signal that the bulls have overpowered the bears. That will clear the path for a rally to $760 and subsequently to $794.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price plunges below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bulls have given up. The pair may drop to the 50-day simple moving average ($679) and eventually to $635.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) surged above the 20-day EMA ($201) on Jan. 2, indicating that the selling pressure is reducing.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01942cf5-6930-718f-a165-5c9d9928cf60"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Chainlink, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could rise to the 50-day SMA ($219), which is expected to pose a substantial challenge. If buyers overcome the resistance at the 50-day SMA, the pair could rally to $234.\par \par \uc2 The zone between the 20-day EMA and the uptrend line is likely to act as a strong support on any dips. Sellers will be back in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat if they sink and maintain the price below the uptrend line.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) consolidation between $0.30 and $0.35 resolved to the upside on Jan. 3, indicating that the bulls are back in the game.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01942cf5-fced-7599-8443-a099ca9ca5f2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Chainlink, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are flattening out, pointing to a possible range-bound action in the near term. If bulls push the price above the 50-day SMA ($0.38), the DOGE/USDT pair could rally to $0.42. Sellers are expected to mount a strong defense at $0.42. If the price turns down from $0.42, the pair could fall to the 20-day EMA ($0.34).\par \par \uc2 Time is running out for the bears. They will have to pull the price below $0.30 to start a deeper correction to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.27.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) turned up sharply on Jan. 1, and the bulls pushed the price above the neckline of the head-and-shoulders pattern on Jan. 3.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01942cf6-868a-705e-910c-10a23e26ebad"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Chainlink, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The move above the neckline may have trapped the aggressive bears, who rushed to close their positions. That resulted in a short squeeze, propelling the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair toward $1.20. Sellers are expected to defend the zone between $1.20 and $1.33.\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are likely to act as a strong support during pullbacks. Sellers will have to tug the price below the moving averages to gain the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-happened-in-crypto-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Here\u8217\'20\'19s what happened in crypto today}}}\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) turned up from the $35 support on Jan. 1, indicating that the bulls are attempting a comeback.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01942cf7-16c4-749e-b4fb-d6de8d9b87b4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Chainlink, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The relief rally is expected to face selling at the 50-day SMA ($42.67). If the price turns down sharply from the 50-day SMA, the bears will again try to sink the AVAX/USDT pair below the $35 to $33.50 support zone. If they manage to do that, the pair could sink to $32 and later to $30.50.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if buyers drive the pair above the 50-day SMA, it will suggest that the correction may be over. The pair could then gradually rise to $48.\par \par \uc2 Chainlink price analysis\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/chainlink-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the neckline of the H&S pattern, indicating that the bulls are fiercely defending the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01942cf7-a161-7cc3-8f23-1348b755741e"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Chainlink, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The up move is likely to face selling at the 20-day EMA ($22.64), but if the bulls prevail, the LINK/USDT pair could rise to $26. Such a move will signal that the bears are losing their grip.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down sharply from the 20-day EMA, it will put the $20 level at risk of a breakdown. If that happens, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup will complete, resulting in a fall to $16.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/toncoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TON}}}\uc2  ) bulls are trying to start a recovery, which is expected to face stiff resistance at the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/01942cf8-2af8-720e-b103-e32449bf81db"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Chainlink, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the moving averages and breaks below $5.40, it will signal that the bears remain in control. That increases the likelihood of a drop to the $4.72 to $4.44 support zone.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if buyers drive the price above the moving averages, it will signal buying at lower levels. The TON/USDT pair could rise to $6.50 and later to $7, where the bears are expected to mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjUtMDEvMDE5NDJkMGItMGM0ZC03MWVlLTgxYjYtZDI4MGY4MWJjYzEy.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020250103el13000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin traders see 'massive' $130K+ BTC price next as TradFi returns\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 637 \uc2 words\par \uc2 2 January 2025\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2025. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin traders see the bull market taking BTC price above $130,000 next.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjUtMDEvMDE5NDI1ZjgtYTFiMC03NDAwLTk4YTktMzBiNDBhNmYyYmY3.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin traders see 'massive' $130K+ BTC price next as TradFi returns}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin continued a rebound on Jan. 2 as $95,000 returned ahead of the first Wall Street open of 2025.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/019425f8-c42d-7c68-8657-c5fe445fc377"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin traders see 'massive' $130K+ BTC price next as TradFi returns}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 $130,000 BTC price \u8220\'20\'1Cfeels inevitable\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://subscription.cointelegraph.com/?_gl=1*7499wx*_ga*MTQ0MzQ0NzI4Ny4xNzE2MzY1NTA0*_ga_53R24TEEB1*MTcxNjM2NTUwNC4xLjEuMTcxNjM2Njg2MC4wLjAuMA.."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  tracked BTC price gains of 1.5% on the day, taking BTC/USD to $95,880 on \uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 After revisiting monthly lows to start the week, Bitcoin (BTC) showed strength as a long-expected {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-extends-losses-traders-sub-90k-btc-price-support"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 deeper support retest}}}\uc2  failed to materialize.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CChristmas Range has swept both sides for liquidity now,\u8221\'20\'1D trader Daan Crypto Trades wrote in one of his {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/DaanCrypto/status/1874436872333836761"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 most recent posts}}}\uc2  on X.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CMid range at $95.8K has been acting as resistance on the most recent test.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/019425f4-7d1a-7f38-ae52-b187b1639ca6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin traders see 'massive' $130K+ BTC price next as TradFi returns}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT perp 1-hour chart. Source: Daan Crypto Trades/X\par \par \uc2 An accompanying chart showed increased volume at the range lows, something that came as various market metrics began to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/improving-bitcoin-price-metrics-highlight-bears-dwindling-confidence-in-sub-95-k-btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 turn in bulls\u8217\'20\'19 favor}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI\u8217\'20\'19d recommend keeping track of when this range breaks out to either side. Should give a good idea of where this moves over the next 1-2 weeks,\u8221\'20\'1D Daan Crypto Trades added.\par \par \uc2 Continuing, fellow trader Jelle reiterated the similarities between BTC price action this new year and last, drawing comparisons to a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-risks-20k-crash-5-things-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 chart fractal}}}\uc2  that ultimately resolved to the upside.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe similarities are there, with or without another sweep of the lows,\u8221\'20\'1D he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/CryptoJelleNL/status/1874715544768917519"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  in his own X post.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CComfy in spot, the next leg higher is right around the corner.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/019425f5-1fee-7dc8-a927-e2e77e0357cc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin traders see 'massive' $130K+ BTC price next as TradFi returns}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD chart. Source: Jelle/X\par \par \uc2 Jelle subsequently {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/CryptoJelleNL/status/1874717361674371346"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 predicted}}}\uc2  that a trip to between $130,000 and $150,000 would result from the breakout.\par \par \uc2 Other market participants held similar views, showing faith in the strength of the Bitcoin bull market despite the holiday lull.\par \par \uc2 Entrepreneur and investor Jason Williams was among them, calling for a similar new all-time high for BTC/USD this quarter.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1C$BTC has re-entered the accumulation zone,\u8221\'20\'1D he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/GoingParabolic/status/1873491933500485709"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told}}}\uc2  X followers on Dec. 30.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIn my view, a few weeks of consolidation could set the stage for a massive breakout. $131.5K+ by Q1 2025 feels inevitable. See you there.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2025-01/019425f5-894c-791c-85b6-19204d3b3a7d"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin traders see 'massive' $130K+ BTC price next as TradFi returns}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 2-day chart. Source: Jason Williams/X\par \par \uc2 Williams\u8217\'20\'19 chart took a longer-term view, likening the December range to that seen after old all-time highs hit in March last year. As {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-can-go-parabolic-btc-price-above-71-5-k-analysis"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph reported}}}\uc2 , the rangebound BTC price action that resulted ended up lasting more than seven months.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin, crypto tipped for new year liquidity push\par \par \uc2 Equally \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the return of \u8220\'20\'1CTradFi\u8221\'20\'1D traders, meanwhile, Cole Kennelly, founder of crypto \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  index service Volmex, forecasts a broader \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  comeback for risk assets.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-1-1-btc-eth-xrp-bnb-sol-doge-ada-avax-link-ton"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 1/1: BTC, ETH, XRP, BNB, SOL, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, LINK, TON}}}\par \par \uc2 These suffered in the second half of December, in particular, on the back of a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-dips-92k-optimal-dip-buying-pce-crypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 hawkish tone}}}\uc2  set by the \uc2 US Federal Reserve\uc2  after its latest interest rate cut.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CMy gut tells me the market goes full risk on and a lot of money piles into crypto, now that end of year logistics / rebalancing / etc is over,\u8221\'20\'1D Kennelly {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/ColeGotTweets/status/1874655680281649417"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 wrote}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CShould be a big next two days.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjUtMDEvMDE5NDI1ZjgtYTFiMC03NDAwLTk4YTktMzBiNDBhNmYyYmY3.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020250102el120002x\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
