\par\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Drops to $93K While Husky Inu (HINU) Presale Soars\b0\par\par\uc2 Jana Serfontein \par \uc2 846 \uc2 words\par \uc2 30 December 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 )}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Stellar (XLM)}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Shiba Inu (SHIB)}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu (HINU) Expected Surge Upon Exchange Listing}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and the altcoins have dominated headlines in 2024 for their immense gains. Despite a fabulous rally in November, the entire market pulled back, and BTC now trades at around $93,000.\par \par \uc2 Altcoins have dominated the headlines recently with continued gains as we near the altcoin season. Large-cap altcoins, including Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), Shiba Inu (SHIB) and Stellar (XLM), grabbed attention for their immense gains in November and have the market on their toes as to what will happen with their prices when we finally enter the altcoin season.\par \par \uc2 Join us as we explore the top gainers and potential winners as the altcoin season inches closer.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 )\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) is another major gainer since Donald Trump\u8217\'20\'19s election victory. On-chain metrics show Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s weekly active addresses elevated since the crypto market rally triggered by Trump\u8217\'20\'19s win on November 6 began. The surge in network usage and whale buying activity has resulted in a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outlook for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  further surged after the Cardano blockchain developers, the Cardano Foundation, released an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cardanofoundation.org/blog/proposal-for-cardano-constitution"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 updated proposal for the Cardano Constitution}}}\uc2  to improve network governance. The revised proposal includes changes to constitutional workshops, social media discussion, and expert and community feedback. The changes aim to \u8220\'20\'1Cimprove the accessibility and clarity of the Cardano governance framework,\u8221\'20\'1D shifting its focus to a less technical audience. Interest in Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) surged after its founder, \uc2 Charles Hoskinson\uc2 , revealed plans to help shape US crypto policy under Donald Trump\u8217\'20\'19s incoming administration.\par \par \uc2 Stellar (XLM)\par \par \uc2 Stellar (XLM) made headlines in recent months for its massive gains. The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://stellar.org/learn/lumens"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Stellar network}}}\uc2  is similar to the \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) network - a decentralised payment platform and cryptocurrency that facilitates quick and low-cost cross-border payments, promoting financial inclusion for individuals and businesses globally. The Stellar network was created to support digital representations of any currency but has its native token called Lumens (XLM). Developed as a fork of the \uc2 Ripple\uc2  protocol, Stellar aims to create a global network connecting financial institutions, payment processors, and individual users, making cross-border money transfer easier and providing access to essential financial services.\par \par \uc2 XLM, in conjunction with XRP, is expected to play a significant role in the new global financial system. XRP is uniquely designed to optimize institutional liquidity for cross-border transactions. At the same time, XLM\u8217\'20\'19s infrastructure was built to facilitate peer-to-peer transactions and retail-level remittances efficiently. Financial experts envision a two-tiered monetary framework using XRP and XLM at different levels for specific purposes.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu (SHIB)\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/shiba-inu/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Shiba Inu (SHIB)}}}\uc2  is one of the top-selling memecoins with a market cap exceeding $12.4 billion. The decentralized community-led token and its reputation as the \u8220\'20\'1CDogecoin Killer\u8221\'20\'1D has yielded impressive rewards in the past year, gaining over 230%. SHIB is also a proud member of the \uc2 Solana\uc2  network and is Husky Inu\u8217\'20\'19s best friend. The memecoin quickly rose to fame in the crypto industry and has since become a household name. SHIB, launched in 2020, is currently the 14th largest crypto by market cap and the second biggest memecoin after Dogecoin (DOGE). This decentralized, community-led project and its native token, SHIB, quickly gained the attention of its dedicated community of investors thanks to its charm and support from industry giants such as Ethereum co-founder \uc2 Vitalik Buterin\uc2  and \uc2 Tesla\uc2  CEO \uc2 Elon Musk\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Husky Inu (HINU) Expected Surge Upon Exchange Listing\par \par \uc2 As BTC trades at around $93,000 and top altcoins reach new heights, investors must look for well-priced alternative investment opportunities to profit from the bull run, and Husky Inu is precisely that.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://thehuskyinu.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu (HINU)}}}\uc2  is the latest Solana-based memecoin to grace the market. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/top-memecoins-to-invest-in-hinu-shib-floki-and-doge"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu}}}\uc2  was created to bring its holders more value and utility by leveraging this powerful blockchain. The project and its native token, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/exciting-memecoins-to-watch-in-2024-shib-floki-doge-and-hinu"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HINU}}}\uc2 , want to make their mark on the saturated memecoin market by building a supportive community with innovative features and enhanced rewards. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/solana-memecoins-to-watch-hinu-maga-bonk-and-dawgz"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu}}}\uc2  recently launched the presale for HINU, and the fundraising has attracted a fair amount of attention. Since going live, the presale has generated over $680,000 and will soon reach its fundraising target.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/solanas-superstar-memecoins-hinu-wif-bonk-and-maga"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu}}}\uc2  is working on some exciting things, including an Earn App and a Decentralized Exchange. The Earn App will reward users with HINU tokens for engaging with the project, and the Decentralized Exchange will facilitate decentralized trading to improve utility and value for HINU holders. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/10/5-cheap-memecoins-poised-to-make-millionaires"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu}}}\uc2  boasts several unique features that set it apart from traditional investment opportunities, including a capped token supply, a deflationary mechanism, speedy transactions, and charity voting.\par \par \uc2 Visit the following links for more information on Husky Inu:\par \par \uc2 Website: Husky Inu Official Website\par \par \uc2 Twitter\uc2 : {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/huskyinureal"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu Twitter}}}\par \par \uc2 Telegram: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.me/thehuskyinu"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu Telegram}}}\par \par \uc2 Discl