\par\par \b \uc2 Crypto Price Analysis 12-30- BITCOIN: BTC, ETHEREUM: ETH, SOLANA: SOL, DOGWIFHAT: WIF, CHAINLINK: LINK, ARBITRUM: ARB, IMMUTABLE: IMX\b0\par\par\uc2 Amara Khatri \par \uc2 2,447 \uc2 words\par \uc2 30 December 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 What To Expect In 2025}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 VC Funding To Be Stronger In 2025}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogwifhat (WIF) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-7"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Chainlink (LINK) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Arbitrum (ARB) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Immutable (IMX) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) looks set to end 2024 below the $100,000 mark unless a major bump in price occurs before the year ends. The cryptocurrency spent most of the weekend hovering just above $95,000. However, it dipped significantly late on Sunday night and by early Monday morning had dipped to a low of $92,942 before recovering to its current level of $93,690, down almost 1.50% over the past 24 hours.\par \par \uc2 Several other cryptocurrencies, including Ethereum (ETH), {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/XRP-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple (XRP)}}}\uc2 , and Solana (SOL), registered notable losses. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/DOGE-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE)}}}\uc2 , Toncoin (TON), {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/ADA-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 )}}}\uc2 , Polkadot (DOT), {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/XLM-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Stellar (XLM)}}}\uc2 , and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/LTC-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Litecoin (LTC)}}}\uc2  also recorded substantial losses.\par \par \uc2 What To Expect In 2025\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/12/crypto-price-analysis-12-27-bitcoin-btc-ethereum-eth-solana-sol-dogecoin-doge-ripple-xrp-uniswap-uni-injective-inj"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC)}}}\uc2  and the cryptocurrency market have capped a hugely successful 2024, with analysts, traders, and institutions optimistic about 2025 and further price increases. BTC saw a considerable rally at the beginning of the year following the approval of spot Bitcoin ETFs, which sparked interest in the asset. This was followed by the Bitcoin halving event, slashing the number of BTC awarded to miners, creating an imbalance between demand and supply, sending the price higher. Donald Trump\u8217\'20\'19s victory in November acted as the catalyst needed for BTC to cross the $100,000 mark for the first time.\par \par \uc2 Trump\u8217\'20\'19s victory is being seen as a game-changing development for the crypto industry, with the President-elect making several promises on the campaign trail, including creating a strategic Bitcoin reserve. Trump has also nominated \uc2 Paul Atkins\uc2 , known for his crypto-friendly views, as SEC Chair. However, markets have adopted a wait-and-watch stance. \uc2 Delphi Ventures\uc2  General Counsel Sarag Brennan stated,\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CTrump\u8217\'20\'19s stance on [decentralized finance (DeFi)] and crypto has been somewhat inconsistent. While he has expressed interest in the space, much of his focus seems limited to supporting dollar dominance and real estate applications.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Now, let\u8217\'20\'19s talk about BTC. Analysts expect the world\u8217\'20\'19s largest cryptocurrency to reach $200,000, while \uc2 VanEck\uc2  has taken a slightly conservative stance, predicting it will reach $180,000. While such predictions have been made in the past, BTC\u8217\'20\'19s jump above $100,000 shows nothing is out of reach for the asset. With the asset approaching its 21 million limit, demand is picking up and will send its price surging. Some economists and analysts have called BTC\u8217\'20\'19s current price action a \u8220\'20\'1Csupercycle.\u8221\'20\'1D However, the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  could crash the BTC party after significantly scaling back rate cuts for 2025 and going on record to state it is not allowed to hold BTC.\par \par \uc2 But will BTC\u8217\'20\'19s rally spill over to altcoins? Analysts and market watchers expect friendlier regulations. This is why many institutions have already sent applications for ETFs related to major altcoins like XRP, indicating the market is ready to shift beyond BTC and ETH.\par \par \uc2 VC Funding To Be Stronger In 2025\par \par \uc2 According to PitchBook analyst Robert Le, VC funding will be significantly stronger in 2025 compared to 2024. According to Le, 2023 was a challenging year for crypto funding due to several market factors, including the collapse of \uc2 FTX\uc2 , which led to an erosion of trust and higher interest rates. However, 2024 started positively, with markets picking up momentum following the launch of spot Bitcoin ETFs.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe\u8217\'20\'19re going to see $18 billion or more in venture capital dollars that\u8217\'20\'19s going to be invested into crypto. That\u8217\'20\'19s a 50% increase from 2024 but still less than the roughly $30 billion \u8220\'20\'1Cthat was invested in 2021 and 2022.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/BTC-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC)}}}\uc2  has seen quite a slump since it hit its new all-time high of $108,268. Since then, BTC has slipped below $100,000 and has struggled to regain momentum and resume its upward trajectory. BTC has failed to reclaim the $100,000, going below it on Thursday (December 19). Sellers dragged the price lower on Friday as it dipped to an intraday low of $92,072. However, it recovered from this level to register a marginal increase and settle at $98,124. Buyers attempted a recovery on Saturday as the price rose to an intraday high of $99,942. However, BTC lost momentum at this level and dropped by 0.63% to $97,505. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment intensified on Sunday as BTC registered a drop of 2.26% to end the weekend at $95,303.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/Xzio6KRd/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC began the previous week in the red, registering a marginal drop to go below $95,000 and settling at $94,830. However, it made a strong recovery on Tuesday, rising just over 4% and moving to $98,677. Buyers retained control on Wednesday, and BTC rose by 0.74% to settle at $99,409. However, it could not push above the $100,000 level as sellers took over, driving BTC down almost 4% on Thursday to $95,691. Buyers attempted to mount a recovery and prevent a drop below $95,000. However, they were unsuccessful, as BTC dropped by 1.52% and settled at $94,241.\par \par \uc2 The weekend began with a recovery as BTC registered an increase of 0.89% and settled at $95,077. However, the recovery was short-lived as BTC returned to the red on Sunday, dropping almost 2% and settling at $93,475. The current session sees BTC marginally down as sellers look to drive it down to $90,000. If sellers maintain control, BTC could dip to $90,000 before recovering. However, if buyers can regain control, BTC will look to reclaim $95,000 and push on towards the $100,000 level.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/ETH-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum (ETH)}}}\uc2  is trading sideways below the $3,500 level as it struggles to build momentum and regain lost ground. ETH dipped below the 20-day SMA on Wednesday (December 18). The price continued to drop on Thursday, falling to $3,415. Sellers dragged ETH to an intraday low of $3,096 on Friday as selling pressure intensified. However, it recovered from this level to register an increase of 1.62% and settled at $3,470. However, ETH was back in the red on Saturday, dropping below the 50-day SMA and settling at $3,337. Sellers retained control on Sunday as ETH dropped almost 2% to $3,279.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/3ofWFvcO/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buyers returned to the market on Monday as ETH registered an increase of 4.27% and moved to $3,419. It went above the 50-day SMA on Tuesday after a 2.11% increase and settled at $3,491. However, it could only manage a marginal rise on Wednesday, thanks to strong resistance around $3,500. ETH was back in the red on Thursday, falling almost 5% to $3,333. Buyers attempted a recovery on Friday as ETH rose to an intraday high of $3,438 before losing momentum. As a result, ETH fell and registered a marginal increase to settle at $3,331.\par \par \uc2 ETH started the weekend positively, registering an increase of 2.14% on Saturday and moving to $3,402. However, it was back in the red on Sunday, dropping 1.46% to $3,352. The current session sees ETH up just over 1% and trading around the $3,400 mark. If buyers retain control, we could see ETH attempt to push towards $3,500.\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  (SOL) is struggling to build momentum and reclaim $200, as it comes up against significant selling pressure at that level. SOL slipped below $200 on Thursday (December 19) when it dropped to $193. Sellers retained control on Friday as SOL dipped to an intraday low of $175 before recovering and settling at $194. However, \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment returned on Saturday as SOL fell almost 7% to $181. A marginal drop on Sunday took SOL to $180. SOL started the previous week on a very positive note, registering an increase of 5.30% to move to $189. Buyers retained control on Tuesday as the price rose to $197.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/XlBYIacR/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL could only manage a marginal increase on Wednesday, thanks to selling pressure around the $200 level. SOL was back in the red on Thursday dropping 4.57% to $188. Sellers retained control on Friday as the price continued to drop, falling to $184 after a decline of 2.24%. Buyers returned to the market on Saturday as SOL surged over 6% to $195. However, it was back in the red on Sunday, dropping almost 3% to end the weekend at $189. The current session sees SOL marginally down as buyers and sellers struggle to establish control.\par \par \uc2 Dogwifhat (WIF) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogwifhat (WIF) struggled to reclaim $2 after falling below the key level last weekend. WIF had dropped to an intraday low of $1.72 last Friday as sellers took control. However, it recovered from this level to reclaim $2 and register an increase of 1.99% to settle at $2.10. Buyers attempted to push higher on Saturday but were unsuccessful as sellers took control. As a result, WIF dropped over 10% to slip below $2 and settle at $1.88. The price recovered on Sunday, reaching an intraday high of $2.04. However, it could not stay at this level and ultimately settled at $1.91. Buyers retained control on Monday as WIF reclaimed $2 to settle at $2.02, and an increase of 1.36% on Tuesday pushed the price to $2.05.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/C3yJW8Rv/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, sentiment changed on Wednesday as WIF dropped 3.41% to go below $2 and settle at $1.98. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment intensified substantially on Thursday as the price dropped almost 8% to $1.82. A marginal drop on Friday took WIF down to $1.81. WIF recovered on Saturday as it registered an increase of 5.52% and moved to $1.91 before dropping just over 4% to end the weekend at $1.83. The current session sees WIF marginally up as buyers look to build momentum and push towards $2.\par \par \uc2 Chainlink (LINK) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/LINK-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Chainlink (LINK)}}}\uc2  plummeted to an intraday low of $19.99 last Friday as sellers attempted to drive it below support levels. However, it recovered from this level to register an increase of 2.62% and settled at $23.38. Buyers attempted a recovery on Saturday as LINK rose to an intraday high of $24.92. However, LINK lost momentum after reaching this level, allowing sellers to take control. As a result, the price dropped 5.51% to $22.09 before registering a marginal drop on Sunday to end the weekend on a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  note. LINK made a strong recovery on Monday, surging over 11% to $24.53. Buyers retained control on Tuesday as LINK rose to $25.42 after registering an increase of almost 4%.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/QxVey70z/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, it could not move past the 20-day SMA, allowing sellers to take control on Wednesday. As a result, LINK dropped almost 4% to $24.42. Selling pressure intensified on Thursday as LINK fell over 7% to $22.66. Buyers retained control on Friday as LINK dipped below $22 to settle at $21.54. The weekend began with LINK registering an increase of 2.02% and settling at $21.97. However, it was back in the red on Sunday, dropping almost 5% and settling at $20.94. The current session sees LINK up nearly 2% as it rebounds from the 50-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 Arbitrum (ARB) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Arbitrum (ARB)\u8217\'20\'19s decline saw its price slip below key support levels and moving averages. The price dipped below the 50-day SMA on Thursday (December 19) and had fallen to $0.719 by Sunday. However, ARB started the previous week on a positive note, rising over 7% and settling at $0.799. Buyers retained control on Tuesday, rising 2.29% and settling at $0.817. However, \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment lost momentum after reaching this level, as ARB fell 1.55% on Wednesday and settled at $0.805. Selling pressure intensified substantially on Thursday as ARB dropped 6.51% to $0.752.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/V30GBTgf/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Friday saw a marginal recovery as ARB rose to an intraday high of $0.794 before settling at $$0.759. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment persisted on Saturday as the price rose just over 2% and settled at $0.774. However, ARB was back in the red on Sunday, ending the week down by 4.32% and trading around $0.741. The current session sees ARB up by 3.47% and trading around $0.766.\par \par \uc2 Immutable (IMX) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Immutable (IMX) is struggling to go above the 200-day SMA and reclaim the $1.50 level, as selling pressure around $1.46 prevents a price increase. IMX dipped below the 200-day SMA on Thursday (December 19) after registering a drop of almost 10%. Sellers drove the price to an intraday low of $1.22 on Friday. However, IMX recovered from this level to register an increase of 2.56% and settle at $1.22. Buyers attempted a move past the 200-day SMA on Saturday as IMX rose to an intraday high of $1.53. However, IMX could not stay at this level and fell below the 200-day SMA, ultimately registering a drop of 8.30% and settling at $1.32. Sellers retained control on Sunday as the price dropped just over 1% to $1.31.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/SrzRrOZA/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment returned on Monday as IMX rose over 10% and settled at $1.44. Buyers retained control on Tuesday, pushing IMX to $1.47. However, IMX could not move past the 200-day SMA and $1.50, losing momentum on Wednesday and dropping just over 3% to $1.43. Selling pressure intensified considerably on Thursday as IMX dropped almost 7% and settled at $1.33. Sentiment changed on Friday as IMX reached an intraday high of $1.45 before settling at $1.38, ultimately registering an increase of 3.52%. The weekend saw buyers retain control on Saturday as IMX rose almost 4% to $1.43. However, it was back in the red on Sunday, dropping nearly 6% to $1.35. The current session sees IMX up by 4.49% and trading around the $1.41 mark as buyers look to build momentum and push toward $1.50.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020241231ekcu0000k\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 12/30: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, XRP, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,834 \uc2 words\par \uc2 30 December 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 An altcoin relief rally is heavily dependent on Bitcoin finding support in the $90,000 to $85,000 price range.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTIvMDE5NDE4ODUtNjQ0Ny03M2VhLThlNTMtN2NlOGViNjNhYjFk.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 12/30: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, XRP, BNB, SOL, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has started the last week of the year on a soft note, indicating that the bulls are not hurrying to buy the dip. Analysts are divided about Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s short-term price action. Some expect a strong rally leading into United States President-elect Donald Trump\u8217\'20\'19s inauguration in January, while others {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-fear-greed-falls-october-levels-btc-fizzles-toward-year-end"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 anticipate the \b  \highlight22volatility\b0 \highlight22  to increase}}}\uc2 . BitMEX co-founder \uc2 Arthur Hayes{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/arthur-hayes-crypto-crash-donald-trump-inauguration"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 voiced a contrarian view}}}\uc2  in his blog post on Dec. 17, where he said the markets are likely to witness a \u8220\'20\'1Charrowing dump\u8221\'20\'1D around Trump\u8217\'20\'19s inauguration day.\par \par \uc2 While short-term traders may be waiting for the uncertainty to clear before buying, \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2  has continued its Bitcoin {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/microstrategy-buys-2138-btc-209-million"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 buying spree for the eighth successive week}}}\uc2 . The business intelligence firm announced the purchase of 2,138 Bitcoin between Dec. 23 and Dec. 29 at an average price of roughly $97,837.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/01941883-9e7d-7560-9c17-00995c492ea5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, BitMEX, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Arthur Hayes, Donald Trump, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s historical performance in January has been a mixed bag, with the average rise being a meagre 3.35%, according to CoinGlass {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.coinglass.com/today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 data}}}\uc2 . However, a positive sign is that in the past five years, Bitcoin has closed January in the red only once in 2022, when it fell 16.68%.\par \par \uc2 What are the crucial support levels to watch out for in Bitcoin and the altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index (SPX) rose above the 20-day exponential moving average (5,983) on Dec. 24, but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/01941884-51da-71a9-9d53-9a5511ccb54a"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, BitMEX, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Arthur Hayes, Donald Trump, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears pulled the price back below the 20-day EMA on Dec. 27 and extended the decline below the 50-day simple moving average (5,941) on Dec. 30. Buyers are expected to defend the 5,853 level with vigor because if the level breaks down, the index will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head-and-shoulders (H&S) pattern. This setup has a target objective of 5,606.\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to push and maintain the price above the 20-day EMA to seize control. The index may then climb to 6,050.\par \par \uc2 US Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The US Dollar Index (DXY) is witnessing a tough battle between the bulls and the bears near the 108 level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/01941884-f736-7d61-83bc-7446105e13a5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, BitMEX, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Arthur Hayes, Donald Trump, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the positive territory indicate advantage to buyers. If the price rises above 108.55, the index will attempt a rally to 111.\par \par \uc2 The critical support to watch on the downside is the 20-day EMA (107). If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will again try to drive the index above 108.55.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, a break and close below the 20-day EMA will suggest that the bulls have given up and are booking profits. That increases the risk of a pullback to 105.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is witnessing profit booking by select traders, increasing the possibility of a drop to the strong support at $90,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/01941885-9e6b-76b2-8fca-c3b70b963710"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, BitMEX, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Arthur Hayes, Donald Trump, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are on the verge of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover, and the relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) is in the negative territory, indicating that the bears are attempting a comeback. If buyers want to prevent a downside, they will have to fiercely defend the $85,000 to $90,000 zone. If they do that, the BTC/USDT pair may spend some time inside a large range.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, a break below $85,000 could tempt several traders to book profits. That could sink the pair to $73,777.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been oscillating inside a large range between $2,850 and $4,094 for several days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/01941886-3101-7ee1-9f0a-151c99607c18"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, BitMEX, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Arthur Hayes, Donald Trump, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to start a recovery from the uptrend line but will have to face stiff resistance at the 20-day EMA ($3,494). If the price turns down sharply from the 20-day EMA, the ETH/USDT pair could plunge below the uptrend line. That could pull the pair to the $3,000 to $2,850 zone.\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to drive and maintain the price above the 20-day EMA to invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view. The pair may then rally toward $4,094.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has pulled back to the support line of the symmetrical triangle pattern, where the bulls are likely to step in.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/01941886-c269-721b-bed7-b741c391b457"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, BitMEX, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Arthur Hayes, Donald Trump, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the support line and breaks above the 20-day EMA ($2.19), it will signal that the XRP/USDT pair may remain inside the triangle for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, a break and close below the triangle will suggest that the pair may have topped out in the near term. There is support at the 50-day SMA ($1.89), but if it cracks, the pair may slide to $1.63.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will be back in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat if they push and maintain the price above the resistance line.\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been trading between the 20-day EMA ($692) and the overhead resistance of $722 for a few days, indicating a tough battle between the buyers and sellers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/01941887-4e60-756e-8508-9395165a9a3a"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, BitMEX, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Arthur Hayes, Donald Trump, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price closes below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bulls have given up. That will bring the large $685 to $722 range into play. Buyers are expected to fiercely defend the $635 level because a break below it may start a deeper correction.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the BNB/USDT pair turns up from the current level and breaks above $722, it will signal that the bulls have overpowered the bears. That could start an up move to $761 and later to $794.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) is getting squeezed between the 20-day EMA ($200) and the uptrend line for the past few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/01941887-dbcd-7dab-a0aa-b6bb5e2bf121"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, BitMEX, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Arthur Hayes, Donald Trump, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the negative territory indicate advantage to sellers. If the bears pull the price below the uptrend line, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair may decline to $155 and later to $133.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns up from the current level or the uptrend line and breaks above the 20-day EMA, it will signal that the selling pressure is reducing. The pair may then climb to the 50-day SMA ($220).\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-happened-in-crypto-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Here\u8217\'20\'19s what happened in crypto today}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has managed to stay above the $0.30 level, but the bulls are struggling to pierce the 20-day EMA ($0.34).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/01941888-730d-7f17-866d-32f105d925af"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, BitMEX, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Arthur Hayes, Donald Trump, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The failure to rise higher could bring another wave of selling by the bears. If the $0.30 level gives way, the DOGE/USDT pair may drop to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.27 and eventually to $0.23.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will be invalidated in the near term if the bulls push the price above the 20-day EMA. The pair may then climb to the 50-day SMA ($0.38), where the sellers are expected to mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been trading below the neckline of the H&S pattern, signaling that the bears have maintained their pressure.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/01941888-fe22-76b0-884b-123be4b020c1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, BitMEX, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Arthur Hayes, Donald Trump, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could drop to the $0.80 to $0.70 support zone, where the bulls are expected to mount a strong defense. If the bears prevail and sink the price below the support zone, the pair may collapse toward the pattern target of $0.50.\par \par \uc2 If buyers want to prevent the downside, they will have to push and maintain the price above $1. If they manage to do that, several aggressive bears may get trapped, resulting in a short squeeze.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 The sharp pullback and the failure to start a rebound suggest that Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) may have topped out in the short term.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/01941889-7cc5-7f91-8b7d-5a0ae931a7e5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, BitMEX, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Arthur Hayes, Donald Trump, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to strengthen their position by pulling the price below $33.50. If they succeed, the selling could pick up, and the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair may tumble to $32 and subsequently to $30.50.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up from the current level and rises above the 20-day EMA ($40.55), it will suggest demand at lower levels. The pair may then rally to $42.50.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTIvMDE5NDE4ODUtNjQ0Ny03M2VhLThlNTMtN2NlOGViNjNhYjFk.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241230ekcu000bb\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
