\par\par \b \uc2 Crypto Price Analysis 12-27 BITCOIN: BTC, ETHEREUM: ETH, SOLANA: SOL, DOGECOIN: DOGE, RIPPLE: XRP, UNISWAP: UNI, INJECTIVE: INJ\b0\par\par\uc2 Amara Khatri \par \uc2 2,644 \uc2 words\par \uc2 27 December 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 2024 Was The Year Of Crypto}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 What The Crypto Industry Wants From Trump}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 South Korea Imposes Sanctions Against North Koreans For Crypto Heist}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-7"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple (XRP) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Uniswap (UNI) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-10"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Injective (INJ) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) fell further on Boxing Day, plummeting from $98,000 to a low of $95,214, failing to reclaim $100,000 over the holiday period. The cryptocurrency is down just over 2% over the past 24 hours, trading around the $96,100 mark with sellers firmly in control. BTC\u8217\'20\'19s downside comes despite low trading volume over the Christmas holidays, with traders wondering if the markets will see the traditional year-end rally this year.\par \par \uc2 Almost all cryptocurrencies were in the red on Boxing Day as \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment dominated the market. Ethereum (ETH) is down nearly 2%, continuing its slide towards $3,000. Meanwhile, Ripple (XRP) is down just over 4%, and Solana (SOL) is down by 3.21%. Dogecoin (DOGE), {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/ADA-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 )}}}\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/LINK-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Chainlink (LINK)}}}\uc2 , Toncoin (TON), Hedera (HBAR), {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/XLM-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Stellar (XLM)}}}\uc2 , and Polkadot (DOT) also reported significant losses.\par \par \uc2 2024 Was The Year Of Crypto\par \par \uc2 Crypto got pretty much everything it wanted in 2024. Once relegated to the fringes, digital assets are now part of the mainstream and can be traded and owned by regular Americans. Wall Street and major financial institutions are hailing crypto as a wise investment, with the incoming Trump administration promising legislative support to the industry. Crypto\u8217\'20\'19s growing acceptance has led to significant gains for investors. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/12/crypto-price-analysis-12-26-bitcoin-btc-ethereum-eth-solana-sol-bittensor-tao-fantom-ftm-celestia-tia-internet-computer-icp"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC)}}}\uc2  holders have reported gains of over 120% since the beginning of the year as the world\u8217\'20\'19s largest cryptocurrency broke past the $100,000 barrier following \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s election victory.\par \par \uc2 Analysts and enthusiasts don\u8217\'20\'19t see the crypto rally ending anytime soon, with Bitwise Chief Investment Officer \uc2 Matt Hougan\uc2  expecting BTC to cross $200,000 before the end of 2025. \uc2 BlackRock\uc2  CEO \uc2 Larry Fink\uc2 , who once called himself a proud skeptic of Bitcoin, has now become one of its biggest advocates.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI was a proud skeptic, and I studied it, learned about it, and came away saying, 'OK, you know, my opinion [for] five years was wrong. We believe bitcoin is an asset class in itself; it is an alternative to other commodities like gold.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 BlackRock\uc2  and other prominent money managers, including \uc2 Franklin Templeton\uc2  and \uc2 Fidelity Investments\uc2 , launched spot Bitcoin ETFs, allowing everyday traders to gain exposure to BTC without owning the asset. \uc2 BlackRock\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s IBIT ETF became the fastest-growing ETF in history, and 11 other ETFs amassed over $100 billion in assets under management. Robbie Mitchnick, \uc2 BlackRock\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s Head of Digital Assets, stated,\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CYou had folks who would have been allocating to Bitcoin, but because there was no traditionally trusted, easy, efficient way to do it for their circumstances, they weren't in it. And then the ETFs changed that.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 What The Crypto Industry Wants From Trump\par \par \uc2 The crypto industry put its full weight behind \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s election campaign. Now, it is readying a list of demands for the incoming administration. The crypto industry faced a significant lack of clarity from federal regulators, leaving it frustrated. The frustration increased thanks to the Biden administration\u8217\'20\'19s stance against crypto. The outgoing administration took a hawkish stance against crypto and went after industry giants, including \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  and Ripple, accusing them of selling unregistered securities.\par \par \uc2 However, President-elect \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 , who once blasted crypto and called it a scam, fully embraced it on the campaign trail and became one of the first presidential candidates to accept digital assets. Kristin Smith, the CEO of the Blockchain Association, stated,\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWith a bipartisan, pro-crypto Congress and pro-crypto president next year, the pieces are in place to get smart policy \u8212\'20\'14 including stablecoin and market structure legislation \u8212\'20\'14 across the finish line that will shape the American crypto industry for years to come. Looking ahead to 2025, the industry must work together on these policy solutions, presenting a cohesive vision to our leaders in Washington. Political power is fleeting, so we must take advantage of this moment to ensure crypto has a bright future ahead in the United States.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 South Korea Imposes Sanctions Against North Koreans For Crypto Heist\par \par \uc2 North Korean hackers are on the radars of governments, blaming them for significant crypto heists in 2024. Hackers associated with the infamous Lazarus Group are suspected to be behind some of the biggest cyber hacks in Web3 and crypto, including the $600 million Ronin hack. South Korea has become the latest country to impose sanctions on hacker groups from North Korea. It recently imposed sanctions against 15 North Korean IT organization members and one related group.\par \par \uc2 The sanctioned entities have allegedly procured funds for North Korea\u8217\'20\'19s nuclear missile development program and the DPRK\u8217\'20\'19s Munitions Industry Department. The 313th General Bureau\u8217\'20\'19s Kim Cheol-Min is among the sanctioned individuals who earned a significant amount of cryptocurrency while working undercover for United States and Canadian companies before delivering the stolen funds to North Korea\u8217\'20\'19s nuclear weapons program.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/BTC-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC)}}}\uc2  \u8217\'20\'19s post-Christmas rally looks all but snuffed out after the cryptocurrency declined swiftly, failing to retake the $100,000 mark. As a result, BTC plummeted to a low of $95,171 before staging a marginal recovery and moving to its current level. The crypto market has seen very low trading volumes over the Christmas period. We must also remember that BTC has more than doubled year-to-date. However, the declines over the past week could indicate that the tailwind of lower interest rates could have become a headwind. Additionally, markets were also spooked by an inaccurate chart, which sent traders into a frenzy and a mini selloff.\par \par \uc2 BTC is trading between $95,000 as it looks to build momentum and prevent a further decline. BTC set a new all-time high on Tuesday as it rallied to $108,268 before registering a marginal decline and settling at $106,142. BTC lost momentum after surging above $108,000, declining considerably on Wednesday, dropping almost 6% to $100,195. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment persisted on Thursday as BTC dropped by 2.49%, going below the 20-day SMA and $100,000 to settle at $97,703. Selling pressure intensified considerably on Friday as BTC dropped to an intraday low of $92,072. However, it recovered from this level to register a marginal recovery and settle at $98,124.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/kGO8jkAA/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Sellers returned over the weekend as BTC dropped by 0.63% on Saturday and settled at $97,505. Sunday saw sellers tighten their grip on the market as the price dropped by 2.26% and settled at $95,303. BTC experienced \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Monday as buyers and sellers attempted to establish control. Sellers ultimately gained the upper hand as BTC registered a marginal drop and settled at $94,830. Buyers returned to the market on Tuesday, and BTC registered an increase of just over 4% and settled at $98,677. It attempted to go above $100,000 on Wednesday but could only reach $99,409, thanks to the 20-day SMA acting as resistance. As a result of growing selling pressure at $100,000, BTC dropped significantly on Thursday, dropping almost 4% to $95,561. The current session sees BTC marginally down as buyers struggle to build momentum. If sellers can push BTC below $95,000, it could drop to $92,000.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/ETH-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum (ETH)}}}\uc2  is struggling to reclaim $3,500 after facing a significant drop on Boxing Day. ETH lost momentum after reaching $4,100 last Monday and dropped by 2.33%, slipping below $4,000 on Tuesday. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment intensified on Wednesday as ETH dipped below the 20-day SMA after falling almost 7% and settling at $3,625. Buyers attempted a recovery on Thursday as ETH rose to $3,762. However, it lost momentum after reaching this level and dropped almost 6% to $3,415. Sellers dragged ETH to an intraday low of $3,096 on Friday. However, ETH recovered from this level to register an increase of 1.62% and settle at $3,470.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/3EISQ9Pa/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Unfortunately, the weekend saw ETH back in the red as it dropped almost 4% on Saturday to go below the 50-day SMA and settle at $3,337. Sellers retained control on Sunday as ETH dropped nearly 2% and settled at $3,279. ETH started the current week positively, rising 4.27% and moving to $3,419. Buyers retained control on Tuesday as ETH crossed the 50-day SMA and settled at $3,491, close to the $3,500 resistance. With sellers active at this level, ETH could only register a marginal increase on Wednesday. Sellers took control on Thursday as ETH plummeted almost 5% after failing to go above $3,500 and settled at $3,333. The current session sees ETH marginally up as buyers and sellers struggle to establish control.\par \par \uc2 If sellers continue to control the session, ETH could drop to $3,200. If this level is breached it could decline to $3,000 before recovering. On the other hand, if buyers retake control, ETH could attempt to reclaim the $3,500 level.\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  (SOL) attempted to go above the 20-day SMA last week, rising to an intraday high of $228 before settling at $223 on Tuesday. However, sentiment changed on Wednesday as SOL dropped below the 50-day SMA, falling 7.50% to $206. Sellers drove SOL below $200 on Thursday, falling to $193 after a drop of just over 6%. Friday saw SOL experience significant \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  as buyers and sellers struggled to establish control. As a result, SOL dropped to an intraday low of $175 and rose to an intraday high of $199 before settling at $194.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/YdregBWk/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Sellers were back in control on Saturday as SOL dropped almost 7% and settled at $181. The price remained in the red on Sunday dropping marginally to $180. The current week began with SOL registering an increase of 5.30% and moving to $189. SOL registered an increase of almost 4% on Tuesday as buyers attempted to reclaim the $200 level. However, with sellers active at this level, SOL could only register a marginal increase on Wednesday before registering a drop of 4.56% on Thursday to settle at $188. The current session sees SOL up almost 1% and trading around $189.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/DOGE-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE)}}}\uc2  has struggled to reverse \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment since reaching an intraday high of $0.467 on December 8. After dropping below the 20-day SMA, sellers drove DOGE below the 50-day SMA last week, as it fell over 12% on Thursday and settled at $0.317. Selling pressure intensified considerably on Friday as DOGE dropped to a low of $0.262. However, it recovered from this level to register a marginal increase and settle at $0.317. Buyers attempted a recovery on Friday as DOGE rose to an intraday high of $0.350. However, they lost momentum after reaching this level, and DOGE dropped to $0.319, registering only a marginal increase. However, DOGE was back in the red on Sunday, falling 2.47% to $0.310, ending the weekend on a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  note.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/n7Sac30W/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The current week began with DOGE registering an increase of 4.20% to settle at $0.325. Buyers retained control on Tuesday as DOGE rose almost 4% to $0.337. However, sellers retook control on Wednesday, and DOGE dropped just over 1% to $0.333. Selling pressure intensified on Thursday as the price fell over 6% to $0.312. The current session sees DOGE marginally up and trading around $0.315.\par \par \uc2 Ripple (XRP) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/XRP-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple (XRP)}}}\uc2  is struggling to go above the 20-day SMA, which is acting like a dynamic resistance level. XRP fell below the 20-day SMA on Wednesday after dropping over 10% and settling at $2.30. Buyers attempted a recovery on Thursday but were unsuccessful as sellers drove the price down to $2.23. XRP fell to an intraday low of $1.95 on Friday as selling pressure intensified. However, it recovered from this level to register an increase of almost 2% and settled at $2.27. Sellers were back in control over the weekend as XRP dropped 1.85% on Saturday and 1.58% on Sunday to settle at $2.20.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/kUm5ZSdP/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP was back in positive territory on Monday, rising almost 3% and settling at $2.25. XRP remained in the green on Tuesday, rising nearly 3% and settling at $2.32. However, it could not move past the 20-day SMA and fell by 1.15% on Wednesday to settle at $2.29. Selling pressure intensified on Thursday as XRP dropped over 6% and settled at $2.15. The current session sees XRP marginally up and trading around the $2.16 mark.\par \par \uc2 Uniswap (UNI) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Uniswap (UNI) dipped below the 20-day SMA on Wednesday after dropping almost 9% to settle at $14.80. Selling pressure increased substantially on Thursday as UNI dropped just over 14% to $12.72 before falling to an intraday low of $11.21 on Friday. However, UNI recovered from this level to register an increase of 7.51% and settle at $13.67. UNI attempted to move to $15 on Saturday as it rose to an intraday high of $14.77. However, it lost momentum after reaching this level and settled at $13.39, dropping just over 2%.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/VAUMmdqb/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buyers returned to the market on Sunday as UNI ended the weekend positively, rising almost 4% and settling at $13.89. UNI registered an increase of 2.60% on Monday and moved to $14.25. Buyers retained control on Tuesday as UNI rose to $14.60. However, it was back in the red on Wednesday, dropping almost 5% to $13.89. Sellers attempted to drive UNI below the 50-day SMA on Thursday as it fell to an intraday low of $12.81 before recovering to settle at $13.24. The current session sees UNI up almost 7% and trading around $14.12.\par \par \uc2 Injective (INJ) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Injective (INJ) fell below a key support level on Wednesday after registering a drop of almost 9% and settling at $24.47. Selling pressure persisted on Thursday as the price fell below the 200-day SMA, dropping nearly 11% to $21.81. Sellers drove the price to an intraday low of $18.49 on Friday. However, INJ recovered from this level to register an increase of 1.42% and settle at $22.12. INJ attempted to go above the 200-day SMA on Saturday as it reached an intraday high of $23.53. However, it lost momentum after reaching this level, dropping almost 8% to $20.44. Sunday saw INJ register a marginal decline as it fell to $20.37.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/9wTYlRQh/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 INJ started the current week positively as buyers returned to the market. As a result, it rose 13.31% to go above the 200-day SMA and settle at $23.08. Buyers retained control on Tuesday, with the price increasing 0.98% to $32.31. However, sellers retook control on Wednesday as INJ dropped by 3.22% to $22.56. The price slipped below the 200-day SMA on Thursday after falling 6.19% and settling at $21.16. The current session sees INJ up just over 4% as buyers look to push it above the 200-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020241228ekcr00003\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 12/27: BTC, ETH, XRP, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , LINK, TON\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,751 \uc2 words\par \uc2 27 December 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin could fall to $90,000, where buyers could purchase aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTIvMDE5NDA5MTAtNTU0Ni03ZGE0LWEyYWMtYTkyMzZkY2MzMmNh.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 12/27: BTC, ETH, XRP, BNB, SOL, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, LINK, TON}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) bulls tried to start a recovery on Dec. 27 but were met with strong selling at higher levels. A minor positive is that United States Bitcoin exchange-traded funds (ETFs) investors have resumed their purchases. The spot ETFs recorded {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-etfs-see-inflow-four-day-outflows"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 net inflows of $475.2 million on Dec. 26}}}\uc2  after four days of sustained outflows of $1.52 billion, per CoinGlass data.\par \par \uc2 However, not everyone is \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Bitcoin. Chartered Market Technician Aksel Kibar said in a post on X that Bitcoin is forming a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head-and-shoulders (H&S) pattern, and if the pattern completes, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-head-and-shoulders-pattern-risks-80k-btc-price-dip"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a fall to $80,000 is possible}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0194090a-f9f8-7d9d-83cf-63eb767564d9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Chainlink, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 As Bitcoin stalls, some analysts seem to be gravitating toward altcoins. They believe {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-dollar-cost-averaging-strategy-dca-opportunity-crypto-trader-thoughts-altcoins"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 altcoins offer a better risk-to-reward opportunity}}}\uc2  than Bitcoin at current levels. They anticipate altcoins to outperform in 2025.\par \par \uc2 What are the support levels on Bitcoin and altcoins that could attract buying? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has slipped below the 50-day simple moving average ($95,406), signaling that the bears are trying to gain the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0194090b-7a8f-7caf-ae05-5b2ecea05819"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Chainlink, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price closes below the 50-day SMA, the BTC/USDT pair could plummet to the solid support at $90,000. Buyers are expected to vigorously defend the $90,000 level because if the support gives way, the pair may drop to $85,000 and subsequently to $73,777.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the bulls will have to push and retain the price above the $100,000 level to seize control. The pair could then rally to the all-time high of $108,353, where the bears are expected to step in.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($3,540) on Dec. 25, and the bears thwarted a recovery attempt on Dec. 27.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0194090c-0c95-78f0-9f24-5c058256824f"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Chainlink, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The ETH/USDT pair could decline to the immediate support at $3,200. This is a crucial near-term support to watch out for because if it cracks, the pair could descend to $3,000 and eventually to $2,850. Buyers are expected to fiercely defend the $3,000 to $2,850 zone.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to drive and maintain the price above the 20-day EMA to suggest that the selling pressure is reducing. The pair is likely to pick up momentum above $3,555 and rally toward the formidable resistance at $4,094.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) closed below the 20-day EMA ($2.23) on Dec. 26, suggesting a likely drop to the support line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0194090c-a16f-7594-ab22-4557b0eecaf1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Chainlink, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The XRP/USDT pair is expected to trade between the support and resistance lines of the symmetrical triangle pattern for some time. The flat 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears.\par \par \uc2 The next trending move is likely to begin after the price breaks above or below the triangle. A breakout of the resistance line could propel the pair to $2.91, while a break below the support line will suggest that the pair may have topped out in the short term. The pair may then decline to $1.62.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) tried to break out of the $722 overhead resistance on Dec. 27, but the bears held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0194090d-2d66-7303-a7d6-61de5728d92e"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Chainlink, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 Repeated failure to rise above $722 increases the possibility of a break below the 20-day EMA ($689). If that happens, the BNB/USDT pair could slide to the 50-day SMA ($668) and later to the solid support at $635. This level is expected to attract buying by the bulls, which could keep the pair range-bound between $635 and $722 for a while.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will again attempt to push the pair above $722. If they succeed, the pair may rise to $760 and thereafter to the solid resistance at $794.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($203) on Dec. 25, indicating that the sentiment remains negative.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0194090d-b477-78f3-8bf5-5b5aab3ee182"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Chainlink, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could fall to the uptrend line, which is an important level to watch out for. If the support cracks, it will signal that the bears remain in control. The pair may decline to $155, which may attract buyers.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will be invalidated in the near term if the price bounces off the uptrend line and breaks above the 20-day EMA. The pair may then attempt a rally to the 50-day SMA ($221).\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) relief rally could not even reach the 20-day EMA ($0.35), indicating that the bears are selling on every minor rise.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0194090e-4658-7080-8bcf-411203f93965"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Chainlink, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 There is minor support at $0.30, but if the level breaks down, the DOGE/USDT pair could plunge to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.27. Buyers are likely to defend the $0.27 to $0.23 zone.\par \par \uc2 If buyers want to prevent the downside, they will have to push and maintain the price above the moving averages. If they do that, it will suggest that the correction may be over. The pair could then climb to $0.43.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\c