ghtchain AI could be the next 100x altcoin, poised to surpass both Cardano and Shiba Inu.\par \par \uc2 Cardano and Shiba Inu Price Trends in the Current Market\par \par \uc2 As of December 24, 2024 cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ada\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) is trading at about $0.93, showing a 4.87% rise from the last close Shiba inu (shib) is priced at near $0.000022 marking a 4 63% jump from the last close. New studies say that SHIB could see a good rise, maybe going up by 28% if it goes past big barrier levels.\par \par \uc2 Also, SHIB's value in the market has lately come close to Cardano's suggesting more people want to invest. On the other hand, Cardano has met troubl\u847\'03\'4Fes keeping its place in the market with meme coins like Shiba Inu becoming more liked.\par \par \uc2 In general, both digital coins are showing big price changes, with SHIB having chance for large quick profits.\par \par \uc2 Factors Influencing \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  and SHIB Growth Trajectories\par \par \uc2 The growth trajectories of Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) and Shiba Inu (SHIB) are influenced by several key factors.\par \par \uc2 Technological Developments- Cardano's advancements, such as the launch of its over-collateralized stablecoin, Djed, enhance its ecosystem's appeal, potentially driving \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's value upward.\par \par \uc2 Market Sentiment and Speculation- SHIB's price is significantly affected by \b \highlight22\uc2 investor sentiment\b0 \highlight\uc2  and speculative trading, often driven by social media trends and community engagement.\par \par \uc2 Network Growth and Adoption- An increase in new addresses and active users on both networks indicates rising adoption, which can positively impact their respective token values.\par \par \uc2 Broader Cryptocurrency Market Trends- Overall market dynamics, including Bitcoin's performance and regulatory developments, play a crucial role in shaping the price movements of \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  and SHIB.\par \par \uc2 These factors collectively contribute to the complex and dynamic price trajectories of Cardano and Shiba Inu in the cryptocurrency market.\par \par \uc2 Lightchain AI Features That Set It Apart\par \par \uc2 Lightchain AI distinguishes itself through several innovative features.\par \par \uc2 Proof of Intelligence (PoI)- This novel consensus mechanism rewards nodes for executing valuable AI computations, such as model training and optimization, enhancing network security while advancing AI development.\par \par \uc2 Artificial Intelligence Virtual Machine (AIVM)- Serving as a dedicated computational layer, the AIVM efficiently executes AI-specific tasks on the blockchain, supporting real-time applications and ensuring seamless integration with popular AI frameworks like TensorFlow and PyTorch.\par \par \uc2 Transparent AI Framework- By ensuring that all AI decision-making processes are auditable and explainable, this framework fosters trust and reliability within the ecosystem.\par \par \uc2 Decentralized Governance Integration- Lightchain AI empowers token holders to actively participate in decision-making processes, promoting a community-driven approach to the platform's evolution.\par \par \uc2 These features collectively position Lightchain AI as a pioneering platform at the intersection of blockchain and artificial intelligence.\par \par \uc2 Why Lightchain AI Could Outpace \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  and SHIB\par \par \uc2 Lightchain AI stands out in the blockchain space, combining innovation, scalability, and real-world utility to position itself as a project capable of surpassing Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) and Shiba Inu (SHIB). Unlike \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s focus on blockchain infrastructure and SHIB\u8217\'20\'19s memecoin-driven appeal, Lightchain AI integrates artificial intelligence with blockchain technology, creating a decentralized ecosystem tailored for AI-specific tasks.\par \par \uc2 Its roadmap highlights a clear path to growth.\par \par \uc2 Phase 1- Prototype Development establishes core features in a controlled environment.\par \par \uc2 Phase 2- Testnet Rollout enables real-world testing to refine performance and governance systems.\par \par \uc2 Phase 3- Mainnet Launch introduces full decentralization, token staking, and decentralized applications (dApps). Future phases focus on ecosystem growth, cross-chain integration, and global adoption, providing a sustainable foundation for long-term success.\par \par \uc2 Tokenomics play a vital role in Lightchain AI\u8217\'20\'19s potential.\par \par \uc2 Utility- LCAI tokens power AI tasks, staking, and access to premium features.\par \par \uc2 Deflationary Mechanism- Token burns reduce supply over time, increasing value.\par \par \uc2 Fair Distribution- Incentives for developers, validators, and community participation ensure balanced growth.\par \par \uc2 With advanced cryptographic techniques ensuring privacy, decentralized governance empowering the community, and a focus on real-world applications, Lightchain AI offers investors a robust and forward-thinking alternative. Its commitment to scalability, security, and sustainability positions it as a contender to outpace both \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  and SHIB.\par \par \uc2 Move Now and Invest in Lightchain AI\par \par \uc2 Lightchain AI\u8217\'20\'19s upcoming presale presents a unique opportunity for investors seeking early entry into a project with significant potential. Its low initial market cap, combined with the strong demand for blockchain-based artificial intelligence solutions, make it an attractive investment option.\par \par \uc2 Don\u8217\'20\'19t miss out on being part of the future of blockchain and artificial intelligence. Invest in Lightchain AI now and be at the forefront of this revolutionary technology. So why wait? Participate in theLightchain AI Presale today!\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://lightchain.ai"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://lightchain.ai}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://lightchain.ai/lightchain-whitepaper.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://lightchain.ai/lightchain-whitepaper.pdf}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/LightchainAI"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://x.com/LightchainAI}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.me/LightchainProtocol"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.me/LightchainProtocol}}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored article and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020241227ekcp0000h\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 12/25: BTC, ETH, XRP, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , BNB, DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , LINK, TON\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,749 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 December 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s relief rally suggests the sentiment remains positive, and that traders have been buying the dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTIvMDE5M2ZlODktODdlYS03N2YyLWIwMjYtYjdkMWYwYjNiOTMz.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 12/25: BTC, ETH, XRP, SOL, BNB, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, LINK, TON}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) bulls are trying to start a Santa Claus rally by pushing the price back above the psychological level of $100,000, but higher levels may attract sellers. Bitcoin has gained nearly 2% in December, but it will have to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-bull-market-over-decembear-has-only-sent-btc-price-2-lower"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 do more work to catch up}}}\uc2  with the previous year\u8217\'20\'19s 12.18% rise in December, per CoinGlass data.\par \par \uc2 CryptoQuant contributor Joo Hyun Ryu said in a Quicktake blog post that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-coils-key-trendlines-98k-kimchi-premium"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin demand has increased}}}\uc2  from speculative short-term holders (STH) and Korean investors. The share of STH increased by 3% within a week, and the \u8220\'20\'1CKimchi Premium,\u8221\'20\'1D the aggregate difference in price between South Korean exchanges and others, reached a local high of 5.12.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193fe85-0513-76b5-9528-f920be41e6a8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, South Korea, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Chainlink, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Kimchi Premium, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 However, Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s up move is not a given because United States-based spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds (ETFs) continue to bleed. CoinGlass data shows {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/blackrock-ibit-bitcoin-etf-record-outflow-eth-etf-inflow"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 net outflows of roughly $1.52 billion}}}\uc2  from the ETFs since Dec. 19.\par \par \uc2 What are the crucial support and resistance levels to watch out for in Bitcoin and the altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin turned up sharply from the 50-day simple moving average ($94,608) on Dec. 24, indicating that the bulls continue to defend the level with vigor.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193fe85-8ea6-78a1-8863-166f1b77402d"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, South Korea, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Chainlink, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Kimchi Premium, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers are trying to push the price above the 20-day exponential moving average ($98,387). If they manage to do that, it will suggest that the correction is over. The BTC/USDT pair could rally toward the all-time high of $108,353.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down sharply from the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that the bears continue to sell on rallies. The pair could then drop to $90,000, where the buyers are expected to step in.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) relief rally is facing stiff resistance from the bears near the 20-day EMA ($3,584).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193fe86-87a5-7857-a7b5-1eb35fd63131"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, South Korea, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Chainlink, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Kimchi Premium, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price maintains below the 50-day SMA ($3,478), the bears will attempt to sink the ETH/USDT pair below $3,200. If they succeed, the pair may collapse to $3,000 and subsequently to $2,850. Buyers are expected to aggressively defend the $2,850 to $3,000 zone.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, a break and close above the 20-day EMA will suggest that the bears are losing their grip. The pair may rally toward $4,094, where the bears are expected to mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) is trading inside a symmetrical triangle pattern, indicating indecision between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193fe87-4ee8-705d-97bf-49e071b35cc6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, South Korea, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Chainlink, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Kimchi Premium, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattening 20-day EMA ($2.25) and the RSI just above the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. If the price maintains above the 20-day EMA, the XRP/USDT pair could rise to the triangle\u8217\'20\'19s resistance line.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price slips below the 20-day EMA, it will signal that the bears are selling on every minor rally. That clears the path for a drop to the triangle\u8217\'20\'19s support line. The next trending move is expected to begin on a break above or below the triangle.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the uptrend line, signaling that the bulls are trying to start a relief rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.c