alanche, Kimchi Premium, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The relief rally has broken above the moving averages, indicating sustained buying by the bulls. The TON/USDT pair could rally to $6.50 and then to $7, where the bears are expected to mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated if the price turns down and breaks below the moving averages. The bears will then make one more attempt to sink the pair below the $4.72 to $4.44 support zone.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTIvMDE5M2ZlODktODdlYS03N2YyLWIwMjYtYjdkMWYwYjNiOTMz.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241225ekcp000e1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
