\par\par \b \uc2 Crypto Price Analysis 12-20 BITCOIN: BTC, ETHEREUM: ETH, SOLANA: SOL, BITTENSOR: TAO, INTERNET COMPUTER: ICP, FILECOIN: FIL, COSMOS: ATOM\b0\par\par\uc2 Amara Khatri \par \uc2 2,679 \uc2 words\par \uc2 20 December 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Plummets Following Fed\u8217\'20\'19s Rate Cut Announcement}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Losses From Crypto Hacks Jump To $2.2 Billion}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 El Salvador Strikes Deal With IMF}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-7"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bittensor (TAO) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Internet Computer (ICP) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Filecoin (FIL) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-10"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cosmos (ATOM) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) plunged below $100,000 following Federal Reserve Chair \uc2 Jerome Powell\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s comments on reducing rate cuts in 2025, rattling investors and leading to a massive selloff across asset classes.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  has projected only two rate cuts for 2025, down from the initially forecasted four. Following the announcement, BTC registered a substantial drop, falling below $100,000 to a low of $95,875 before marginally recovering.\par \par \uc2 Powell\u8217\'20\'19s comments led to a bloodbath in the crypto markets, with all major cryptocurrencies in the red. BTC is currently down over 4% and trading at $97,829, with the bears firmly in control. Meanwhile, Ethereum (ETH) is down over 8% and has slipped below $3,500, with sellers now eying the $3,000 level. \uc2 Solana\uc2  (SOL) tanked almost 8% as well and has surrendered nearly all of its post-election gains. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/DOGE-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE)}}}\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/ADA-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 )}}}\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/LINK-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Chainlink (LINK)}}}\uc2 , Toncoin (TON), Polkadot (DOT), Uniswap (UNI), and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/LTC-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Litecoin (LTC)}}}\uc2  also registered substantial losses.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Plummets Following Fed\u8217\'20\'19s Rate Cut Announcement\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/12/crypto-price-analysis-12-19-bitcoin-btc-ethereum-eth-solana-sol-dogwifhat-wif-toncoin-ton-hedera-hbar-theta-network-theta"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC)}}}\uc2  registered a sharp decline following the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s announcement of a rate cut, as its price tanked below $100,000. The drop comes after BTC set a new all-time high as markets turned \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  following the FOMC meeting. The interest rate cut of 25 basis points was along expected lines. However, Powell\u8217\'20\'19s comments signaled a slower pace for future reductions. Powell stated that rate cuts in 2025 will be smaller due to previous inflationary pressures, with the Fed Chair\u8217\'20\'19s remarks sparking a cautious mood across markets, and cryptocurrencies registered a drop almost instantly.\par \par \uc2 The Fed\u8217\'20\'19s announcement also led to crypto derivatives positions worth $700M liquidated, with Bitcoin long positions accounting for a significant chunk. Altcoins fared considerably worse, with Ethereum (ETH) dipping below $3,500. Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  (LTC), Dogecoin (DOGE), Chainlink (LINK), and several other prominent altcoins also registered substantial drops. The crypto market cap has declined over 4% and is currently at $3.36 trillion.\par \par \uc2 The drop comes after a period during which crypto prices surged, with \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  emerging victorious in the US elections. Markets rose in hopes of a pro-crypto administration and clear regulatory guidelines. \uc2 Joel Kruger\uc2 , market strategist at LMAX Group, stated,\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe crypto market has already been on pins and needles around the possibility of a correction following the record run in the price of bitcoin through $100,000. We got that catalyst from the world of traditional markets. The fallout from Wednesday\u8217\'20\'19s Fed decision was simply too much to ignore.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 However, some, like Azeem Khan, co-founder of Morph felt the pullback was healthy considering the market's growth.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWhen you zoom out and consider the year-over-year growth, a pullback like this feels healthy. It\u8217\'20\'19s also worth noting that, historically, year-end selloffs in securities can occur as investors offset losses against gains to lower their tax liabilities. While it\u8217\'20\'19s hard to say how much of this is driving the current trend, it could be a contributing factor.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Losses From Crypto Hacks Jump To $2.2 Billion\par \par \uc2 Losses from major crypto hacks surged 21% to $2.2 billion in 2024, exceeding $1 billion for the fourth year in a row. Smaller hacks also increased from 282 in 2023 to 303 in 2024. According to \uc2 Chainalysis\uc2 , markets are bound to see hacks as \b \highlight22\uc2 crypto adoption\b0 \highlight\uc2  surges.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAs the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  market booms, it is typical to see illicit use of crypto grow in tandem. Countering the proliferation of these crimes, especially fraud will undoubtedly be a key challenge to the industry in the new year.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Some of the most notable hacks include the loss of over $305 million from Japanese crypto exchange DMM Bitcoin and over $230 million from WazirX.\par \par \uc2 El Salvador Strikes Deal With \uc2 IMF\par \par \uc2 El Salvador has scaled back its Bitcoin and crypto dream to reach an agreement with the \uc2 International Monetary Fund\uc2  (\uc2 IMF\uc2 ) for a $1.4 billion loan deal. According to the \uc2 IMF\uc2 , risks from El Salvador\u8217\'20\'19s adoption of Bitcoin (BTC) had reduced significantly after the country allowed businesses to decide whether they wished to accept Bitcoin or not. El Salvador is the first country to adopt BTC as legal tender.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe potential risks of the Bitcoin project will be diminished significantly in line with Fund policies. Legal reforms will make the acceptance of Bitcoin by the private sector voluntary. For the public sector, engagement in Bitcoin-related economic activities and transactions in and purchases of Bitcoin will be confined.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 IMF\uc2  has been extremely critical of El Salvador\u8217\'20\'19s decision to give BTC legal tender status and warned it could become a hurdle if the country needed financial assistance.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/BTC-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC)}}}\uc2  has registered a sharp decline following Fed Chair \uc2 Jerome Powell\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s hawkish comments on rate cuts. The Fed\u8217\'20\'19s stance rattled investors, leading to a selloff across asset classes. As a result, BTC plummeted below $100,000, falling to a low of 95,630 before recovering to its current levels. The world\u8217\'20\'19s largest cryptocurrency has continued to drop for the third straight day thanks to growing macroeconomic pressure. The market selloff intensified after the Fed forecasted just two rate cuts in 2025, against previous expectations of four. The uncertainty surrounding the creation of a strategic Bitcoin reserve is also negatively impacting the asset price. President-elect \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  had repeatedly raised the prospect of a Bitcoin reserve similar to the country\u8217\'20\'19s strategic oil reserves. However, such an initiative will likely face regulatory hurdles.\par \par \uc2 BTC recovered from a substantial decline at the beginning of last week, rising over 4% on Wednesday to go above the 20-day SMA and settle at $100,900. However, buyers could not sustain momentum and the price dropped almost 1% on Thursday to settle at $99,923. BTC recovered on Friday to reclaim the $100,000 level and settle at $101,394 before registering a marginal decline on Saturday. However, \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment returned on Sunday as BTC rose almost 3% to go above $104,000 and settle at $104,181.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/hl48f0V2/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buyers retained control on Monday as BTC reached an intraday high of $107,464. However, it could not stay at this level and fell to $105,746, ultimately registering an increase of 1.50%. Tuesday saw BTC register a new all-time high, reaching $108,268 before marginally declining and settling at $106,142. Sentiment changed drastically on Wednesday as the markets turned \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 . As a result, BTC plummeted almost 6% and fell to $100,189, barely holding on to $100,000. BTC continued to decline on Thursday after buyers failed to mount a recovery, falling by 2.48% to go below the 20-day SMA and $100,000 to settle at $97,703, but not before hitting an intraday low of $95,630. The current session sees BTC marginally up as buyers and sellers struggle to establish control.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/ETH-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum (ETH)}}}\uc2  has slipped below the $3,500 level as it continues to decline, thanks to short-term holders' panic selling. However, long-term holders have remained inactive, and declining exchange reserves could indicate the decline is temporary. Nonetheless, the drop is substantial and ETH could plummet to the psychological $3,000 mark and surrender a significant chunk of its post-election gains.\par \par \uc2 ETH made a strong recovery on Wednesday after plummeting to a low of $3,521 a day prior, rising almost 6% to go above the 20-day SMA and settle at $3,834. Buyers attempted a move past $4,000 on Thursday as ETH reached an intraday high of $3,988. However, it could not stay at this level and dropped to $3,882, ultimately registering an increase of 1.26%. Buyers retained control on Friday, and ETH registered a marginal increase to go above $3,900 and settle at $3,907. However, it fell back on Saturday, dropping almost 1% to $3,869.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/yhMZo26j/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buyers returned to the market on Sunday as ETH registered an increase of 2.25% to go above $3,900 and settle at $3,956. ETH faced considerable \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Monday as buyers and sellers struggled to establish control. Buyers ultimately gained the upper hand, and ETH registered a marginal increase to settle at $3,985, still unable to go above the $4,000 mark. Sentiment changed on Tuesday as ETH dropped over 2% to $3,892. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment intensified on Wednesday as ETH went below the 20-day SMA after a drop of almost 7% and settled at $3,625. Buyers attempted a recovery on Thursday as ETH rose to an intraday high of $3,763. However, they lost momentum after reaching this level, allowing sellers to take control. As a result, ETH plummeted almost 6%, going below the $3,500 level and settling at $3,416. The current session sees ETH marginally down as sellers continue to lower the price.\par \par \uc2 If bulls fail to step in and stop the decline, ETH could drop to $3,000. On the other hand, if ETH can rebound from its current level, it could reclaim the $3,500 level.\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  (SOL) has almost surrendered all its post-election gains as it continues to drop. The altcoin slipped below $200 on Thursday as \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment around the asset increased considerably. SOL has been unable to go above the 20-day SMA, which acted as a dynamic resistance level. It reached an intraday high of $234 on Thursday as buyers hoped to build on Wednesday\u8217\'20\'19s momentum. However, it could not go above this level and fell back to $227, ultimately registering a marginal decline. Sellers retained control on Friday as SOL dropped almost 1% to $224. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment intensified on Saturday as SOL dropped to an intraday low of $215 before settling at $219 after a drop of 2.22%.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/R7QKJ1Yh/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price recovered on Sunday as SOL rebounded from the 50-day SMA, rising almost 2% to settle at $224. However, buyers could not build momentum, and SOL was back in the red on Monday, dropping by 3.55% and settling at $216. Tuesday saw an uptick in \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  as buyers and sellers struggled to establish control. Buyers ultimately gained the upper hand, pushing SOL up over 3% to $223. However, \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment returned on Wednesday as SOL dropped over 7% to go below the 20-day SMA and settle at $206. SOL fell below $200 on Thursday as it fell 6.15% to $193. The current session sees SOL firmly in the red, with the price down almost 2% and trading at $190.\par \par \uc2 Bittensor (TAO) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Bittensor (TAO) has turned \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  after reaching a peak of $748 on December 6, with its price plummeting substantially at the beginning of the previous week. By Friday, TAO dropped to an intraday low of $562 as \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment intensified considerably. The weekend saw the \b \highlight22\uc2 price drop\b0 \highlight\uc2  lower as TAO registered a decline of almost 3% and settled at $561.It recovered on Sunday to register an increase of 2.24% and end the weekend at $573. However, this is where market sentiment around the asset went downhill. TAO started the current week on a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  note, dropping almost 6% to slip below the 50-day SMA and the key $550 level to $518.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/gptM4m7P/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price continued to drop on Tuesday and Wednesday as TAO fell by 4.17% and 3.59%, slipping below $500 and settling at $499. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment intensified on Thursday as TAO dropped over 10% to go below $450 and settle at $447. Buyers attempted a recovery during the current session as TAO reached an intraday high of $469. However, sellers have retaken control, and TAO is currently down almost 3% and trading around the $433 mark. If sellers retain control, TAO could drop to $400, where it could find support.\par \par \uc2 Internet Computer (ICP) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Internet Computer (ICP) recovered after dropping to an intraday low of $10.85 last Tuesday. By Thursday, it had gone above the 20-day SMA and reached an intraday high of $14.18 before settling at $13.68. However, it entered the weekend on a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  note, dropping by 1.17% on Friday and almost 5% on Saturday to go below the 20-day SMA and settle at $12.87. The price recovered on Sunday as ICP rose 2.33% to $13.17, just short of going above the 20-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/9gL9Z6Y6/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 ICP turned \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Monday after buyers failed to stay above the 20-day SMA, dropping almost 4% and settling at $12.68. Sellers retained control on Tuesday as ICP dropped nearly 5% to $12.07. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment registered a substantial uptick from here on, as ICP fell almost 8% on Wednesday to settle at $11.11. Thursday saw the \b \highlight22\uc2 price drop\b0 \highlight\uc2  below the 50-day SMA as ICP settled at $10.15 after falling nearly 9%. Buyers attempted to move above the 50-day SMA during the current session as ICP reached an intraday high of $10.77. However, they lost momentum at this level, allowing sellers to lower the price. ICP is currently down almost 3% and trading at $9.88, losing the crucial $10 level.\par \par \uc2 Filecoin (FIL) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Filecoin (FIL) has also lost momentum this week as markets turned \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  after Bitcoin (BTC) dropped below $100,000. FIL slipped below the 20-day SMA last week when it fell to a low of $5.68. Since then, it has struggled to build momentum, reclaim key levels, and failed to go above the 20-day SMA. FIL entered the weekend on a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  note, dropping almost 5% to $6.42. It recovered on Sunday, registered an increase of 4.31%, and settled at $6.70. Buyers attempted to go above the 20-day SMA on Monday but could not, as FIL dropped 2.75% to $6.52.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/83XR6Cgf/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price continued to drop on Tuesday as FIL fell by 3.65% and settled at $6.28. Wednesday saw a considerable uptick in \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment as FIL dropped almost 10% to go below $6 and settle at $5.66. FIL dipped below the 50-day SMA on Thursday, registering a drop of just over 10% and settling at $5.09. The current session sees FIL down just over 5% as sellers look to drive it towards the 200-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 Cosmos (ATOM) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Cosmos (ATOM)\u8217\'20\'19s post-election rally halted abruptly in the first week of December as bulls lost momentum after reaching $12.25. By the beginning of last week, ATOM plummeted below the 20-day SMA and fell to a low of $7.25 before recovering to go above $9 by Friday. Despite a strong recovery, ATOM could not go above the 20-day SMA and fell back in the red at the beginning of the current week, falling by 2.52% and settling at $8.87. Sellers retained control on Tuesday as ATOM dropped almost 4% to $8.53. A substantial drop of 10.27% on Wednesday saw ATOM slip below $8 and settle at $7.65.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/x0mJA4RG/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment intensified on Thursday as ATOM slipped below the 50-day SMA and settled at $6.81, a drop of almost 11%. The current session sees ATOM firmly in the red, down 6.53% and trading at $6.36.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020241221ekck0000y\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 12/20: BTC, ETH, XRP, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , BNB, DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , LINK, TON\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,792 \uc2 words\par \uc2 20 December 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The recovery in Bitcoin and select altcoins shows that lower levels continue to attract buyers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTIvMDE5M2U1MjEtYTBhNC03MWQ0LWI1YjctZmQ5MDg0NmFlZjE2.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 12/20: BTC, ETH, XRP, SOL, BNB, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, LINK, TON}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) extended its pullback for the third consecutive day, but lower levels attracted {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-dips-92k-optimal-dip-buying-pce-crypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 solid buying by the bulls}}}\uc2 . The cooler-than-expected United States inflation data likely fuelled the bounce. The \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s preferred inflation metric, the Personal Consumption Expenditures (PCE) index, came in at 2.4% versus economists\u8217\'20\'19 expectations of 2.5%.\par \par \uc2 That helped improve sentiment, which turned \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  after the Fed chair \uc2 Jerome Powell\uc2  forecasted the likelihood of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-drops-to-100-3-k-after-fed-rate-cut-and-powell-s-revised-2025-inflation-outlook"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 two rate cuts in 2025}}}\uc2 , down from the four that were projected in September.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193e53d-4832-738c-99fb-91e7d65ceafb"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Inflation, Interest Rate, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Chainlink, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Is this the start of a deeper correction or an opportunity to buy before the uptrend resumes? That\u8217\'20\'19s the crucial question in traders' minds. Whalemap analysts said in a post on X that the Onchain Volume Profile shows Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s accumulation range is forming at the current prices, and the one below is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-whale-support-mid-60k-new-btc-price-warning"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 in the $60,000 to $67,000 zone}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 What are the crucial supports to watch out for in Bitcoin and the altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin broke below the support line of the ascending channel pattern and fell to the 50-day simple moving average ($91,792) on Dec. 20.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193e531-f338-7bf8-83d1-3ddcb8e58304"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Inflation, Interest Rate, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Chainlink, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The solid rebound off the 50-day SMA shows that the bulls are fiercely defending the level. The relief rally is expected to face selling at the 20-day exponential moving average ($99,142). If the price turns down sharply from the 20-day EMA, the possibility of a break below the 50-day SMA increases. The BTC/USDT pair may collapse to $85,000 and eventually to $73,777.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the bulls will have to drive and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA to suggest that the selling has reduced. That increases the prospects of a retest of the all-time high at $108,353.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) failure to break above the $4,094 resistance on Dec. 16, may have tempted buyers to book profits.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193e531-3ae2-7a73-aa16-dcadb264e755"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Inflation, Interest Rate, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Chainlink, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The ETH/USDT pair broke below the 20-day EMA ($3,689) on Dec. 18 and nosedived to $3,101 on Dec. 20. The bulls aggressively bought the dip and are trying to push the price back above the downtrend line. If they manage to do that, the pair may recover to the 20-day EMA, which is a critical level to keep an eye on.\par \par \uc2 After the sharp fall, the pair is expected to remain volatile in the near term and consolidate inside the large range between $3,000 and $4,094.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been witnessing a tough battle between the bulls and the bears at the 20-day EMA ($2.23).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193e530-69bf-700a-b33a-fb28461d1347"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Inflation, Interest Rate, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Chainlink, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The long tail on the Dec. 20 candlestick shows that the bulls are fiercely defending the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $1.90. This is a critical level for the bulls to defend because a break below it could sink the pair to the 50-day SMA ($1.55).\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is flattening out, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is just above the midpoint, suggesting a range formation in the near term. The XRP/USDT pair may oscillate between $1.90 and $2.73 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) turned down sharply from the 20-day EMA ($218) on Dec. 18 and plummeted below the $210 support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193e52f-ba71-798f-96e0-6087e2629e1f"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Inflation, Interest Rate, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Chainlink, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears maintained their selling pressure and pulled the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair below the support line on Dec. 20. If the price closes below the support line, the pair could descend to $155.\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI near the oversold territory indicate that bears are in command. Buyers will have to push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA to signal a comeback.\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) rose above the $722 resistance on Dec. 17, but the failure to sustain the higher levels may have triggered the selling.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193e52e-fe73-7549-8d29-7283c36f3fbc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Inflation, Interest Rate, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Chainlink, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The BNB/USDT pair plunged below the 50-day SMA ($652) on Dec. 20, but the long tail on the candlestick shows buying at lower levels. If buyers maintain the price above the 50-day SMA, the pair could swing between $635 and $722 for a while.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down sharply from the 20-day EMA ($691), it will suggest a negative sentiment. The bears will then again attempt to sink the pair below $635. If they succeed, the pair may decline to $543.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) plunged below the 50-day SMA ($0.35) on Dec. 19, indicating that the bears are back in the game.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193e52e-41fd-7a4a-a5ea-d89b14521523"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Inflation, Interest Rate, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Chainlink, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The long tail on the Dec. 20 candlestick shows that the bulls are trying to arrest the decline at the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.27. The recovery is expected to face selling at the moving averages. If the price turns down from the overhead resistance, the DOGE/USDT pair could plummet to the breakout level of $0.23.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the 20-day EMA ($0.38). That will indicate aggressive buying at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head-and-shoulders pattern when it fell below the neckline on Dec. 19.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193e529-e45c-74e3-b16d-688ae0c67bd8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Inflation, Interest Rate, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Chainlink, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The long tail on the Dec. 20 candlestick shows that the bulls are trying to defend the breakout level at $0.80 because the failure to do so may sink the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair to $0.69. If this support also cracks, the pair may descend to the pattern target of $0.50.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns up and breaks above the 20-day EMA. That will indicate solid demand at lower levels. The pair may consolidate between $1.20 and $0.80 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-ethereum-eth-price-down-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Ethereum (ETH) price down today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) selling accelerated after the price broke below the 20-day EMA ($45.64) on Dec. 18.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193e529-2ad9-7421-803e-28cdfc6a726e"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Inflation, Interest Rate, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Chainlink, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair has dipped below the 50-day SMA ($39.94), indicating that the breakout above $51 may have been a bull trap. If the price remains below the 50-day SMA, the next stop is likely to be $30.50.\par \par \uc2 Buyers will attempt to start a recovery but are likely to face strong selling at the 20-day EMA. A break and close above the 20-day EMA will be the first signal that the selling pressure is reducing.\par \par \uc2 Chainlink price analysis\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/chainlink-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) turned down sharply on Dec. 18 and slipped below the $23 support on Dec. 20, indicating that the buyers are rushing to the exit.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193e528-76bc-73f2-a4ce-c93e59decae6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Inflation, Interest Rate, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Chainlink, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 50-day SMA ($18.82) is the crucial support to watch out for in the short term. If the price rebounds off the 50-day SMA, the LINK/USDT pair may rise to the 20-day EMA ($24.26). Sellers are expected to mount a strong defense at the 20-day EMA. If the price turns down sharply from the 20-day EMA, the possibility of a break below the 50-day SMA increases.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, If the price closes above the 20-day EMA, it will signal buying on dips. The pair may then climb toward $27.41.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/toncoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TON}}}\uc2  ) broke below the 50-day SMA ($5.80) on Dec. 18 and reached the $4.72 to $4.44 support zone on Dec. 20.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193e527-b1ef-798d-897f-e164ba1386c8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Inflation, Interest Rate, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Chainlink, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($5.99) has been turned down, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is in the negative zone, signaling that bears have the upper hand. Buyers are expected to defend the $4.44 level with all their might because a break below it will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  H&S pattern. The TON/USDT pair could then