\par\par \b \uc2 Crypto Price Analysis 12-16 BITCOIN: BTC, ETHEREUM: ETH, SOLANA: SOL, RIPPLE: XRP, DOGECOIN: DOGE, CARDANO:  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , INJECTIVE: INJ\b0\par\par\uc2 Amara Khatri \par \uc2 2,954 \uc2 words\par \uc2 16 December 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Sets New All-Time High}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 The Crypto Market Must Overcome Regulatory Hurdles}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple (XRP) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-7"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Injective (NJ) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) surged to a new all-time high during early Asian trading hours, hitting a peak of $106,449 before declining to its current level. The rally came as speculations grew about it becoming a United States reserve asset.\par \par \uc2 The cryptocurrency is trading at $104,638, up just over 2% in the past 24 hours. The surge is also the result of increased whale activity and markets buoyed by \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s addition to the Nasdaq 100. BTC is up almost 6% over the past week and nearly 15% over the past month.\par \par \uc2 Several other cryptocurrencies registered notable gains over the weekend. Ethereum (ETH) is up almost 2% and trading just under $4,000. \uc2 Solana\uc2  (SOL) has also been marginally up over the past 24 hours. Dogecoin (DOGE), Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), Avalanche (AVAX), {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/TRX-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tron (TRX)}}}\uc2 , Toncoin (TON), and Polkadot (DOT) also made notable gains. The crypto market cap is up 2.42% and currently sits at $3.7 trillion.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Sets New All-Time High\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/12/crypto-price-analysis-12-13-bitcoin-btc-ethereum-eth-solana-sol-bittensor-tao-celestia-tia-arbitrum-arb-hedera-hbar"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC)}}}\uc2  surged to a new all-time high, reaching $106,492, thanks to increased whale trading and \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s addition to the Nasdaq 100. On-chain data revealed several major trades by Bitcoin whales over the weekend. The trades saw the movement of millions of BTC off major exchanges and into private wallets. Whale Alert, which tracks crypto transactions, showed over 27,000 BTC worth $2.8 billion moved off exchanges like Bybit and \uc2 Binance\uc2  into private wallets. The move drastically reduces the supply of BTC on public exchanges, leading to a spike in price.\par \par \uc2 Another major factor contributing to BTC\u8217\'20\'19s surge to a new all-time high was the optimism generated by the addition of \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2 , the world\u8217\'20\'19s largest corporate holder of BTC, to the Nasdaq 100 index.\par \par \uc2 The Crypto Market Must Overcome Regulatory Hurdles\par \par \uc2 The head of South Korea\u8217\'20\'19s stock exchange, Jeong Eun-bo, has urged the country to institutionalize crypto and act quickly or risk losing ground to its institutional rivals. He made the comments during an interview with a South Korean newspaper, during which the exchange head highlighted that the market needs to overcome significant regulatory obstacles.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe crypto asset market has grown in size and influence to the point where traditional markets cannot ignore it. South Korea should quickly make efforts to include crypto assets in the financial sector.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 He also stated that exchange chiefs agreed it would be difficult for stock exchanges to maintain profitability if they ignored the virtual currency market.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe average daily trading volume of the domestic stock market is approximately 20 trillion won ($14 billion). The virtual currency market has surpassed this since \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  won the US presidential election. We must hurry to institutionalize the virtual currency market to create new added value. If we are vague with our treatment of virtual currency, and treat it as a speculative asset, we will fall behind in terms of international competitiveness.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Cryptocurrencies have gained considerable popularity in South Korea. However, the country\u8217\'20\'19s crypto market is dominated by private investors, with no crypto firms listed on the Korean exchange. Companies cannot buy crypto with their balance sheets, and regulators are yet to approve spot Bitcoin ETFs.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/BTC-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC)}}}\uc2  surged to a new all-time high during early Asian trading hours, buoyed by President-elect \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s latest comments suggesting his plans to create a US Bitcoin strategic reserve similar to its strategic oil reserves. Tony Sycamore, an analyst at IG, stated,\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe're in blue sky territory here. The next figure the market will be looking for is $110,000. The pullback that a lot of people were waiting for just didn't happen because now we've got this news.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Trump stated last week that he wants America to be at the forefront of a global crypto ecosystem. When asked if he plans to build crypto reserves similar to the country\u8217\'20\'19s strategic oil reserves, Trump replied in the affirmative.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe're gonna do something great with crypto because we don't want China or anybody else - not just China but others are embracing it - and we want to be the head.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Several other countries, including Russia, are also considering creating strategic reserves. BTC is up over 16% since last month and over 55% since the US elections. According to Jack Mallers, the founder and CEO of Strike, Trump could potentially issue an executive order designating BTC as a reserve asset on his first day in office.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThere\u8217\'20\'19s potential to use a day-one executive order to purchase Bitcoin. It wouldn't be the size and scale of 1 million coins, but it would be a significant position.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Several Bitcoin reserve bills are being mooted at the state level as well, with Satoshi Action Fund CEO Dennis Porter claiming a third bill is being considered. However, he did not elaborate on which state would follow Pennsylvania and Texas.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe had Pennsylvania, and we had Texas. And now we have another state coming on board. And they sent me the draft. So I know it\u8217\'20\'19s real. It's not going to stop. We're going to see more and more of these bills come. At least 10, in my opinion.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Analysts also predict a 0.25% interest rate cut by the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  on December 18, which could help drive Bitcoin even higher in the coming months.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s look at the price chart. BTC struggled to break past $100,000 before Sunday\u8217\'20\'19s increase, as selling pressure kept the bulls at bay. However, developments on Sunday and the beginning of the week could have ignited a new bull run, with BTC setting a new all-time high earlier today. BTC began the previous week positively, registering an increase of 1.32% on Sunday and settling at $101,043. However, it fell considerably on Monday as sellers drove it to an intraday low of $94,185. BTC recovered from this level and ultimately settled at $97,434 after a drop of 3.57%. Sellers retained control on Tuesday as BTC registered a marginal decline and settled at $96,912, but not before dropping to an intraday low of $94,313.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/rXLHQKY9/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Despite the prevailing selling pressure, BTC recovered on Wednesday, rising just over 4% to go above $100,000 and settle at $100,900. However, it was back in the red on Thursday, dropping almost 1% and settling at $99,923. BTC\u8217\'20\'19s seesaw price action continued on Friday as it recovered after registering an increase of 1.47% to reclaim $100,000 and settle at $101,394. The weekend began with BTC registering a marginal drop on Saturday. However, it rallied on Sunday, registering an increase of almost 3% and settling at $104,182. BTC set a new all-time high during the ongoing session as it peaked at $106,554 before declining to its current level of $105,017.\par \par \uc2 Analysts believe BTC is in uncharted territory as market sentiment shifts to \u8220\'20\'1Cextreme greed.\u8221\'20\'1D If bulls retain control, BTC could continue pushing higher and reach $110,000. On the other hand, sellers will look to reclaim control and push BTC below $100,000.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Analysts have predicted that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/ETH-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum (ETH)}}}\uc2  is poised for record highs in Q1 2025, and an imminent breakout could see the asset set a new all-time high. However, ETH struggled to stay above $4,000, a key psychological level, even as BTC registers substantial gains. As we can see in the price chart, ETH has repeatedly been rejected from the $4,000 level, as it encounters a formidable sell wall. Despite recent struggles, ETH has reversed considerable \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment as it recovers from a low of $3,521, a level it dropped to during the previous week.\par \par \uc2 ETH started the previous week in the red, dropping over 7% to plummet to an intraday low of $3,536 before settling at $3,715. Sellers retained control on Tuesday as ETH fell by 2.30% and settled at $3,630. However, the price bounced back on Wednesday, registering an increase of almost 6% to go above $3,800 and settle at $3,834. ETH continued to push higher on Thursday, reaching an intraday high of $3,988 before declining to settle at $3,882, an increase of 1.26%. The price climbed above $3,900 on Friday after registering a marginal increase and settling at $3,907.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/EnhoU7qH/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Despite the prevailing positive sentiment, ETH was back in the red on Saturday, dropping almost 1% and settling at $3,869. However, buyers returned to the market on Sunday, pushing ETH up just over 2% to $3,956. ETH is marginally up during the current session and trading at $3,977 as it looks to build momentum and go beyond $4,000. Despite its struggles to conquer $4,000, analysts are \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on ETH and predict it will soon begin catching up to BTC\u8217\'20\'19s gains. Analysts from Bybit have predicted ETH could set a new all-time high in Q1 2025, adding that it is showing strength in derivatives markets.\par \par \uc2 One analyst on X believes ETH is setting up for a move above $8,800, based on the formation of an ascending triangle on the daily chart. Popular crypto analyst Venture Founder highlighted ETH\u8217\'20\'19s historic correlation with Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s halving cycle, potentially eclipsing the latter\u8217\'20\'19s momentum by December.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CEvery cycle, following the Bitcoin halving, Ethereum underperformed BTC for no more than 8 months until it explodes against BTC. We are in the 8th month now. Right on track. Then ETH/BTC Ratio since halving goes to no less than 700% after, which for this cycle means ETH/BTC = 0.39.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  (SOL) continues to be bogged down by the 20-day SMA, which is acting as a dynamic level of resistance. As a result, buyers have been unable to push towards $250, with resistance at key levels increasing substantially. SOL\u8217\'20\'19s inability to go above the 20-day SMA dates back to the beginning of December. SOL has repeatedly attempted to go back above the moving average but has been unable to consolidate above it, with selling pressure pushing the price down. The same scenario played out during the previous week, as SOL plummeted almost 9% on Monday, dropping to an intraday low of $203 before settling at $216. Sellers retained control on Tuesday as SOL dropped by 1.47% and settled at $213.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/qLZX5VlM/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL rebounded on Wednesday after finding support at this level and registered an increase of 6.38% to settle at $227. Buyers attempted to go above the 20-day SMA on Thursday as SOL reached an intraday high of $234. However, buyers lost momentum after reaching this level, and SOL dropped to settle at $227 after a marginal decline. Selling pressure persisted on Friday as SOL dropped 0.96% to $224. Sellers attempted to drag SOL below the 50-day SMA on Saturday as the price dropped to an intraday low of $215. However, buyers prevented a further decline, and SOL ultimately settled at $219. SOL recovered on Sunday as buying activity registered a substantial increase. As a result, SOL rose by almost 2% and settled at $224. The current session sees SOL back in the red, down by just over 1% and trading at $221.\par \par \uc2 If sellers retain control and push SOL below the 50-day SMA, it could drop to $200 before recovering. On the other hand, buyers will look for a way past the 20-day SMA. If SOL can move above this level, it could retest key resistance levels at $240 and $260.\par \par \uc2 Ripple (XRP) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/XRP-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple (XRP)}}}\uc2  started December on a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  note, surging to a high of $2.90 on December 3. Momentum has waned since, with the price unable to go beyond $3, thanks to considerable selling pressure at upper levels. As a result, XRP dropped to $2.17 by December 5 before rising to $2.60 last weekend. However, XRP plummeted at the beginning of the previous week, falling almost 15% to $2.21. Selling pressure intensified on Tuesday as the price dropped to an intraday low of $1.90, briefly going below the 20-day SMA. However, it recovered from this level to register an increase of just over 7% and settle at $2.37. XRP experienced considerable \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Wednesday as buyers and sellers struggled to establish control. Buyers ultimately gained the upper hand, and XRP registered an increase of 0.92% and settled at $2.39.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/93ktlrGB/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Sellers retired to the market on Thursday as XRP dropped 2.37% to $2.33 before recovering on Friday to register an increase of 3.60% and settle at $2.42. The weekend was mixed for XRP as it fell 0.97% on Saturday after a failed attempt to go above $2.50. However, it recovered on Sunday to register an increase of 1.93% and settle at $2.44. The current session sees XRP back in the red, down by 2.38% and trading around the $2.40 mark.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/DOGE-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE)}}}\uc2  has been trading in a narrow range since Monday when it plummeted over 11% to slip below the 20-day SMA and hit an intraday low of $0.382 before recovering to settle at $0.414. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment persisted on Tuesday as DOGE dropped to an intraday low of $0.365 before settling at $0.394 after registering a decline of almost 5%. DOGE was back in positive territory on Wednesday, rising by 5.20% and settling at $0.414. However, despite the strong showing, it could not go above the 20-day SMA and fell back on Thursday, dropping just over 2% to $0.406.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/BPrEG0yS/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE recovered on Friday thanks to support around $0.40 but could not build momentum to go past the 20-day SMA. As a result, it could only register a marginal increase and settle at $0.409. Sellers drove DOGE to an intraday low of $0.387 on Saturday as selling pressure intensified considerably. However, it pushed back from this level to settle at $0.397 before recovering on Sunday and settling at $0.406 after an increase of just over 2%. The current session sees DOGE back in the red as sellers look to drive it below $0.40. DOGE is currently down by 1.35% and trading around $0.404.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/ADA-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 )}}}\uc2  registered a substantial drop last Monday as it fell almost 16% to slip below the 20-day SMA and settle at $1, but not before dropping to an intraday low of $0.91. Despite starting the week in the red, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  recovered on Tuesday, rising from an intraday low of $0.91, registering an increase of almost 2%, and settling at $1.02. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment intensified on Wednesday as \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  rose over 6% and settled at $1.08. Buyers pushed \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  above the 20-day SMA on Thursday, registering an increase of 3.22% to $1.12.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/jazTTD3r/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, sentiment changed on Friday as it registered a marginal decrease. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment intensified on Saturday as \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  dropped below the 20-day SMA, falling over 5% and settling at $1.06. Despite considerable selling pressure, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  recovered on Sunday to register an increase of 3.58% and settled at $1.09. However, it could not go above the 20-day SMA. The current session sees \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  down almost 2% and trading at $1.07.\par \par \uc2 Injective (NJ) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Injective (INJ)\u8217\'20\'19s surge towards $35 halted abruptly last Friday as it lost momentum after reaching $34. The weekend saw a considerable shift in sentiment as INJ dropped just over 3% on Saturday and settled at $32.99. Sunday saw a recovery, with INJ registering an increase of 0.98% and settling at $33.31. However, the price plummeted on Monday, dropping almost 16% to slip below the 20-day SMA and drop to an intraday low of $24.73, where the 50-day SMA prevented a further decline. INJ made a partial recovery from this level to settle at $28.05. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment persisted on Tuesday as INJ dropped to a low of $25 before settling at $27.07, registering a decline of 3.49%.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/Shj4Z3A9/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 INJ recovered on Wednesday despite overwhelming \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment, rising by 6.57% and settling at $28.85. The price surged to an intraday high of $30.79 on Thursday, briefly moving above the 20-day SMA. However, buyers lost momentum after reaching this level, and INJ ultimately settled at $29.07 after a marginal increase. Buyers maintained control on Friday, with the price rising marginally and settling at $29.27. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment returned on Saturday as INJ dropped by 6.26% and settled at $27.43. It recovered on Sunday, registering an increase of just over 4% and settling at $28.56. The current session sees INJ down almost 3% and trading around $27.80 as sellers look to drive the price toward the 50-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020241217ekcg00010\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 12/16: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, XRP, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , BNB, DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,869 \uc2 words\par \uc2 16 December 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin opened with week with a fresh all-time high, and several altcoins are showing \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  chart setups.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTIvMDE5M2QwODUtZjE3Yy03NWQ5LWIzZjItODhlYmRkODY1ZTc1.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 12/16: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, XRP, SOL, BNB, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) continued its northward journey on Dec. 16, signaling continued demand from the bulls. Material Indicators co-founder Keith Alan said in a post on X that historically, Bitcoin makes \u8220\'20\'1CMACRO moves\u8221\'20\'1D at or around Dec. 17. He expects a rate cut by the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-base-case-140k-5-things-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 boost Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s prices higher}}}\uc2  but added that he will wait on the sidelines until more clarity emerges.\par \par \uc2 ZK Square chief investment officer CK Zheng told Cointelegraph that Bitcoin may have entered \u8220\'20\'1CSanta Claus mode,\u8221\'20\'1D with investors looking to allocate capital, fearing missing out on the rally. He expects {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-sets-new-all-time-high-above-105000"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin to reach $125,000 in early 2025}}}\uc2  but anticipates a 30% correction afterward.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193d05e-28f4-77da-ad0d-48ed29acea11"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Interest Rate, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Undeterred by the possibility of a correction, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/microstrategy-buys-15350-bitcoin-100k-per-btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MicroStrategy announced a fresh purchase of 15,350 Bitcoin}}}\uc2  between Dec. 9 and 15 at an average price of $100,386. That increased the firm\u8217\'20\'19s total holding to 439,000 Bitcoin, acquired at an average price of $61,725.\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s rally continue pulling select altcoins higher, or is it time for a correction to set in? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index (SPX) is facing resistance near 6,100, but a positive sign is that the bulls have not ceded much ground to the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193d05f-62ec-72c7-96d3-f6066207489d"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Interest Rate, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the current level or rebounds off the 20-day exponential moving average (6,020), the bulls will attempt to push the price to the resistance line. This is an important level to keep an eye on because a break above it will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  rising wedge setup. The index may then rally to 6,221 and eventually to 6,500.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to make a comeback, they will have to yank the price below the 50-day simple moving average (5,912). That will complete the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pattern, clearing the path for a fall to 5,670.\par \par \uc2 US dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The US dollar Index (DXY) is attempting to rise toward the overhead resistance of 108, where the bears are expected to pose a substantial challenge.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193d05f-f2da-7a36-9056-48cbabe9e332"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Interest Rate, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance and breaks below the 20-day EMA (106.30), it will signal a possible range formation in the near term. The index may swing between 105.42 and 108 for a while.\par \par \uc2 A break and close below 105.42 will bring the large 101 to 108 range into play. On the contrary, a break above 108 will signal the start of a new move. The index may then rally to 114.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is in a strong uptrend. The bulls pushed the price to a new all-time high above $104,088 on Dec. 15.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193d060-86dd-7070-b389-9889589df813"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Interest Rate, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USDT pair has reached the resistance line of the ascending channel pattern, where the bears are expected to mount a strong defense. However, if buyers overcome the resistance, the pair could surge to $113,331 and thereafter to $125,000.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down from the resistance line and breaks below the 20-day EMA ($98,920), it will suggest selling on rallies. The pair may then slide to the channel\u8217\'20\'19s support line. Sellers will have to pull the price below the support line to make a comeback in the short term.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been gradually climbing toward $4,094, where the bulls are expected to encounter stiff resistance from the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193d061-0e81-70a4-96f6-6a834ff60402"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Interest Rate, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  above 61 suggest that the path of least resistance is to the upside. If buyers pierce the $4,094 resistance, the ETH/USDT pair could surge to $4,500. The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  prospects remain intact as long as the price stays above the 20-day EMA ($3,747).\par \par \uc2 The first sign of weakness will be a break and close below the 20-day EMA. Such a move will indicate that the bulls have given up. That could sink the pair to the vital support at the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) closed above the downtrend line on Dec. 15, but the bulls are struggling to push the price higher.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193d061-a2d5-7fbb-bff7-f0cb41e28344"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Interest Rate, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to pull the price to the 20-day EMA ($2.18), a critical support to watch out for in the near term. If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will again attempt to kick the XRP/USDT pair to $2.64 and then to $2.91.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, a break below the 20-day EMA will suggest that the bears are making a comeback. The pair may collapse to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $1.90, where buyers are expected to step in.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has been getting squeezed between the moving averages for the past few days, setting up for a possible breakout.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193d062-3b35-7e54-a987-d823d7897b61"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Interest Rate, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks and sustains below the 50-day SMA ($216), it will signal that the bears are trying to take charge. The pair may tumble to the support line, which is an essential level for the bulls to defend.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the 50-day SMA with force, the bulls will again attempt to shove the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair above the resistance line. If they manage to do that, the pair may climb to $248 and eventually to $264, where the bears are expected to mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been consolidating near the $722 overhead resistance, indicating that the bulls have kept up the pressure.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193d063-5d3e-7f47-8313-575b9f8fe08e"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Interest Rate, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The rising moving averages and the RSI just above the midpoint suggest buyers have a slight edge. If bulls push the price above $722, the BNB/USDT pair could rise to $761 and then to $794.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the upside, they will have to swiftly tug the price below the 20-day EMA ($696). That could tempt short-term buyers to book profits, pulling the pair to the 50-day SMA ($645).\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/how-high-can-bitcoin-price-go"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 How high can Bitcoin price go?}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) is witnessing a tough battle between the bulls and the bears near the support line of the ascending channel pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193d063-ebb1-7410-b4c8-420aa9c08de0"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Interest Rate, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattening 20-day EMA ($0.40) and the RSI near the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. If the price rises above $0.43, the advantage will tilt in favor of the bulls. That could push the DOGE/USDT pair toward $0.48 and subsequently to the channel\u8217\'20\'19s resistance line.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, a break and close below $0.36 could suggest the start of a deeper correction. The pair may drop to the 50-day SMA ($0.34), which is a crucial level for the bulls to defend. If this level gives way, the pair may skid to $0.29.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers are trying to keep Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($1.06), but failing to start a strong rebound increases the risk of a fall.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193d064-6c10-7fc0-9149-93d1216eeff9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Interest Rate, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the 20-day EMA cracks, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could slide to solid support at $0.90. The flattish 20-day EMA and the RSI just above the midpoint suggest a consolidation in the near term. The pair may swing between $0.90 and $1.20 for some time.\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to propel the price above $1.20 to gain strength. The pair may rise to $1.25 and, after that, to $1.33. Conversely, a break below $0.90 could sink the pair to the 50-day SMA ($0.80).\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to pull Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) below the 20-day EMA ($47.80) on Dec. 15, but the bulls held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193d064-e4fb-7784-8d1c-5f6dc911d050"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Interest Rate, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, the failure of the bulls to maintain the price above $51 on Dec. 16 has attracted another round of selling. The bears are trying to sink the AVAX/USDT pair below the 20-day EMA. If they manage to do that, the pair could tumble to the 50-day SMA ($38.69).\par \par \uc2 If buyers want to prevent the downside, they will have to quickly push the price back above $51. That would indicate buying at lower levels, increasing the possibility of a break above $56. The pair may rally to $60 and later to $65, where the bears are expected to pose a strong challenge.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTIvMDE5M2QwODUtZjE3Yy03NWQ5LWIzZjItODhlYmRkODY1ZTc1.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241216ekcg000bb\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 The 2024 Santa Claus rally is about to start\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Gracy Chen \par \uc2 1,097 \uc2 words\par \uc2 16 December 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 There\u8217\'20\'19s potential for a 2024 Santa Claus rally across the crypto markets. Historical trends, market factors, and this year\u8217\'20\'19s bull run could lead to significant gains during the holiday season.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTIvMDE5MzkwMDktN2Q4My03ZmY2LTk0NGMtOTYyYmQ3NTRiNjhl.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 The 2024 Santa Claus rally is about to start}}}\par \par \uc2 Opinion by: Gracy Chen, CEO of Bitget\par \par \uc2 You\u8217\'20\'19ve heard of the halvening and Uptober, but are you familiar with the other major calendar event when crypto is odds-on to go up? Say hello to the Santa Claus rally, bringing good tidings and cheer to traders worldwide. If all you want for Christmas is a screen-busting green candle for all your crypto bags, this is the seasonal event for you.\par \par \uc2 What\u8217\'20\'19s the basis for believing in a Santa Claus rally, and is there any reason to think that 2024 will live up to previous years? Let\u8217\'20\'19s examine the science behind this distinctively unscientific phenomenon.\par \par \uc2 The case for a green Christmas\par \par \uc2 The Santa Claus rally, typically observed during the final week of December and the first two trading days of January, has historically brought cheer to investment portfolios. But its origins are much older than crypto, predating even the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Diffie%E2%80%93Hellman_key_exchange"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Diffie-Hellman key exchange}}}\uc2  in 1976 that laid the foundation for crucial pair cryptography.\par \par \uc2 In 1972, Yale Hirsch {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://finance.yahoo.com/blogs/breakout/santa-claus-rally-not-believe-153852263.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 coined}}}\uc2  the phrase \u8220\'20\'1CSanta Claus rally\u8221\'20\'1D in his Stock Trader\u8217\'20\'19s Almanac publication. Hirsch identified a pattern where the S&P 500 index tended to rise during the final December and early January trading days. This seven-day period has historically yielded positive returns, with the S&P 500 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cmegroup.com/openmarkets/finance/2020/the-history-of-the-santa-claus-rally.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 gaining}}}\uc2  an average of 1.3% since 1950 as of 2020.\par \par \uc2 Why is this the case? What\u8217\'20\'19s it got to do with crypto?\par \par \uc2 Those are rookie numbers\par \par \uc2 Several reasons have been postulated as to why the stock market tends to perk up at the tail end of the year, ranging from the rational to the distinctly irrational. The boring explanation is that investors may be looking to invest in tax-loss harvesting before year-end, selling underperforming stocks to offset capital gains and reinvesting in the market. Alternatively, fund managers might purchase high-performing stocks at year-end to enhance the appearance of their portfolios in annual reports.\par \par \uc2 A more benign suggestion is that with many investors on holiday, reduced trading volumes can lead to less \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  and a gradual upward drift in stock prices. This explanation can\u8217\'20\'19t be easily applied to crypto since the markets are never closed. Thus, due to its vital retail component, the holiday season is more likely to increase rather than reduce volumes. It doesn\u8217\'20\'19t automatically follow that less crypto volume automatically equates to greater \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The opposite is often the case, as bulls and bears attempt to pull the market in opposing directions.\par \par \uc2 Recent: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-price-gains-88-is-the-ada-rally-just-getting-started"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano price gains 88% \u8212\'20\'14 Is the \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22  rally just getting started?}}}\par \par \uc2 It\u8217\'20\'19s fair to say that most of the rationale behind the Santa Claus rally doesn\u8217\'20\'19t apply to crypto because \u8212\'20\'14 newsflash \u8212\'20\'14 crypto isn\u8217\'20\'19t stonks. Despite significant institutional participation over the past year following the Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) exchange-traded fund approvals, the industry remains more volatile than traditional markets. The 1.3% seven-day increase Hirsch {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.plus500.com/en-cz/newsandmarketinsights/santa-rally-is-it-anywhere-in-sight"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 charted}}}\uc2  in 1972 wouldn\u8217\'20\'19t register as much as a blip in crypto, where double-digit moves in a single day are the norm during bull markets, even for established assets such as BTC.\par \par \uc2 One theory that applies to the Hirsch model works neatly with crypto: The festive season brings increased consumer spending and a general sense of optimism, which can positively influence market sentiment. People have gotten their annual bonus, are bored, and have time. It\u8217\'20\'19s the perfect time for a bit of speculation on the market.\par \par \uc2 Why a crypto Crimbo is on the cards\par \par \uc2 While the Santa Claus rally is a well-documented phenomenon in traditional stock markets, its presence in cryptocurrency is less clear. Cryptocurrencies, known for their \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  and 24/7 trading, don\u8217\'20\'19t always follow equities\u8217\'20\'19 seasonal patterns. A second trend can be applied to this model that has empirically proven a powerful predictor of a Santa Claus rally occurring in Cryptoland: whether or not the market is in a bull run.\par \par \uc2 It\u8217\'20\'19s safe to say that crypto firmly checks that box right now, thus making a compelling case for a severe rally coming together as the year draws close. In late 2017, for example, BTC rallied by 68% over the two weeks spanning the New Year. Subsequent years have been more muted, in line with the prevailing market mood at the time. But then there\u8217\'20\'19s 2024, which has already broken all crypto records. One wouldn\u8217\'20\'19t bet against it closing out the year on a tear just to complete the clean sweep.\par \par \uc2 If traders buy into the Santa Claus rally thesis, they don\u8217\'20\'19t need to create a prediction market to speculate on the likelihood \u8212\'20\'14 although nothing is stopping them. In crypto, financial freedom comes as a standard. A more intelligent strategy is filling one\u8217\'20\'19s conviction bags before the year-end. Load up on the assets you believe in the most, and then sit back and let the prophecy unfold.\par \par \uc2 As 2024 closes out, the financial landscape presents a mix of optimism and caution. The global economy has shown resilience, with many sectors rebounding from previous downturns. Consumer spending during the holiday season is expected to be robust, bolstering market sentiment. The only potential dampener could be the escalation of global tensions in the Middle East or Ukraine. Still, barring a major macro event, there\u8217\'20\'19s every reason to expect the current bull market to remain intact.\par \par \uc2 Even if the Santa Claus rally proves to be a damp squib on this occasion, it\u8217\'20\'19s no biggie: The bags investors have accumulated now are likely to stand them in good stead next year as the crypto market continues to grind higher. They don\u8217\'20\'19t have to leave a glass of milk and some cookies out, but there\u8217\'20\'19s no excuse for not being ready for Santa this Christmas.\par \par \uc2 Gracy Chen is the CEO of Bitget. Before this role, she held executive positions at XRSpace, and was an early investor in BitKeep.\par \par \uc2 This article is for general information purposes and is not intended to be and should not be taken as legal or investment advice. The views, thoughts, and opinions expressed here are the author\u8217\'20\'19s alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTIvMDE5MzkwMDktN2Q4My03ZmY2LTk0NGMtOTYyYmQ3NTRiNjhl.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241216ekcg0008i\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
