\par\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Maintains the $100K Level Despite a  \highlight22\uc2 Bearish \highlight\uc2  Few Days: 4 Altcoins Expected to Gain Traction in the Next Weeks\b0\par\par\uc2 Jana Serfontein \par \uc2 1,113 \uc2 words\par \uc2 15 December 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Pepe (PEPE)}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Floki Inu (FLOKI)}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Popcat (POPCAT)}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu (HINU)}}}\par \par \uc2 The past few days have not turned out in favour of retail traders and investors. While Bitcoin (BTC) maintains its support at $100,000, many other major cryptocurrencies are underperforming, showing a retreat across the altcoin market.\par \par \uc2 \u8216\'20\'18Tis the season for rallies, profits, and gains, but this weekend has failed to bring much-needed relief for retail investors. While BTC holds steady above $100,000, major altcoins, including Pepe (PEPE), Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ), and \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) are facing \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  action resulting in price drops ranging between 5% and 8%. All hope is not lost as BTC maintains its position, trading around {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $101,700}}}\uc2 . The upcoming weeks should result in recovery as President-elect Trump\u8217\'20\'19s inauguration draws closer, along with the official resignation of current SEC chief \uc2 Gary Gensler\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Join us as we delve into four altcoin projects analysts predict will soon gain traction.\par \par \uc2 Pepe (PEPE)\par \par \uc2 Pepe (PEPE) is a notable underperformer of the past few days, losing nearly 5% in the 24-hour charts and almost 10% in the weekly charts. The much-beloved memecoin has lost almost 20% of its value since recently setting a new \uc2 ATH\uc2  and now trades for {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/pepe/#News"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $0.00002299}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Pepe (PEPE) is a fan favourite among crypto investors, gaining a whopping 1,520% in the past year. The project is currently the third largest memecoin with a market cap of $9.64 billion. This popular memecoins quickly gained infamy for being a tribute to the 2000s internet meme sensation Pepe the Frog. Pepe has continued a reward streak driven by its robust community, rapid ascent and highly optimistic future projections. Analysts predict the memecoin will potentially increase by over 2100% by 2030, positioning it as a prime opportunity for those interested in meme coins' speculative aspects. Pepe has also handsomely gained since the Trump victory, gaining over 14% in the past month. PEPE\u8217\'20\'19s popularity and value surged after exchanges {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/RobinhoodApp/status/1857106460326392040"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Robinhood}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.coinbase.com/en-gb/explore"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coinbase}}}\uc2  listed the memecoin for trading, skyrocketing the memecoin to a new ATH of $0.00002748 on December 9, 2024.\par \par \uc2 Floki Inu (FLOKI)\par \par \uc2 Floki Inu (FLOKI) also appears to be having difficulty over the past few days, resulting in a 6.8% decline in the 24-hour charts at the time of writing. Despite releasing a no-fee crypto debit card earlier this week, FLOKI\u8217\'20\'19s price dropped nearly 14% over the past week.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/exciting-memecoins-to-watch-in-2024-shib-floki-doge-and-hinu"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Floki Inu}}}\uc2  (FLOKI) initially came to market as a celebration of the meme culture but quickly rose through the ranks to become a serious investment opportunity. The project owes its success to a very active community and innovative marketing campaigns, allowing it to expand its utility. Floki Inu recently became a fully functional Web 3 service provider housing a range of Web 3 features. With its expansion, the Floki ecosystem now houses a range of Web 3 ventures, including TokenFi for NFT and asset tokenization, a P2E metaverse, a staking dApp, and a Decentralized Finance (DeFi) marketplace.\par \par \uc2 While FLOKI\u8217\'20\'19s recent underperformance is understandable, given the broader market downturn in the face of macroeconomic uncertainty, FLOKI will likely recover in the coming weeks.\par \par \uc2 FLOKI\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2024/12/10/floki-releases-no-fee-crypto-debit-card-boosting-token-fundamentals"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 zero-fee debit card}}}\uc2  allows users to spend Bitcoin (BTC), Ether (ETH), USD Coin (USDC), tether (USDT), BNB Chain\u8217\'20\'19s BNB and FLOKI globally at merchants that accept \uc2 VISA\uc2  or \uc2 Mastercard\uc2 . There are zero transaction and exchange rate fees, and it is compatible with over eight blockchain networks. The card is currently available in 31 European countries with plans to expand the offering to other countries in future.\par \par \uc2 Popcat (POPCAT)\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/popcat-sol/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 POPCAT}}}\uc2  is a recent addition to the crypto sector, aiming to revive the market still plagued by challenges such as inactive wallets and \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The memecoin addresses common issues like pump-and-dump schemes and rug pulls by promoting transparency and security. Utilizing innovative blockchain technology and leveraging the power of the Solana network, POPCAT seeks to provide fast and secure transactions. The project's goals are robust, and its potential to deliver significant returns makes it a coin of interest for those looking to explore new ventures in the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  space. POPCAT\u8217\'20\'19s (POPCAT) market cap has grown to $1.05 billion, but its price has pulled back heavily following a good rally after \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s election victory. POPCAT\u8217\'20\'19s performance over the past week and month has been very \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , resulting in a 35% drop in the 30-day chart.\par \par \uc2 Despite its recent underperformance, the memecoin has been successful as the first-ever cat-themed token. POPCAT\u8217\'20\'19s staggering 6,522% gain over the past year demonstrates that meme culture, backed by strong community support, can propel projects to the top of the market.\par \par \uc2 Husky Inu (HINU)\par \par \uc2 As BTC continues to trade around $100,000, investors must look for well-priced alternative investment opportunities to profit from the bull run, and Husky Inu is precisely that.\par \par \uc2 Powering up for an epic crypto rally! {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/HuskyInu?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #HuskyInu}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/biysMWXfmx"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/biysMWXfmx}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Husky Inu (@huskyinureal) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/huskyinureal/status/1867264611323396552?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 December 12, 2024}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://thehuskyinu.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu (HINU)}}}\uc2  is the latest Solana-based memecoin to grace the market. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/top-memecoins-to-invest-in-hinu-shib-floki-and-doge"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu}}}\uc2  was created to bring its holders more value and utility by leveraging this robust blockchain. The project and its native token, HINU, want to make their mark on the saturated memecoin market by building a supportive community with innovative features and enhanced rewards. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/solana-memecoins-to-watch-hinu-maga-bonk-and-dawgz"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu}}}\uc2  recently launched the presale for HINU, and the fundraising has attracted a fair amount of attention.\par \par \uc2 Husky Inu (HINU) has exceeded its presale goals, smashing its $618,000 fundraising target. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/solanas-superstar-memecoins-hinu-wif-bonk-and-maga"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu}}}\uc2  is working on some exciting things, including an Earn App and a Decentralized Exchange. The Earn App will reward users with HINU tokens for engaging with the project, and the Decentralized Exchange will facilitate decentralized trading to improve utility and value for HINU holders. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/10/5-cheap-memecoins-poised-to-make-millionaires"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu}}}\uc2  boasts several unique features that set it apart from traditional investment opportunities, including a capped token supply, a deflationary mechanism, speedy transactions, and charity voting.\par \par \uc2 Husky Inu\u8217\'20\'19s presale success sets the tone for immense gains and is expected to skyrocket following exchange listings. HINU presale tokens are available at a modest $0.00015000 with exceptional profit potential for early backers.\par \par \uc2 Visit the following links for more information on Husky Inu:\par \par \uc2 Website: Husky Inu Official Website\par \par \uc2 Twitter\uc2 : {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/huskyinureal"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu Twitter}}}\par \par \uc2 Telegram: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.me/thehuskyinu"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu Telegram}}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020241216ekcf0000e\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
