\par\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Is Back Above $100K! 3 Large-Cap Altcoins That Made Major Gains Recently\b0\par\par\uc2 Jana Serfontein \par \uc2 1,131 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 December 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Large-Cap Altcoins Make Major Gains}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple\u8217\'20\'19s XRP Rallies}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22  Gains Almost 100% in the 30-day Charts}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana (SOL) Market Cap Exceeds $106 Billion}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Newcomer Husky Inu (HINU) Completes Third Presale Round}}}\par \par \uc2 The market skyrocketed after \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  won the US presidential election and SEC Chair \uc2 Gary Gensler\uc2  announced his imminent resignation. Since these significant events, Bitcoin (BTC) finally broke through the $100,000 level to set a new ATH of $103,900. While the market corrected, causing BTC to dip below $100,000, it has recovered, allowing BTC to trade above this vital level once again.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) maintains its position as the most trusted \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2 , setting the pace for the altcoin market to follow. As the dominant store of value, BTC remains the go-to choice for institutional investors, with its recent run to an ATH of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $103,900}}}\uc2  underscoring why it is held in such high regard.\par \par \uc2 Large-Cap Altcoins Make Major Gains\par \par \uc2 Crypto enthusiasts have waited years and years for BTC to reach $100,000 finally and are continuously searching for an investment opportunity that will skyrocket with BTC\u8217\'20\'19s run. While BTC sets the pace for the rest of the market, we have seen many projects surpass Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s growth, with this number increasing daily. Bitcoin will forever remain the G.O.A.T and is seen by many as the digital equivalent of gold. Despite BTC\u8217\'20\'19s strong reputation, altcoins are more likely to deliver more significant gains as we approach the altcoin season.\par \par \uc2 Some of the biggest altcoin opportunities include the ever-popular Ripple (XRP), Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ) and Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ). The latest newcomer from the Solana network, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/12/bitcoin-btc-toys-with-100k-and-memecoin-husky-inu-hinu-presale-hits-new-fundraising-goals"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu (HINU)}}}\uc2 , also emerged as a significant player in the industry.\par \par \uc2 Ripple\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s XRP Rallies\par \par \uc2 Ripple\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s XRP has gained massively over the past month and is now the fourth-largest crypto with a market capitalization exceeding $136 billion. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/xrp/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple (XRP)}}}\uc2  has witnessed a spectacular gain in value after news of \uc2 Gary Gensler\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s planned exit emerged and now trades for $2.29, a whopping 240% surge in the past month. \uc2 Ripple Labs\uc2  has been embroiled in a highly publicized legal battle with the securities agency for which it paid a hefty price. In 2020, the regulator sued \uc2 Ripple\uc2  for its supposed breach of securities laws, resulting in many exchanges, such as \uc2 Coinbase\uc2 , Kraken, \uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 , and \uc2 Gemini\uc2 , choosing to delist XRP, causing the price to tank. \uc2 Ripple\uc2  finally found some relief after a partial victory in 2023 ended the SEC\u8217\'20\'19s 3-year-long crusade against the company. The Southern District of New York Court delivered a partial victory to \uc2 Ripple\uc2  in its matter with the SEC after Judge Analisa Torres {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/07/xrp-value-soars-as-relisting-wave-follows-ripple-s-sec-victory"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ruled}}}\uc2  that \uc2 Ripple\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s XRP token is \u8220\'20\'1Cnot necessarily a security on its face.\u8221\'20\'1D XRP\u8217\'20\'19s price gained over 3.9% in the past week, with a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outlook for its future.\par \par \uc2 Ripple\uc2  received some further \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  news after Chris Giancarlo, former chair of the CFTC, predicted the SEC would {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/11/former-cftc-chair-predicts-sec-will-drop-ripple-case"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 drop}}}\uc2  its case against the company. The price of XRP surged further after WisdomTree filed an S-1 application for a spot XRP ETF.\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  Gains Almost 100% in the 30-day Charts\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) is another major gainer since \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s election victory. On-chain metrics show Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s weekly active addresses elevated since the crypto market rally triggered by Trump\u8217\'20\'19s win on November 6 began. The surge in network usage and whale buying activity has resulted in a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outlook for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  further surged after the Cardano blockchain developers, the Cardano Foundation, released an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cardanofoundation.org/blog/proposal-for-cardano-constitution"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 updated proposal for the Cardano Constitution}}}\uc2  to improve network governance. The revised proposal includes changes to constitutional workshops, social media discussion, and expert and community feedback. The changes aim to \u8220\'20\'1Cimprove the accessibility and clarity of the Cardano governance framework,\u8221\'20\'1D shifting its focus to a less technical audience. Interest in Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) surged after its founder, \uc2 Charles Hoskinson\uc2 , revealed plans to help shape US crypto policy under \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s incoming administration. \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  gained over 95% in the past month and currently trades at $1.11.\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) Market Cap Exceeds $106 Billion\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ) is one of the hottest altcoins this year, with gains exceeding 233% in the past year. The \uc2 Solana\uc2  network is the go-to platform for memecoin developments thanks to its ability to handle high TPS at low transaction fees. The power of the \uc2 Solana\uc2  blockchain and the network\u8217\'20\'19s robust and active community make it the ideal space for memecoin development.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/solana/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana (SOL)}}}\uc2  has become a formidable player in the crypto space, and now it is targeting a considerable part of Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s (ETH) market share. \uc2 SOL\uc2  reached a new ATH of $263.70 on November 23 as Solana ETF regulatory filings surged after \uc2 Gary Gensler\uc2  confirmed his {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/11/solana-etf-regulatory-filings-surge-as-gensler-confirms-sec-departure"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 departure}}}\uc2  from the SEC. \uc2 SOL\uc2  lost some ground since reaching its \uc2 ATH\uc2  and is now the 5th largest cryptocurrency with a market cap of $107.12 billion, currently trading for $223.55.\par \par \uc2 Newcomer Husky Inu (HINU) Completes Third Presale Round\par \par \uc2 As BTC hovers around the $100,000 level and large-cap altcoins make good gains, investors must look for well-priced alternative investment opportunities to profit from the bull run, and Husky Inu is precisely that.\par \par \uc2 Husky Inu (HINU) is one of the newest members of the Solana network, created to bring its holders more value and utility by leveraging the power of this robust blockchain. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/husky-inu-hinu-raises-over-55k-in-early-presale"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu}}}\uc2  recently launched the presale of its native token, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/husky-inu-hinu-presale-hits-100k-in-sales"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HINU}}}\uc2 , with tremendous success, and the two are on a mission to conquer the memecoin industry through a robust and supportive community with innovative features and enhanced rewards.\par \par \uc2 Husky Inu recently completed its third fundraising round and, since going live, has generated over $618,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/solanas-superstar-memecoins-hinu-wif-bonk-and-maga"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu}}}\uc2  is working on some exciting things, including an Earn App and a Decentralized Exchange. The Earn App will reward users with HINU tokens for engaging with the project, and the Decentralized Exchange will facilitate decentralized trading to improve utility and value for HINU holders. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/10/5-cheap-memecoins-poised-to-make-millionaires"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu}}}\uc2  boasts several unique features that set it apart from traditional investment opportunities, including a capped token supply, a deflationary mechanism, speedy transactions, and charity voting.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://thehuskyinu.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click here}}}\par \par \uc2 HINU tokens are available at a modest $0.00015000 and are expected to surge once listed on major exchanges.\par \par \uc2 Visit the following links for more information on Husky Inu:\par \par \uc2 Website: Husky Inu Official Website\par \par \uc2 Twitter\uc2 : {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/huskyinureal"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu Twitter}}}\par \par \uc2 Telegram: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.me/thehuskyinu"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu Telegram}}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020241214ekcd0000p\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
