utional adoption, and Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) steady market corrections\u8212\'20\'14here are the 5 best cryptos to watch in December 2024!\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://blockdag.network/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click here}}}\par \par \uc2 BlockDAG: Scalable Tech and Profitable Bonuses\par \par \uc2 BlockDAG (BDAG) is rewriting blockchain scalability with its DAG-based architecture, merging blockchain\u8217\'20\'19s security and decentralization with DAG\u8217\'20\'19s high-speed transaction processing.\par \par \uc2 This design allows BlockDAG to handle a significantly higher volume of transactions, even during peak usage, while maintaining resilience against congestion. Its parallel processing capability ensures adaptability to growing demand, positioning it for mainstream adoption and long-term sustainability. For instance, in real-world applications, BlockDAG\u8217\'20\'19s scalability supports seamless financial systems, enabling instant cross-border payments without network crashes.\par \par \uc2 This robust foundation has fueled crypto enthusiasts\u8217\'20\'19 confidence in BlockDAG, contributing to its remarkable presale journey. Currently priced at $0.0234 in Batch 26, BDAG reveals a 2240% increase since its first batch. To date, the network has raised over $164 million in presale revenue with more than 17 billion coins sold.\par \par \uc2 Analysts predict that BlockDAG\u8217\'20\'19s strong fundamentals coupled with a significant presale hike, could yield up to 30,000x ROI for early holders, making it one of the best cryptos to watch in December 2024.\par \par \uc2 2. Aptos: $15 Coin Price Achieved & New Innovations Incoming\par \par \uc2 Aptos (APT) has gained momentum as one of the best cryptos to watch in December 2024, with its price rising from $9.6 in late November to $15 recently, pushing its market cap near $8 billion.\par \par \uc2 While still below its 2021 peak of $20, the Aptos team plans for extensive advances, including parallel transaction processing and on-chain randomness, enabling scalable infrastructure for billions of transactions. These features can support diverse use cases, such as prediction markets and integrated payment systems for loyalty programs.\par \par \uc2 3. Bitcoin Cash: Reaching New Heights with $12.9B Market Cap\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash (BCH), a prominent Bitcoin spinoff, is experiencing renewed attention as it recovers to $600 with a market cap of $12.9 billion. With its scalable transaction model and focus on fast, low-cost payments, BCH remains a key player in the blockchain ecosystem.\par \par \uc2 Analysts speculate it could reach $1,000, requiring a 1.5x increase in price and market cap beyond $19 billion. Optimism surrounding Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s potential six-figure rise may drive a spillover effect, benefiting BCH as a faster, cheaper alternative.\par \par \uc2 4. Cardano: Market Dip Followed by Modest Recovery\par \par \uc2 Cardano experienced a steep 16% drop recently, briefly reaching $0.91 before closing at $1, marking its largest single-day decline since 2021. On December 10, 2024, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  saw a slight recovery, rising 1.3% to $1.02.\par \par \uc2 This decline reduced Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s market capitalization to $35.6 billion, ranking it ninth among cryptocurrencies. The drop reflects market profit-taking and broader dynamics, with \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  showing signs of exhaustion. The Relative Strength Index (RSI) exiting overbought territory signals a cooling phase for the asset.\par \par \uc2 5. Ethereum: ETF Inflows Signal Growing \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  Trend\par \par \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) saw a 10% drop on Monday as profit-taking reached $2.5 billion, triggering a two-year high in futures liquidations. Despite this, Ethereum ETFs posted a record $836.8 million net inflow last week, led by \uc2 BlackRock\uc2 's ETHA, which contributed $573 million.\par \par \uc2 Total ETF inflows surpassed $1.4 billion, reflecting growing institutional interest. Additionally, over 256K ETH was withdrawn from exchanges, signaling \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment as reserves decreased. Due to its strong fundamentals, Ethereum remains among the best cryptos to watch in December 2024.\par \par \uc2 Summing Up: Best Cryptos to Watch in December 2024\par \par \uc2 To summarize, Aptos demonstrates its potential through stablecoin integration and scalable infrastructure, while Bitcoin Cash gains attention as a fast, cost-effective crypto option.\par \par \uc2 Cardano's modest recovery signals resilience amid market corrections and Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s institutional inflows highlight growing confidence. However, with its strong foundation and exceptional growth potential signaling a 30,000x ROI potential, BlockDAG remains one of the best cryptos to watch in December 2024.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored article and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020241214ekcd0000j\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
