\par\par \b \uc2 Crypto Price Analysis 12-13 BITCOIN: BTC, ETHEREUM: ETH, SOLANA: SOL, BITTENSOR: TAO, CELESTIA: TIA, ARBITRUM: ARB, HEDERA: HBAR\b0\par\par\uc2 Amara Khatri \par \uc2 2,639 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 December 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Japanese Lawmaker Proposes National Bitcoin Reserve}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Oddo To Enter Stablecoin Market With Fireblocks}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Could Catapult Beyond $5,000}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Trump Believes US Is Going To Do Something Great With Crypto}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-7"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bittensor (TAO) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Celestia (TIA) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-10"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Arbitrum (ARB) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-11"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Hedera (HBAR) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) reached an intraday high of $102,500 on Thursday as the crypto market staged a dramatic recovery after the crash earlier in the week. However, selling pressure forced BTC below $100,000, with the cryptocurrency down 1.24% and trading at $99,750.\par \par \uc2 The crash earlier in the week liquidated over 100,000 traders, leading to a total of $298.5 million in total liquidations. The crypto market cap, which registered a dramatic increase when markets recovered, is down by 1.33% and currently sits at $3.6 trillion.\par \par \uc2 Most cryptocurrencies have started the day in the red, with Ethereum (ETH) down marginally and trading just below $4,000. \uc2 Solana\uc2  (SOL) is down by 1.36% and trading at $227, while {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/DOGE-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE)}}}\uc2  is down almost 2% and trading at $0.408. Notable declines have also been registered by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/ADA-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 )}}}\uc2 , Shiba Inu (SHIB), Toncoin (TON), and Polkadot (DOT). However, Avalanche (AVAX) and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/LINK-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Chainlink (LINK)}}}\uc2  have defied the broader market, registering gains of 5.97% and 10.90%.\par \par \uc2 Japanese Lawmaker Proposes National Bitcoin Reserve\par \par \uc2 A Japanese lawmaker has asked the government to create a national Bitcoin reserve, following similar calls by lawmakers in Argentina and Russia. Satoshi Hamada, an MP from the Party to Protect the People from NHK, made the proposal. Hamada presented a written request to the Japanese government regarding the creation of a reserve for cryptocurrencies. The lawmaker pointed out similar plans have been proposed in Brazil and the United States, where Treasury officials could hold {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/12/crypto-price-analysis-12-12-bitcoin-btc-ethereum-eth-solana-sol-ripple-xrp-uniswap-uni-chainlink-link-algorand-algo"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC)}}}\uc2  as a strategic reserve. The lawmaker asked the government to consider converting part of its foreign exchange reserves into cryptocurrencies like BTC.\par \par \uc2 Hamada pointed out that BTC is less susceptible to the influence of countries and institutions, and its neutrality and decentralized nature allow it to support economic activity without relying on a specific currency. The government will present Hamada with a written response, which is also likely to be published on its website.\par \par \uc2 Oddo To Enter Stablecoin Market With \uc2 Fireblocks\par \par \uc2 Asset manager and private banking services provider Oddo is collaborating with \uc2 Fireblocks\uc2  to crack the stablecoin market. The project will launch as early as next year. Stablecoins have become popular among traders thanks to their low \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The project comes after \uc2 Societe Generale SA\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s crypto asset unit in France, which uses the euro-dominated stablecoin (EUR).\par \par \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Could Catapult Beyond $5,000\par \par \uc2 The crypto markets have bounced back after experiencing a spate of liquidations during the week. However, none have rebounded as strongly as Ethereum (ETH). The world\u8217\'20\'19s second-largest cryptocurrency is on the brink of moving past $4,000, a key resistance level, and is up almost 24$ over the past month, with its gains surpassing even BTC. An analyst from Nexo predicted ETH could cross $5,000 as early as 2025 and set a new all-time high.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe cogs and bolts are in place. Ethereum could catapult beyond $5,000 as early as 2025.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Some analysts believe ETH has an edge because it is the only token other than BTC with a US-based ETF.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CETH has a big advantage in that it\u8217\'20\'19s the only token besides BTC to have a US ETF. As traditional investors allocate more to crypto they will look to ETH as a natural alternative.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Trump Believes US Is Going To Do Something Great With Crypto\par \par \uc2 President-elect \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  has said the US will do great things with crypto during his upcoming term and become the global leader for cryptocurrency in the next four years. Trump made the comments in response to a question about setting up a strategic Bitcoin reserve, stating,\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe\u8217\'20\'19re going to do something great with crypto because we don\u8217\'20\'19t want China or anybody else. But others are embracing it, and we want to be ahead.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Trump\u8217\'20\'19s views on crypto are a welcome change for the industry and investors from the current administration, which led a crackdown on the industry.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/BTC-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC)}}}\uc2  went above the $100,000 mark again late on Thursday, reaching an intraday high of $102,507. The jump came after the release of November's US Consumer Price Index (CPI) data, which came along expected lines. The data reinforced optimism about a potential Federal Reserve rate cut next week. However, BTC couldn't maintain its momentum for long, as it dipped below $100,000 and is currently trading around the $99,900 mark. BTC\u8217\'20\'19s latest price action marks a strong recovery from the market crash earlier in the week when BTC dipped below $95,000. Almost all cryptocurrencies registered a substantial \b \highlight22\uc2 price drop\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 However, BTC\u8217\'20\'19s recovery following the crash also led to a recovery in the broader market, with prominent altcoins notching up double-digit gains. ETFs registered record-breaking inflows, with \uc2 BlackRock\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s iShares ETFs accounting for a staggering $3.2 billion.\par \par \uc2 Now, let\u8217\'20\'19s take a look at BTC\u8217\'20\'19s price chart. BTC set a new all-time high last week as it surged past $100,000 and peaked at $103,900. However, buyers lost momentum after reaching this level, and the price plummeted, falling to a low of $92,279 before settling at $97,094. However, the price picked up on Friday as BTC registered an increase of almost 3% and settled at $99,695. Buyers retained control over the weekend, with BTC registering a marginal increase on Saturday and then rising by 1.32% to go above $100,000 and settle at $101,043. However, selling pressure increased significantly on Monday as markets collapsed. As a result, BTC dropped by 3.57%, going below the 20-day SMA to a low of $94,185. However, buyers propped up the price from this level, and it recovered to settle at $97.434.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/5fy8ePSS/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Sellers retained control on Tuesday as BTC dropped to a low of $94,313 before settling at $96,912, registering a marginal decline. Buyers returned to the market on Wednesday as BTC recovered, rising over 4% to reclaim $100,000 and settle at $100,900. Buyers pushed BTC to an intraday high of $102,530 on Thursday before losing momentum. As a result, sellers drove BTC down by 0.97% as it slipped below $100,000 and settled at $99,923. The current session sees BTC marginally down as buyers and sellers struggle to establish control.\par \par \uc2 If buyers take control, BTC could attempt to reclaim $100,000 and push toward its all-time high. Surpassing this level could push BTC to $105,000. If sellers take control, BTC could drop to $97,000 before finding support.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/ETH-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum (ETH)}}}\uc2  has made a strong recovery over the past few sessions as it looks to go above the resistance at $4,000. However, it faces an uphill task to overcome this level, with sellers active. ETH faced considerable \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  last Thursday, which saw the \b \highlight22\uc2 price rise\b0 \highlight\uc2  to an intraday high of $3,957 and drop to an intraday low of $3,644 before settling at $3,787. However, it recovered strongly on Friday as ETH rose almost 6% to move above $4,000 and settled at $4,003. The weekend saw a tussle between buyers and sellers, and ETH registered a marginal decline on Saturday to drop below $4,000 and settle at $3,999. However, buyers pushed ETH above $4,000 on Sunday as it settled at $4,007 after a marginal increase.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/6jMwh8aP/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The current week began with a substantial increase in \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment as ETH dropped over 7%, reaching an intraday low of $3,504 before reclaiming $3,700 and settling at $3,719. Sellers retained control on Tuesday as ETH dipped to a low of $3,519 before ultimately settling at $3,630, registering a decline of 2.32%. Sentiment changed on Wednesday as ETH made a strong recovery, rising almost 6% to go above $3,800 and settling at $3,834. Buyers attempted a move past $4,000 on Thursday. However, ETH lost momentum after reaching an intraday high of $3,988 and settled at $3,882, registering an increase of 1.26%. The current session sees ETH up just over 1% as it looks to retest the resistance at $4,000.\par \par \uc2 Some analysts are confident ETH will surpass $4,000 and possibly surge beyond $5,000 as early as 2025.\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  (SOL)\u8217\'20\'19s struggles to go above the 20-day SMA continue as sellers repelled another attempt to go above it. SOL has witnessed considerable \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  as buyers struggle to push toward $250 and sellers look to lower the price. SOL reached an intraday high of $246 last Friday as it briefly went past the 20-day SMA. However, buyers lost momentum, and SOL ultimately settled at $237, registering only a marginal increase. The weekend was mixed as SOL registered a marginal rise on Saturday and a marginal decline on Sunday to end the weekend on a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  note.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/JpaeESp8/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, selling pressure intensified considerably on Monday as SOL plummeted 8.55%, falling to an intraday low of $205 before settling at $216. Sellers retained control on Tuesday as SOL dropped to an intraday low of $203. However, buyers propped up the price, and SOL ultimately settled at $213 after a drop of 1.47%. Despite considerable \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment, SOL recovered on Wednesday, rising over 6% and settling at $227. Buyers attempted to go above the 20-day SMA on Thursday as SOL reached an intraday high of $234. However, they lost momentum in the face of selling pressure at this level, and SOL fell back, dropping to $227 and registering a marginal decline. Sellers have retained control during the current session, with SOL down 1.51% and trading at $223. If sellers retain control, SOL could drop to $215. If this level is breached, the price could drop to $200.\par \par \uc2 Bittensor (TAO) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Bittensor (TAO) declined considerably during the week, as selling pressure registered a notable increase, and \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment dominated the market. TAO was \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  towards the end of last week, rising to an intraday high of $725 on Friday before settling at $705, registering an increase of almost 4%. However, momentum waned on Saturday as TAO dropped 0.95%, falling below $700 and settling at $699. In a sign of things to come, the price fell to an intraday low of $675 on Sunday before recovering to register an increase of 2.03% and go above $700 to settle at $713.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/Nlfh54H9/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Markets collapsed on Monday and TAO plummeted almost 16%, going below the 20-day SMA and 50-day SMA to drop to a low of $504. However, with buyers active at lower levels, the price recovered partially and settled at $600. Sellers continued to dominate the market on Tuesday as TAO dropped over 4% to settle at $575, but not before recovering from a low of $529. Wednesday witnessed a significant jump in \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  as buyers and sellers struggled to establish control. Sellers ultimately gained the upper hand, and TAO registered an increase of 4.34% and settled at $600. Buyers attempted a move past the 20-day SMA on Thursday as TAO reached an intraday high of $645. However, they lost momentum after reaching this level, allowing sellers to take over. As a result, TAO dropped almost 4% to $577. The current session sees TAO down by 1.32%, as sellers look to lower the price toward the $550 support level.\par \par \uc2 Celestia (TIA) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Celestia (TIA) was quite \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  towards the end of the previous week as it registered an increase of 7.31% on Friday and settled at $8.84. However, It failed to stay above the resistance at $9 as sellers drove the price lower. As a result, TIA dropped over 4% on Saturday and 1.11% on Sunday to end the weekend at $8.37. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment increased substantially on Monday as markets collapsed. As a result, TIA plummeted over 20%, going below the 20-day SMA, and settled at $6.68.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/gEP4wyga/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Tuesday saw a significant jump in \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  as buyers and sellers struggled to establish control. As a result, TIA rose to an intraday high of $7.31 and fell to an intraday low of $6.24 before settling at $6.64 after a marginal decline. Buyers returned to the market on Wednesday as TIA registered an increase of 8.49% to go above $7 and settle at $7.20. Buyers attempted to drive TIA above $7.50 on Thursday as it reached an intraday high of $7.65. However, it lost momentum after reaching this level and dropped to $7.20. The current session sees TIA down by almost 1% as sellers look to drive it towards $7.\par \par \uc2 Arbitrum (ARB) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Arbitrum (ARB) has recovered during recent sessions after plummeting below $1 at the beginning of the week. ARB reached an intraday high of $1.24 on Friday before settling at $1.13. However, sentiment changed over the weekend, dropping by 0.89% on Saturday and 0.43% on Sunday to settle at $1.15. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment increased significantly on Monday as ARB plummeted over 17%, going below the 20-day SMA to an intraday low of $0.84. However, it recovered from this level to climb above the 20-day SMA and settle at $0.96. Selling pressure persisted on Tuesday as ARB went below the 20-day SMA after a drop of just over 2% and settled at $0.93.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/C3jMCSyZ/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Despite considerable selling pressure, ARB recovered on Wednesday, registering an increase of 6.51% to go above the 20-day SMA and settle at $0.99. Buyers retained control on Tuesday as ARB surged to an intraday high of $1.11. However, it could not stay at this level and dropped to $1.02, registering an increase of almost 3%. The current session sees ARB up by 2.57% and trading at $1.05 as buyers look to consolidate above $1.\par \par \uc2 Hedera (HBAR) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Hedera (HBAR) is attempting to reclaim $0.30 after suffering a dramatic collapse at the beginning of the week. Sentiment around HBAR changed over the weekend as it dropped almost 10% on Saturday after failing to go above $0.40. The price registered a marginal increase on Sunday before falling back in the red on Monday, dropping almost 16% to an intraday low of $0.236 before settling at $0.280. Despite starting the week on a negative note, HBAR recovered on Tuesday, registering an increase of 3.33% after falling to an intraday low of $0.252 and settling at $0.289.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/oY2kqDZX/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Sellers retained control on Wednesday as HBAR registered an increase of almost 3% and settled at $0.298. Buyers attempted to go above $0.30 on Thursday as HBAR rose to an intraday high of $0.315. However, it could not stay at this level and fell below $0.30 to settle at $0.292. The current session sees HBAR up over 3% and trading at $0.301 as buyers look to consolidate above $0.30.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020241214ekcd0001c\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 12/13: BTC, ETH, XRP, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , BNB, DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , LINK, SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,921 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 December 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin bulls are fighting to flip the $100,000 level to support. Will altcoins follow?\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTIvMDE5M2MwZTctZjU1NC03MzE3LWJmNTYtZWNiYzVjNzBjN2Ux.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 12/13: BTC, ETH, XRP, SOL, BNB, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, LINK, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) continues to witness a tough battle between the bulls and the bears near the $100,000 level. A positive sign is that the bulls have not ceded much ground to the bears, increasing the likelihood of an upside breakout.\par \par \uc2 Bitfinex\uc2  head of derivatives Jag Kooner said that the rate cut by the \uc2 People\u8217\'20\'19s Bank of China\uc2  on Nov. 21 and by the \uc2 European Central Bank\uc2  on Dec. 12 could \u8220\'20\'1Cspur capital flows into risk-on markets, including crypto.\u8221\'20\'1D The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-predicted-160k-2025-macroeconomic-boost"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sentiment could improve further}}}\uc2  if the \uc2 United States Federal Reserve\uc2  cuts the rate in its Dec. 18 meeting. That could boost Bitcoin to \u8220\'20\'1Crecord-breaking levels\u8221\'20\'1D by the end of the year.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193c158-9726-7aad-b7dc-d1ab79bb97b2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Bitcoin Price, XRP, ECB, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Interest Rate, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Chainlink, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Analysts anticipate Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s rally to extend in 2025. According to a report by \uc2 Sygnum Bank\uc2 , a crypto-focused asset manager, Bitcoin could witness \u8220\'20\'1Cdemand shocks\u8221\'20\'1D in 2025 due to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/2025-demand-shock-bitcoin-price-spike-sygnum"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 increased institutional participation, sending its price higher}}}\uc2 . The report added that altcoins could participate in the rally only if the US passes laws supporting \b \highlight22\uc2 crypto adoption\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin start the next leg of the rally, boosting buying in altcoins, or will the recovery falter? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin rose above the $101,900 overhead resistance on Dec. 12, but the bulls could not maintain the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193c0e1-d070-76a1-a377-e963f5e30328"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Bitcoin Price, XRP, ECB, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Interest Rate, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Chainlink, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages indicate advantage to buyers, but the negative divergence on the relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) suggests that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum is weakening. If buyers want to remain in control, they will have to thrust the price above $104,088. If they do that, the BTC/USDT pair could soar to $113,331 and then to $125,000.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day exponential moving average ($96,916), it will suggest that the bulls are losing their grip. The pair may skid to $90,000, which is likely to attract buyers. The short-term trend will tilt in favor of the bears if they yank the price below the 50-day simple moving average ($87,267).\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bears to sink Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) below the downtrend line attracted strong buying by the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193c0e2-6f3f-721b-9012-d4640ff3d98f"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Bitcoin Price, XRP, ECB, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Interest Rate, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Chainlink, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The ETH/USDT pair reached near $4,000 on Dec. 12, where the bears are expected to mount a strong defense. If the price turns down from the current level but rebounds off the 20-day EMA ($3,686), it will signal a positive sentiment. That will improve the prospects of a rally above $4,094. The pair may then climb to $4,500.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bears are fiercely defending the $4,094 level. That may keep the pair range bound between $4,094 and $3,500 for some time.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) turned lower from the downtrend line on Dec. 12, but the bears are struggling to pull the price to the 20-day EMA ($2.11).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193c0e3-0349-71ec-88f6-6a6288beb669"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Bitcoin Price, XRP, ECB, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Interest Rate, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Chainlink, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls bought the minor dip and are again trying to push the price above the downtrend line. If they can pull it off, the XRP/USDT pair could rise to $2.65. This level may act as a stiff hurdle, but if crossed, the rally could reach $2.91. The bears are expected to defend the $2.91 level with all their might because a break above it clears the path for a possible rally to $3.50.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA and the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $1.90 are likely to act as solid support on the downside.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) rose above the 20-day EMA ($228) on Dec. 12, but the long wick on the candlestick shows selling near the resistance line of the descending channel pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193c0e3-a5b5-7512-b3a7-55bb9a91a17c"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Bitcoin Price, XRP, ECB, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Interest Rate, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Chainlink, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. If the price remains below the 20-day EMA, the bears will try to pull the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair toward the support line. A break and close below the support line will suggest that the pair may have topped out in the short term.\par \par \uc2 If buyers want to retain the advantage, they will have to push and sustain the price above the resistance line. That will clear the path for a rally to $248 and, after that, to $264.\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) relief rally is facing selling at $722, but a minor positive is that the bulls have not allowed the price to dip back below the 20-day EMA ($689).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193c0e4-3604-753d-a78d-ee415eabc645"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Bitcoin Price, XRP, ECB, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Interest Rate, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Chainlink, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rises above $722, the BNB/USDT pair could move up to $761. Sellers are expected to pose a strong challenge in the $761 to $794 zone, but if the buyers pierce the resistance, the pair may skyrocket to $861.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price breaks below the 20-day EMA, the pair could slide to the 50-day SMA ($637). This remains the key level for the bulls to defend because a break below it may result in a drop to $520.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) re-entered the channel on Dec. 11, but the bulls are struggling to maintain the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.40).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193c0e4-ddf3-7bd1-b851-f21175c902cc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Bitcoin Price, XRP, ECB, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Interest Rate, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Chainlink, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks and remains below the 20-day EMA, the DOGE/USDT pair could skid to $0.36. A break and close below $0.36 could sink the pair to the 50-day SMA ($0.32), where the bulls are expected to step in.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the bulls will have to push and maintain the price above $0.43 to suggest that the breakdown below the channel may have been a bear trap. The pair will then attempt a rally to $0.48.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) relief rally is facing selling near the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $1.16.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193c0e5-678a-7b36-8fe4-c79a5052e72a"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Bitcoin Price, XRP, ECB, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Interest Rate, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Chainlink, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The immediate support on the downside is at the 20-day EMA ($1.05). If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will again try to drive the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT Pair above $1.16. If they succeed, the pair may challenge the $1.33 resistance.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, a break and close below the 20-day EMA will increase the possibility of a range formation. The pair may swing between $1.16 and $0.91 for a few days. A break below $0.91 indicates advantage to the bears.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/dogecoin-fractal-hints-85-doge-price-rally-amid-whale-accumulation"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin fractal hints at 85% DOGE price rally amid whale accumulation}}}\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) made a sharp comeback from $40.40 on Dec. 9, indicating aggressive buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193c0e6-00c0-71cc-8e8b-3263a4e1223e"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Bitcoin Price, XRP, ECB, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Interest Rate, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Chainlink, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are facing selling at $56, but if they do not allow the price to dip below $51, the likelihood of a breakout increases. The AVAX/USDT pair could climb to $60 and, after that, to $65.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price dips below $51, it will signal that demand dries up at higher levels. The pair could slump to the 20-day EMA ($47.07), which is an important level to watch out for. If the 20-day EMA cracks, the pair may plummet to the 50-day SMA ($37.22).\par \par \uc2 Chainlink price analysis\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/chainlink-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) turned up sharply from the 20-day EMA ($22.56) on Dec. 11 and broke above the overhead resistance at $27.41 on Dec. 12. However, the rally is facing selling at $30.94.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193c0e6-92d2-79f1-b334-b5b4f642b3be"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Bitcoin Price, XRP, ECB, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Interest Rate, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Chainlink, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the positive territory indicate that buyers have the edge. If the price bounced off $27.41, it will suggest that the bulls are trying to flip the level into support. That improves the prospects of a rally above $30.94. The LINK/USDT pair may jump to $34.50 and subsequently to $38.30.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of weakness will be a drop and close below $27.41. That opens the doors for a possible drop to the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) recovery hit a wall at the $0.000030 overhead resistance on Dec. 12, indicating that bears are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193c0e7-23e9-78b8-ae7c-d9d60f0a262f"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Bitcoin Price, XRP, ECB, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Interest Rate, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Chainlink, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.000028) is flattening out, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is near the midpoint, suggesting a balance between supply and demand. The SHIB/USDT pair may stay range-bound between the 50-day SMA ($0.000024) and the stiff overhead resistance of $0.000033.\par \par \uc2 Buyers will gain the upper hand if they propel the price above $0.000033. The pair could rally to $0.000039 and later to $0.000046. The advantage will tilt in favor of the bears if they sink the pair below the 50-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTIvMDE5M2MwZTctZjU1NC03MzE3LWJmNTYtZWNiYzVjNzBjN2Ux.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241213ekcd000ba\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
