\par\par \b \uc2 Crypto Price Analysis 12-11 BITCOIN: BTC, ETHEREUM: ETH, SOLANA: SOL, DOGWIFHAT: WIF, CARDANO:  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , APTOS: APT, FANTOM: FTM\b0\par\par\uc2 Amara Khatri \par \uc2 2,842 \uc2 words\par \uc2 11 December 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Google Unveils New Quantum Chip. Can It Crack Bitcoin?}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Microsoft Shareholders Reject Bitcoin Reserve}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Trump To Make Bitcoin (BTC) A Central Focus}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-7"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogwifhat (WIF) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Aptos (APT) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-10"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Fantom (FTM) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) reported another plunge below $95,000 late on Tuesday, falling to a low of $94,435 before recovering and climbing back above $97,000. The cryptocurrency is up marginally over the past 24 hours, trading around the $97,500 mark.\par \par \uc2 The decline comes shortly after the markets witnessed $1.5 billion in liquidations, impacting over 500,000 traders. BTC\u8217\'20\'19s sudden drop also significantly impacted the rest of the market, with the total market capitalization shrinking by over 7%.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, Ethereum (ETH) continued to trade in the red, with the price marginally down at $3,660. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/XRP-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple (XRP)}}}\uc2  has recovered from its recent drop, with the price up almost 8% and trading at $2.33. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/DOGE-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE)}}}\uc2  and Polkadot (DOT) also registered notable declines. Meanwhile, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/TRX-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tron (TRX)}}}\uc2 , Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), Toncoin (TON), {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/XLM-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Stellar (XLM)}}}\uc2 , and Uniswap (UNI) registered notable increases.\par \par \uc2 Google Unveils New Quantum Chip. Can It Crack Bitcoin?\par \par \uc2 Google has just announced its latest supercomputer chip, Willow. Willow can perform computations that would take today's supercomputers years in minutes. The chip garnered significant attention from the crypto community, which discussed its ability to crack secure blockchain networks and render the security of public key cryptography useless. The chip has led to considerable anxiety in some sections of the Bitcoin community, thanks to its potential to compromise Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s security and cryptographic techniques.\par \par \uc2 Willow boasts 105 qubits and an astonishing ability to minimize computational errors. According to a Google post, it can perform a benchmark test in under five minutes, a task that would take today\u8217\'20\'19s supercomputers around 10 septillion years to complete. The crypto community has mixed views about Willow and its potential to impact BTC and crypto. Some feel the technology could end encryption and crack Bitcoin. On the other hand, most of the community believes Willow has several shortcomings when tested with Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s security.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin advocate Ben Sigman pointed out that BTC uses two types of encryption: The Elliptic Curve Digital Signature Algorithm (ECDSA) and the SHA-256 secure hashtag algorithm. Sigman pointed out that both encryptions require millions of qubits to break through, meaning Willow, with 105 qubits, is far from cracking Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s encryption.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CQ: Can Google's Willow crack Bitcoin? Estimates indicate that compromising Bitcoin's encryption would necessitate a quantum computer with approximately 13 million qubits to achieve decryption within 24 hours. In contrast, Google's Willow chip, while a significant advancement, comprises 105 qubits. We have a ways to go... Nonetheless, this is a remarkable leap forward in quantum computing.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Others pointed out that crypto should be the least of worries if Willow or similarly capable chips can break encryption standards, stating,\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIf quantum computing breaks encryption, crypto would be the least of your worries. It will - expose government & military secrets - exploit banking systems - and turn private chats public, but Google's Willow is at 105 qubits. Breaking bitcoin needs 13 million qubits - still a long way.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Microsoft Shareholders Reject Bitcoin Reserve\par \par \uc2 Microsoft shareholders voted against a resolution to add {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/12/crypto-price-analysis-12-10-bitcoin-btc-ethereum-eth-solana-sol-dogecoin-doge-ripple-xrp-bittensor-tao-arbitrum-arb"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC)}}}\uc2  to the company\u8217\'20\'19s balance sheets. The resolution was proposed by The National Center for Public Policy Research (NCPPR), a think-tank based in Washington DC framing it as a corporate duty to provide value to shareholders through profit diversification. The NCPPR submitted a video outlining the proposal that played during the meeting. The video, peppered with charts and figures, discussed BTC\u8217\'20\'19s potential and the advantages of adding it to the company\u8217\'20\'19s balance sheets.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe institutional and corporate adoption of Bitcoin is becoming more commonplace. Microsoft\u8217\'20\'19s second-largest shareholder, BlackRock, offers its clients a Bitcoin ETF.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The proposal also discussed BTC\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 , stating it was more volatile than corporate bonds, and advised against holding too much of the asset. However, it advised against ignoring Bitcoin altogether.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAs the proposal itself notes, \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  is a factor to consider in evaluating cryptocurrency investments for corporate treasury applications that require stable and predictable investments to ensure liquidity and operational funding.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Trump To Make Bitcoin (BTC) A Central Focus\par \par \uc2 President-elect Donald Trump will make Bitcoin (BTC) a central focus of his administration as he aims to push its price to $150,000. According to sources from Trump\u8217\'20\'19s transition team, the president-elect views BTC as another stock market and anticipates a potential price surge to $150,000 early in his term. Trump\u8217\'20\'19s interest in BTC and crypto is part of a broader initiative to position the US as the global leader in crypto and other emerging technologies. David Sacks, a former PayPal executive, has been appointed as the White House AI and Crypto Czar and tasked with creating a clear regulatory framework for the industry.\par \par \uc2 The incoming administration hopes to promote regulations that provide clarity for crypto and crypto businesses while fostering innovation.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/BTC-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC)}}}\uc2  fell sharply at the beginning of the week as sellers drove the price to a low of $94,177. While it has recovered from this level, BTC is still struggling to get back above $98,000, a level where sellers are active. BTC and the crypto market hit a significant bump over the past few days. Prices crashed abruptly, shaving off billions in value, with the crypto market cap dropping over 8% in 24 hours. Despite dropping significantly on Monday, BTC made an impressive recovery and has weathered the storm well, but the same cannot be said about other altcoins like Ethereum (ETH) and Solana (SOL). The crash was due to high leverage, liquidity issues, and market weakness.\par \par \uc2 The market selloff began with aggressive selling on Coinbase as traders started offloading their assets an hour before the crash began. The selling pressure gradually pushed BTC into a liquidation cascade. Looking at the price chart, we can see BTC\u8217\'20\'19s momentum waning as it entered the current week. BTC rebounded from an intraday low of $93,665 on Tuesday, registering an increase of almost 3% on Wednesday and settling at $98,581. BTC experienced significant \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Thursday, creating history by moving past the $100,000 mark and setting a new all-time high of $103,900. However, buyers lost momentum after reaching this level, and BTC crashed to a low of $92,285, briefly dipping below the 20-day SMA. BTC recovered from this level to go above $95,000 and settle at $97,023, ultimately registering a decline of 1.51%.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/GlhpMlCT/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC recovered on Friday as it rose by almost 3%, reaching a high of $101,913 before settling at $99,695. Buyers maintained control on Saturday as BTC registered a marginal increase before climbing above $100,000 again on Sunday and settling at $101,043. Markets suffered a dramatic collapse on Monday, and BTC plummeted to an intraday low of $94,177 before settling at $97,434, ultimately registering a drop of almost 4%. Sellers retained control on Tuesday as BTC registered a marginal drop to settle at $96,914 after recovering from an intraday low of $94,307. The current session sees BTC up almost 1% as buyers look to reclaim $98,000 and push toward $100,000.\par \par \uc2 BTC is facing immediate resistance at $98,000. If buyers can go above this level, BTC will look to retest $100,000. On the other hand, a drop could drop BTC to $95,000.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/ETH-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum (ETH)}}}\uc2  is looking to recover after facing a substantial drop at the beginning of the current week as sellers attempted to drag it below $3,500. ETH was quite \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  last week as it rebounded from a low of $3,504, registering an increase of over 6% on Wednesday to go past $3,700 and settle at $3,844. Sellers attempted to drive ETH below $3,500 on Thursday as it fell to an intraday low of $3,644. However, buyers propped up the price from this level, and ETH ultimately settled at $3,787 after a decline of 1.48%. Despite considerable \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment and \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 , ETH recovered on Friday, registering an increase of almost 6% to go above $4,000 and settling at $4,003 after reaching an intraday high of $4,093.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/hJPM5iFc/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 With sellers active at this level, momentum waned over the weekend, as ETH registered a marginal drop on Saturday before rising by 0.19% on Sunday to reclaim $4,000 and settle at $4,007. With the markets suffering a sudden crash on Monday, ETH collapsed, falling to an intraday low of $3,504 and slipping below the 20-day SMA. However, it found support at this level and recovered to climb above the 20-day SMA and settle at $3,716, registering a drop of over 7%. Sellers retained control on Tuesday as they attempted to drive ETH below the 20-day SMA. As a result, the price fell to a low of $3,519 before settling at $3,630. The current session sees ETH up over 1% as buyers look to reclaim $3,700 and push towards $4,000. On the other hand, if sellers regain control and drive ETH below $3,500, it could fall as low as $3,200.\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) is attempting a recovery as it rebounds from its support levels and counter growing selling pressure. SOL is struggling to go above the 20-day SMA, which acted as a dynamic level of resistance and prevented a move past $240. After dropping to an intraday low of $219 on Monday, SOL made a strong recovery on Tuesday, rising almost 4% from a low of $215 to settle at $234. Sellers regained control on Wednesday, driving SOL down nearly 2% to $229. The price rebounded on Thursday despite facing significant \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 , registering an increase of 2.84% and settling at $236 after rising to an intraday high of $244 and dropping to an intraday low of $221.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/MtELurfD/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buyers retained control on Friday as SOL rose to an intraday high of $246. However, it could not stay at this level and dropped below $240 to settle at $237, registering only a marginal increase. The weekend was mixed for SOL as it registered a marginal rise on Saturday and a slight decrease on Sunday to end the weekend at $237. Selling pressure increased substantially on Monday as SOL dropped to an intraday low of $205 as sellers attempted to drive the price below $200. However, SOL made somewhat of a recovery and climbed above the 50-day SMA to settle at $216 after a drop of almost 9%. Selling pressure persisted on Tuesday as SOL fell to $213 after a fall of 1.47%. The current session sees SOL up nearly 3% as buyers look to reclaim $220 and begin a push towards the 20-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 Dogwifhat (WIF) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogwifhat (WIF) experienced a significant rally last week, surging past the resistance at $3.50 and briefly surpassing $4 before retreating. WIF recovered from an intraday low of $2.99 to register an increase of over 5% on Tuesday. However, it could not move above the 20-day SMA and fell back on Wednesday, dropping almost 3% and settling at $3.19. Sellers drove WIF to an intraday low of $3.04 on Thursday as selling pressure persisted. However, WIF recovered from this level to register an increase of almost 5% to go above the 20-day SMA and settle at $3.35. Buyers retained control on Friday as WIF rose by 4.07% and settled at $3.48, testing the resistance at $3.50.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/tQVkR2K4/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 WIF rallied impressively on Saturday as it surged past the resistance at $3.50 after an increase of over 11% and settled at $3.87. WIF attempted to go above $4 but lost momentum. As a result, it fell on Sunday, dropping 3.68% to $3.73. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment intensified significantly on Monday as WIF dropped over 18% to go below the 20-day SMA and settle at $3.05. Sellers retained control on Tuesday and drove WIF below $3 and the 50-day SMA to $2.84 after a drop of 6.69%. The current session sees WIF up by 2.35% as buyers look to reclaim $3 and push the price above the 50-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/ADA-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 )}}}\uc2  has been facing considerable selling pressure since last week as sentiment changed to \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  after it reached an intraday high of $1.32 last Tuesday. \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  declined marginally after reaching this level and continued to drop on Wednesday, dropping 0.50% after experiencing considerable \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Selling pressure and \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  registered an uptick on Thursday as \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  fell after reaching an intraday high of $1.24, eventually settling at $1.16 after a drop of 2.27%. \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  recovered on Friday, rising almost 6% and settling at $1.22 but fell back in the red over the weekend, dropping by 1.38% on Saturday and 1.40% on Sunday to settle at $1.19.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/UPjXs9hW/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment intensified substantially on Monday as markets witnessed a selloff. As a result, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  plummeted almost 16%, going below the 20-day SMA and falling to an intraday low of $0.91 before recovering to reclaim $1. Sellers made another attempt to drag \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  lower as it fell to a low of $0.91 on Tuesday. However, it recovered from this level to register an increase of 1.69% and settle at $1.02. The current session sees \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  marginally down as buyers and sellers struggle to establish control.\par \par \uc2 Aptos (APT) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Aptos (APT) started the previous week on a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  note, reaching a high of $14.75 on Tuesday. However, sentiment changed on Wednesday as selling pressure and \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  registered a considerable increase. As a result, APT fell almost 3% to $14.13. Selling pressure persisted on Thursday as sellers drove APT to a low of $13.08. However, it recovered from this level to settle at $13.62, ultimately registering a decline of 3.59%. Despite considerable selling pressure, APT registered a sharp increase on Friday, rising almost 8% and settling at $14.68 as buyers attempted to overwhelm the resistance at $14.50.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/HI5xAry7/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 APT surged to an intraday high of $15.37 on Saturday. However, buyers lost momentum after reaching this level, and the price fell to register a marginal decline and settle at $14.58. Selling pressure persisted as the price dropped marginally on Sunday, ending the weekend at $14.54. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment intensified considerably on Monday as APT plummeted almost 18% to slip below the 20-day SMA and the $13 support level to settle at $11.97, but not after hitting an intraday low of $10.49. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment persisted on Tuesday as APT briefly slipped below the 50-day SMA before recovering to settle at $11.64, ultimately registering a drop of 2.76%. The current session sees APT marginally up as buyers look to reclaim $12 and push toward the 20-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 Fantom (FTM) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Fantom (FTM) started the previous week on a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  note, surging almost 14% and settling at $1.24. Despite a strong start to the week, FTM fell back into the red on Tuesday after considerable \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 . FTM ultimately registered a marginal drop to remain at $1.24. Buyers attempted to go above the resistance at $1.30 on Wednesday as FTM reached an intraday high of $1.29. However, buyers lost momentum after reaching this level, and the price fell back, dropping 2.41% and settling at $1.21. Buying activity picked up on Thursday as FTM rose 8% to move above $1.30 and settled at $1.31. Sellers attempted to drag the price below $1.30 on Friday. However, buyers prevented a decline, and FTM registered only a marginal drop to remain above $1.30.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/6ZUPl1uE/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buyers regained control over the weekend as FTM registered a marginal increase on Saturday before rising by 1.12% on Sunday to settle at $1.33. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment registered a substantial jump on Monday as markets collapsed. As a result, FTM dropped almost 17%, falling to an intraday low of $1 before settling at $1.12. The price recovered on Tuesday despite considerable selling pressure and registered an increase of 3.19% to settle at $1.15. The current session sees FTM marginally up as buyers and sellers struggle to take control.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020241212ekcb0000p\par }\page {\par\fs20\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price\par \b \uc2 Why is Cardano price down today?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Nancy Lubale \par \uc2 843 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 December 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Cardano faces selling pressure, and a weakening market setup points to further downside.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvZTIzMDE1ZGQtODcyOC00YjI3LTgzYjctODgxYTY1YjUwMTlh.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Cardano price down today? }}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is showing weakness today, trading at $1.022, down 9% over the last 24 hours. An attempted fraud, reduced network user interaction and several onchain signals suggest that \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  could slip lower soon.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193b0cc-2967-7cf0-9c86-691dfdc04e48"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, SEC, Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Altcoin Watch }}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/ {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/tqwIrUI6/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price drops after Cardano Foundation\u8217\'20\'19s X account hack\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Investor sentiment\b0 \highlight\uc2  toward Cardano has turned negative for the first time in over a month amid rising concerns about its ability to sustain the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Against a background of this diminishing optimism, the Cardano Foundation\u8217\'20\'19s X account was hacked on Dec. 8.\par \par \uc2 The hacker promoted a fraudulent \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 -related token on {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-is-solana-and-how-does-it-work"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana }}}\uc2  and posted false claims about a Securities and Exchange Commission lawsuit against the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the company behind it that would result in \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  transactions stopping.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193b0cc-c4f0-7197-92eb-7f8f5762b1f4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, SEC, Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Altcoin Watch }}}\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/tempo_vote/status/1865979660821270668"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tempo }}}\par \par \uc2 Although the message looked convincing, the Cardano Foundation denied it immediately, deleted the posts and reassured the community that withdrawals for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  would continue as normal.\par \par \uc2 Despite the swift move by the Cardano Foundation to abate the hacker\u8217\'20\'19s plans to defraud its followers, the incident had a direct impact on \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s market sentiment, as per data from Santiment.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193b0ce-17be-724a-9638-34dc05d9784e"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, SEC, Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Altcoin Watch }}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano Weighted Sentiment. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://app.santiment.net/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Santiment }}}\par \par \uc2 This also affected user interaction with the network, as evidenced by a sharp decline in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/explained/what-is-total-value-locked-tvl-in-crypto-and-why-does-it-matter"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 total value locked }}}\uc2  (TVL) on Cardano since the hacker\u8217\'20\'19s posts appeared on X, as per data from DefiLlama.\par \par \uc2 The chart below shows that Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s TVL has fallen by over 21% from an all-time high of $708.92 million on Dec. 3 to approximately $508 million at the time of publication.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193b0ce-efbe-71bf-8529-159e7eab0ab5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, SEC, Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Altcoin Watch }}}\par \par \uc2 TVL on Cardano. Source: DefiLlama\par \par \uc2 The social sentiment and reduced TVL on Cardano indicate diminished user interaction, decreasing demand for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  tokens and negatively impacting its price.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price meets strong resistance\par \par \uc2 With \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price trading at $1.0, bears appear to have established a strong supply zone around the $1.05 price range.\par \par \uc2 Data from IntoTheBlock {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.intotheblock.com/market-intelligence"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 shows }}}\uc2  that over 928,460 \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  addresses had moved roughly 102,150 \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  tokens for an average price of $1.05 between $1.03 and $1.06.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193b0cf-8c7d-7292-8918-ffda40428447"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, SEC, Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Altcoin Watch }}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano IOMAP chart. Source: IntoTheBlock\par \par \uc2 The same IOMAP chart above shows that \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  faces relatively strong resistance in its recovery path compared to the support it enjoys on the downside. This suggests that the path with the least resistance for the token is downward.\par \par \uc2 This view is shared by pseudonymous technical analyst Sssebi who {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/Av_Sebastian/status/1863872802752708678"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 says }}}\uc2  that there is not much support for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  if it breaks below a key level at $1.05.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIf this trendline doesn\u8217\'20\'19t hold we could see $\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  go to $1 or even $0.91.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Sssebi was referring to the lower trendline of a bull flag in the four-hour timeframe, which was breached during the early Asian trading hours on Dec. 10.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193b0d0-048e-79dc-ae77-e1cf1bb24cfe"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, SEC, Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Altcoin Watch }}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD four-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/Av_Sebastian/status/1866215693378863202"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Sssebi }}}\par \par \uc2 In another post, Sssebi {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/Av_Sebastian/status/1866413295751594184"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said }}}\uc2  that the \u8220\'20\'1Cbottom could be in for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,\u8221\'20\'1D as evidenced by the large volume candle on the daily chart.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CUsually, a huge volume candle in a certain direction signals that the move is pretty much over. If we corroborate that with the fact that it went into oversold and reset the RSI + bounce from key support, it might mean that the dip is over.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/5-reasons-crypto-dino-coins-xrp-tron-ada-going-parabolic"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 5 reasons crypto dino coins like XRP, Tron and \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22  are going parabolic }}}\par \par \uc2 A close look at the technical setup reveals that \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  is still trading above a multi-year downtrend line, broken five weeks ago. The weekly chart below shows that $0.80 is an area of strong support for the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price.\par \par \uc2 The moving average convergence divergence (MACD) indicator continues its upward trajectory in the positive region, suggesting that the market conditions still favor the upside.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193b0d0-c912-7f76-8e2c-d60363fc37bf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, SEC, Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Altcoin Watch }}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD weekly chart. Source: Cointelegraph/ {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/VlTxYGPw/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls are able to sustain the uptrend, they are likely to push \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  higher, with the $2.40 level representing the upside target for the buyers.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, failure to hold above $0.80 would signal the inability of the buyers to stop the sell-off, with the next logical move being the $0.60 to $0.49 demand zone, where all the major simple moving averages sit.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvZTIzMDE1ZGQtODcyOC00YjI3LTgzYjctODgxYTY1YjUwMTlh.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241210ekca0008l\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
