\par\par \b \uc2 Crypto Price Analysis 12-10 BITCOIN: BTC, ETHEREUM: ETH, SOLANA: SOL, DOGECOIN: DOGE, RIPPLE: XRP, BITTENSOR: TAO, ARBITRUM: ARB\b0\par\par\uc2 Amara Khatri \par \uc2 2,946 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 December 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Crypto Market Sees Bloodbath}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 El Salvador Scales Back Bitcoin (BTC) Ambitions}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 US Can Become Crypto Superpower}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-7"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple (XRP) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bittensor (TAO) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-10"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Arbitrum (ARB) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 The crypto markets endured a difficult start to the week as Bitcoin (BTC) briefly retreated to $94,000. The markets witnessed an absolute bloodbath, with $1.5 billion in crypto derivatives positions liquidated thanks to BTC\u8217\'20\'19s drop. The price eventually recovered to briefly climb above $98,000 before registering a marginal drop to slip below $97,000 to its current level of $96,878. BTC\u8217\'20\'19s sudden crash left the crypto market reeling, with other altcoins registering even more substantial declines.\par \par \uc2 While BTC is down almost 3% over the past 24 hours, Ethereum (ETH) plummeted over 6% after failing to get past $4,000 and is currently trading just below $3,700. Ripple (XRP) registered a staggering drop of over 13% and dropped to its current level of $2.14. Meanwhile, Solana (SOL) is down over 7% as \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment persists, with the price down to $215. Significant losses were also recorded by Dogecoin (DOGE), {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/ADA-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 )}}}\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/TRX-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tron (TRX)}}}\uc2 , Avalanche (AVAX), Toncoin (TON), {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/LINK-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Chainlink (LINK)}}}\uc2 , Polkadot (DOT), {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/XLM-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Stellar (XLM)}}}\uc2 , Uniswap (UNI), and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/LTC-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Litecoin (LTC)}}}\uc2 , all of which registered double-digit losses. The crypto market cap declined substantially, almost 6% to $3.44 trillion.\par \par \uc2 Crypto Market Sees Bloodbath\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/12/crypto-price-analysis-12-9-bitcoin-btc-ethereum-eth-solana-sol-litecoin-ltc-chainlink-link-uniswap-uni-celestia-tia"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC)}}}\uc2  faced a sudden price crash as the price fell to $94,000. While the price made somewhat of a recovery, it is struggling to regain its footing above $97,000 and is currently trading around $96,700. BTC\u8217\'20\'19s drop had a ripple effect on the market, with prominent altcoins registering even bigger drops. Ethereum (ETH) is down over 6%, while Ripple (XRP) is down a staggering 13%, with sellers still in control. Dogecoin (DOGE), Polkadot (DOT), and other altcoins also plummeted as the crypto market saw drops across the board.\par \par \uc2 The crypto derivatives market also took a substantial hit, which left it reeling. Data from Coinglass showed over $1.5 billion in long and short positions were wiped out. Out of this, $1.38 billion were long positions, with the bloodbath impacting 514,384 traders, as major altcoins bore the brunt of the losses. The slump is a stark reminder of the inherent \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  of the crypto ecosystem, where rapid price swings can wipe out gains in minutes and significantly amplify losses.\par \par \uc2 El Salvador Scales Back Bitcoin (BTC) Ambitions\par \par \uc2 El Salvador is close to an agreement with the IMF for a $1.3 billion loan. However, it must change its use of BTC as legal tender and reduce the government deficit in return. A team from the IMF is already in Sal Salvador to finalize the agreement with Nayib Bukele\u8217\'20\'19s government. The deal will unlock $1 billion from the World Bank and $1 billion from the Inter-American Development Bank.\par \par \uc2 The loan would see El Salvador return to the international financial fold after years of isolation following its adoption of BTC as legal tender. The IMF had vehemently opposed the move, citing risks to financial stability and integrity, and urged Bukele\u8217\'20\'19s government to stop accepting crypto as legal tender. Under the terms of the agreement with the IMF, El Salvador would make it voluntary for businesses to accept BTC as payment. It would also commit to reducing its budget deficit by three percentage points of GDP through spending cuts and tax increases. It would also have to pass an anti-corruption law and increase reserves from $11 billion to $15 billion.\par \par \uc2 US Can Become Crypto Superpower\par \par \uc2 Eric Trump, the executive vice president of the Trump Organization, believes a sensible set of regulatory guidelines can make the US a cryptocurrency superpower. He added he was a big fan of crypto, and his father fully intends to make America the crypto capital of the world when he returns to the White House. Eric Trump\u8217\'20\'19s comments come after BTC crossed the $100,000 mark, which market watchers hailed as a landmark moment for crypto.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe modern banking system is antiquated. It's just a matter of time before crypto not only catches up but really leaps ahead. And so, we\u8217\'20\'19re incredibly excited on a lot of fronts. I think America will be the crypto capital of the world. I fully support it, my father fully supports it, and our family is fully embracing it. We believe in DeFi, and we believe that's the way of the future. America better lead the way, otherwise, we are going to leave a lot behind.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 President-elect Donald Trump recently nominated Paul Atkins as the United States Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC)Chair. Atkins is known for his crypto-friendly views and will replace Gary Gensler. Eric was also asked if his father was planning regulatory or deregulatory measures in the crypto space and what such policies could look like in practice,\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt looks like it\u8217\'20\'19s transparent. That\u8217\'20\'19s what it is. The people in the crypto industry are frustrated that no one\u8217\'20\'19s ever put together a sensible plan as to how to regulate an industry. They\u8217\'20\'19re fine with \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but they just want guidelines, and they\u8217\'20\'19ve said that. We will have a clear road map, and hopefully, the rest of the world will follow that. Hopefully, we can lead by example because that\u8217\'20\'19s what we should do as Americans. And hopefully, we truly are the crypto superpower of the world.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/BTC-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC)}}}\uc2  registered a dramatic fall amid a broader crypto market rout that significantly amplified losses for crypto traders. The drop can be attributed to risk sentiment souring amid growing geopolitical tensions and uncertainty over US interest rates. Additionally, BTC was subject to significant profit-taking after it crossed the coveted $100,000 mark. Traders also locked in their gains in other major altcoins. The crypto market has taken positive cues from several developments, such as nominating crypto-friendly candidates for key cabinet and regulatory positions. However, doubts have emerged about how much regulatory support Trump could provide, with analysts dismissing the idea of a strategic reserve under Trump.\par \par \uc2 BTC\u8217\'20\'19s price chart shows the asset registering a substantial drop over the last few sessions as it slipped below key support levels. The asset\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment had waned in recent sessions, especially after it set a new all-time high last week as traders locked in their profits and geopolitical developments impacted market sentiment. BTC began the previous week in the red, dropping 1.25% on Monday and registering a marginal decline on Tuesday to settle at $95,751 after briefly dipping below the 20-day SMA. However, it made a strong recovery on Wednesday, registering an increase of almost 3% and settling at $98,851. BTC faced unprecedented \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Thursday as it surged past the pivotal $100,000 mark to set a new all-time high of $103,900. However, buyers quickly lost momentum after reaching this level, and the price fell back, dropping below the 20-day SMA to a low of $92,285 before recovering and settling at $97,093.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/lEjbZh3y/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Despite facing considerable \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Thursday, BTC recovered on Friday, rising almost 3% and settling at $99,695. With sellers active at $100,000, BTC could only register a marginal increase on Saturday and move to $99,728. BTC crossed the $100,000 mark again on Sunday after a 1.32% increase to $101,043. However, BTC and the crypto market experienced a substantial decline on Monday. BTC plummeted below the 20-day SMA to an intraday low of $94,177. However, it recovered from this level to climb above the 20-day SMA and settle at $97,267, a decline of almost 4%. BTC has remained \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  during the current session, with the price marginally down after recovering from an intraday low of $95,687.\par \par \uc2 BTC faces resistance at $98,000. If buyers can regain control, BTC could reclaim $100,000 and push toward its all-time high. On the other hand, if sellers retain control, BTC could drop to $95,000 once again.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/ETH-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum (ETH)}}}\uc2  also substantially declined this week as the crypto markets crashed. ETH was quite \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  last week despite starting it on a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  note, registering a drop of almost 2% and settling at $3,645. Sellers retained control on Tuesday as ETH fell by 0.76% and settled at $3,617. Despite considerable selling pressure, ETH recovered on Wednesday, rising over 6% to move above $3,700 and settling at $3,844. ETH faced significant \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Thursday as buyers and sellers struggled to establish control. As a result, ETH fell to an intraday low of $3,644 and rose to an intraday high of $3,957 before settling at $3,787 after registering a decline of 1.48%.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/pRguz6qZ/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price recovered on Friday as it surged past $4,000 and reached an intraday high of $4,093. However, buyers lost momentum after reaching this level, and ETH eventually settled at $4,003 after an increase of almost 6%. With sellers active at this level, ETH registered a marginal decline on Saturday to slip below $4,000 and settle at $3,999. Sellers attempted to lower the price on Sunday as ETH fell to a low of $3,924. However, it recovered from this level to register a marginal increase and settle at $4,007. ETH started the current week facing significant selling pressure as markets collapsed. As a result, ETH fell to an intraday low of $3,504 as selling pressure increased substantially. However, buyers propped up the price from this level, and ETH ultimately settled at $3,716, registering a decline of over 7%. The current session sees ETH marginally up as buyers and sellers look to establish control.\par \par \uc2 If buyers retain control, ETH could move above the $3,800 mark and push towards $4,000. On the other hand, if sellers regain control, ETH could drop to $3,600 or $3,500.\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) is attempting a recovery during the current session as buyers look to keep it above the crucial $200 level. SOL has experienced significant \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  since last week as it struggled to move above the 20-day SMA. SOL slipped below the 20-day SMA last Monday after a drop of almost 5% dragged the price to $225. Sellers attempted to lower the price on Tuesday as it fell to an intraday low of $215. However, it recovered from this level to register an increase of almost 4% and settled at $234. Buyers attempted a move past the 20-day SMA on Wednesday but were unsuccessful as sellers drove the price down by 1.98% to $229. \b \highlight22\uc2 Volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  increased substantially on Thursday as buyers and sellers attempted to take control. Buyers ultimately gained the upper hand as SOL registered an increase of almost 3% and settled at $236.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/zIP7oKqR/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buyers attempted a move past the 20-day SMA on Friday as SOL reached an intraday high of $246. However, they lost momentum after reaching this level and fell back, with SOL registering only a marginal increase and moving to $238. With SOL close to the resistance level, it could only register a marginal rise on Saturday and move to $238. Sunday saw SOL slip into the red as it registered a marginal decline. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment intensified substantially on Monday as SOL slipped to an intraday low of $203 before settling at $217 after registering a drop of almost 9%. The drop also saw SOL slip below a key support level of $220. The current session sees SOL marginally down as buyers and sellers struggle to establish control. Sellers will look to drive the price toward $200, while buyers will attempt to reclaim $220.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/DOGE-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE)}}}\uc2  experienced significant \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  at the beginning of the previous week as it fell to an intraday low of $0.40 and rose to an intraday high of $0.463 before settling at $0.424 after a decline of almost 4%. Sellers retained control on Tuesday as DOGE fell over 4% and settled at $0.406. The price recovered on Wednesday thanks to the 20-day SMA acting as a dynamic level of support, rising almost 7% and settling at $0.433. \b \highlight22\uc2 Volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  returned on Thursday as DOGE rose to an intraday high of $0.466 before dropping to an intraday low of $0.40. However, despite the selling pressure, sellers could not push DOGE below the 20-day SMA, with the price ultimately settling at $0.426.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/zb0Pqvqb/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Despite facing significant selling pressure on Thursday, DOGE recovered on Friday, rising just over 2% and settling at $0.435. DOGE remained \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  over the weekend, registering an increase of 4.18% on Saturday and almost 3% on Sunday to settle at $0.466. However, buyers retreated as markets collapsed on Monday. As a result, DOGE dropped over 11%, falling to an intraday low of $0.381 before recovering to reclaim $0.40 and settle at $0.414. The current session sees DOGE remain in the red, with the price down just over 1% and trading at $0.408, with sellers looking to drive the price below $0.40.\par \par \uc2 Ripple (XRP) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/XRP-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple (XRP)}}}\uc2  registered a substantial increase at the beginning of the previous week. However, momentum waned after it reached $2.87 on Monday, as selling pressure increased significantly. As a result, the price fell on Tuesday, dropping almost 8% to hit a low of $2.27 before settling at $2.51. Sellers retained control on Wednesday as XRP fell below the $2.50 support level to $2.36. Buyers attempted a recovery on Thursday as XRP rose to an intraday high of $2.49. However, buyers lost momentum after reaching this level, allowing sellers to take over. As a result, XRP fell almost 5% to $2.24.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/FVZEvAmm/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Despite the prevailing \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment, XRP recovered on Friday, rising over 8% and settling at $2.42. XRP reclaimed the $2.50 level on Saturday after registering an increase of 7.55% and settling at $2.61. However, it fell back in the red on Sunday, registering a marginal decline and settling at $2.60. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment increased substantially on Monday as XRP plummeted almost 15% to $2.21 thanks to a broader market crash. The current session sees XRP marginally up, recovering from an intraday low of $2.04. Sellers will look to regain control and drive XRP below $2. Should it slip below this level, we can expect a drop to $1.50.\par \par \uc2 Bittensor (TAO) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Bittensor (TAO) has faced unprecedented \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  since last week thanks to repeated rejections above $700. TAO fell to an intraday low of $566 on Monday as sellers drove the price down almost 5%. Despite considerable selling pressure, TAO recovered on Tuesday, registering an increase of 2.51% and settling at $621. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment persisted on Wednesday as TAO surged to an intraday high of $726. However, it could not stay at this level and fell to settle at $656, registering an increase of almost 6%. TAO faced considerable \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Thursday as it surged to an intraday high of $725 and fell to an intraday low of $626 before settling at $679.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/FMdCdKNl/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 TAO breached $700 on Friday, reaching an intraday high of $748 before settling at $705. However, it declined on Saturday to slip below $700 and settle at $699. Sellers attempted to drag TAO lower on Sunday but were unsuccessful as buyers pushed the price up by 2.03% to $713. TAO plummeted on Monday, falling to an intraday low of $504. However, buyers propped up the price and it ultimately settled at $600, registering a drop of almost 16%. The current session sees TAO down nearly 2% and trading at $588 after dropping to an intraday low of $551.\par \par \uc2 Arbitrum (ARB) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Arbitrum (ARB)\u8217\'20\'19s recent rally halted abruptly as buyers lost momentum around the $1.20 mark. ARB was quite \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  last week, rising almost 6% on Monday to go above $1 and settle at $1.02. \b \highlight22\uc2 Volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  increased on Tuesday as sellers attempted to drag ARB below $1. As a result, the price fell to an intraday low of $0.96 before recovering to register an increase of almost 2% and settle at $1.04. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment intensified on Wednesday as ARB rallied nearly 9% to go above $1.10 and settle at $1.13. However, with sellers active around $1.15, ARB fell back on Thursday, dropping just over 3% to $1.10.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/ebMqUCRK/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment returned on Friday as ARB surged past the resistance at $1.15 and reached an intraday high of $1.24 before settling at $1.17. Sentiment changed over the weekend as ARB fell by 0.89% on Saturday and 0.46% on Sunday to settle at $1.15. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment increased dramatically on Monday as ARB slipped below $1, dropping to an intraday low of $0.84 before settling at $0.96. The current session sees ARB up by almost 2% as buyers look to reclaim $1.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020241211ekca00016\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Radiant Capital\par \b \uc2 Here\u8217\'20\'19s what happened in crypto today\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Cointelegraph \par \uc2 905 \uc2 words\par \uc2 9 December 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Need to know what happened in crypto today? Here is the latest news on daily trends and events impacting Bitcoin price, blockchain, DeFi, NFTs, Web3 and crypto \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvNzhkNzg3NjEtM2JkMi00NTY5LTk2YTctNjJhOTdmMGExYjBh.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Here\u8217\'20\'19s what happened in crypto today }}}\par \par \uc2 Today in crypto, \uc2 Ripple\uc2  CEO \uc2 Brad Garlinghouse\uc2  criticized 60 Minutes for omitting crucial information about his company\u8217\'20\'19s lawsuit with the SEC, El Salvador reportedly expects to reach an agreement with the \uc2 International Monetary Fund\uc2  (\uc2 IMF\uc2 ) on a $1.3 billion loan deal in return for changes in its Bitcoin Law, and Radiant Capital said a North Korean-aligned attacker was behind the $50 million October hack on its platform.\par \par \uc2 Brad Garlinghouse\uc2  criticizes 60 Minutes\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ripple-brad-garlinghouse-60-minutes-xrp-security"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple Labs CEO Brad Garlinghouse }}}\uc2  has criticized a recent 60 Minutes segment for failing to include critical information about his company\u8217\'20\'19s lawsuit with the \uc2 US Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  (SEC).\par \par \uc2 The 60 Minutes segment with journalist Margaret Brennan and Garlinghouse covered \uc2 Ripple\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s role in funding the Fairshare political action committee ahead of the US presidential election. The report included Garlinghouse\u8217\'20\'19s commentary on the SEC lawsuit.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193ad3c-a943-7072-b25c-b545592407a4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 IMF, North Korea, Cybersecurity, Cardano, Hacks, El Salvador, Nayib Bukele, Policy }}}\par \par \uc2 Garlinghouse appears on 60 Minutes on Dec. 8. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_2VC2dE45UU"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 YouTube }}}\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CTheir allegation was that \uc2 Ripple\uc2  and our sales of XRP represented the sale of an unregistered security,\u8221\'20\'1D Garlinghouse said of the SEC in the 60 Minutes segment, which aired on Dec. 8.\par \par \uc2 However, Garlinghouse was shocked to learn that the segment didn\u8217\'20\'19t clarify that the lawsuit {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ripple-wins-case-against-sec-as-judge-rules-xrp-is-not-a-security"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 deemed XRP not to be a security }}}\uc2  in certain cases.\par \par \uc2 The SEC sued \uc2 Ripple\uc2  in December 2020. In August, a judge ordered the company {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-ripple-labs-liable-civil-penalty"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 to pay $125 million }}}\uc2  as part of a civil penalty, one month after it was determined that XRP sales on exchanges did not violate securities laws.\par \par \uc2 El Salvador plans Bitcoin policy changes to secure $1.3 billion \uc2 IMF\uc2  loan \u8212\'20\'14 FT\par \par \uc2 El Salvador, the first country in the world to accept Bitcoin as legal tender, is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/el-salvador-1-3-billion-loan-imf-bitcoin-policy-change"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reportedly scaling back its BTC ambitions }}}\uc2  under pressure from the \uc2 IMF\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 El Salvador expects to reach an agreement with the \uc2 IMF\uc2  on a $1.3 billion loan deal in return for changes to its Bitcoin Law, the \uc2 Financial Times{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://ctmain.slack.com/archives/C051Z8HCML2/p1733746621229469?thread_ts=1733746569.357809&cid=C051Z8HCML2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported }}}\uc2  on Dec. 9, citing people familiar with the matter.\par \par \uc2 If confirmed, the deal would obligate the government of El Salvador to drop a legal requirement for businesses to accept Bitcoin ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC }}}\uc2  ) as payment, making it a voluntary payment method.\par \par \uc2 Expected to be finalized in the next two or three weeks, the deal is also expected to unlock another $1 billion of lending from the \uc2 World Bank\uc2  and $1 billion from the \uc2 Inter-American Development Bank\uc2  over the next few years.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 IMF\uc2  has long been opposed to El Salvador\u8217\'20\'19s adoption of Bitcoin, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/imf-issues-veiled-warning-against-el-salvador-s-bitcoin-law"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 repeatedly warning the government }}}\uc2  and Salvadoran President \uc2 Nayib Bukele\uc2  of the financial stability risks behind the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/september-7-is-bitcoin-day-in-el-salvador-as-btc-becomes-legal-tender"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 decision to adopt Bitcoin as legal tender }}}\uc2  in September 2021.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 IMF\uc2  and the Salvadoran government have been {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/imf-pressures-el-salvador-overhaul-bitcoin-regulations"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 discussing the $1.3 billion loan }}}\uc2  and possible changes to El Salvador\u8217\'20\'19s Bitcoin Law since at least October.\par \par \uc2 Radiant says North Korean posed as ex-contractor in $50 million hack\par \par \uc2 Radiant Capital said on Dec. 6 that the $50 million hack on its platform in October {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/radiant-capital-north-korean-impersonated-ex-contractor-50-million-hack"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 was carried out by a North Korea-aligned hacker }}}\uc2  posing as an ex-contractor who sent malware via Telegram.\par \par \uc2 The platform said a Radiant developer received a Telegram message with a zip file from a \u8220\'20\'1Ctrusted former contractor\u8221\'20\'1D in September, which investigating cybersecurity firm \uc2 Mandiant\uc2  said was \u8220\'20\'1Cattributable to a Democratic People\u8217\'20\'19s Republic of Korea (DPRK)-nexus threat actor.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis ZIP file, when shared for feedback among other developers, ultimately delivered malware that facilitated the subsequent intrusion,\u8221\'20\'1D Radiant added.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193a922-1e19-7e08-80de-0f55888b8061"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SEC, United States, Cybersecurity, Cardano, Hacks, El Salvador, Nayib Bukele, Policy }}}\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/RDNTCapital/status/1865201964625035526"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Radiant Capital }}}\par \par \uc2 It believes the actor responsible is known as \u8220\'20\'1CUNC4736,\u8221\'20\'1D also known as \u8220\'20\'1CCitrine Sleet\u8221\'20\'1D \u8212\'20\'14 believed to be aligned with North Korea\u8217\'20\'19s main intelligence agency, the Reconnaissance General Bureau (RGB), and speculated to be a sub-cluster of the hacking collective the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/people/top-people-in-crypto-and-blockchain-2023/lazarus-group/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Lazarus Group }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Radiant was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/radiant-capital-pauses-contracts-exploit-fears"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 forced to halt its lending markets }}}\uc2  on Oct. 16 after an attacker gained control of several signers\u8217\'20\'19 private keys and smart contracts. North Korean hacking groups have long targeted crypto platforms and have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/north-korean-hackers-stolen-crypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 stolen $3 billion }}}\uc2  in crypto between 2017 and 2023.\par \par \uc2 Cardano Foundation X account hacked\par \par \uc2 The Cardano Foundation\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-foundation-x-account-hacked-scam-links-posted-removed"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 X account was hacked }}}\uc2  on Dec. 8 by a threat actor who posted malicious links on the Foundation\u8217\'20\'19s social media page.\par \par \uc2 Initially, the hacker created a post advertising a fraudulent token called \u8220\'20\'1CADAsol,\u8221\'20\'1D which managed to rack up approximately $500,000 in trading volume before collapsing.\par \par \uc2 Following the promotion of the fake token, the hacker created a second fraudulent post claiming that the Cardano Foundation would drop support for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) due to scrutiny from the \uc2 United States Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  (SEC).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193a7c1-9753-7778-9fcf-c76766840056"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SEC, United States, Cybersecurity, Cardano, Hacks, El Salvador, Nayib Bukele, Policy }}}\par \par \uc2 One of the fraudulent posts from the Cardano Foundation\u8217\'20\'19s compromised X account. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.me/investigations/189"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ZackXBT }}}\par \par \uc2 Both posts have since been deleted, and the Cardano Foundation is working on regaining control of the social media account.\par \par \uc2 However, users are encouraged to stay clear of the account and not to interact with any links from the Cardano Foundation X page until the issue is fully resolved.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvNzhkNzg3NjEtM2JkMi00NTY5LTk2YTctNjJhOTdmMGExYjBh.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241209ekc9000dz\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 12/9: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, XRP, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , BNB, DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,816 \uc2 words\par \uc2 9 December 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin could enter another corrective phase, where the price plunges to $90,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTIvMDE5M2FjNjItYmI2MC03YmVmLThiYzktMzE0ZjE0MTZkNGY0.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 12/9: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, XRP, SOL, BNB, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX }}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC }}}\uc2  ) has pulled back near $98,000, indicating that the bears continue to fiercely defend the $100,000 level. CryptoQuant contributor Maartuun said in a post on X that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-potential-top-large-monthly-sales-long-term-holders"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long-term holders offloaded 827,783 Bitcoin }}}\uc2  since Nov. 8. He also highlighted several other signals in the thread, which suggest that Bitcoin may be close to a top.\par \par \uc2 However, there is no stopping \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2 , one of the largest corporate holders of Bitcoin, which continues to build its stockpile. The firm said it bought 21,550 Bitcoin between Dec. 2\u8211\'20\'138 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/microstrategy-purchases-21500-bitcoin-at-peak-prices"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 at an average price of $98,783 }}}\uc2 . \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2  co-founder and former CEO \uc2 Michael Saylor\uc2  told Yahoo Finance that he would be \u8220\'20\'1Cbuying the top forever.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193ac59-c327-7ea7-ae2a-043fe3c8c593"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Yahoo, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500 }}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360 }}}\par \par \uc2 It is not only \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2  that has been buying Bitcoin. \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  report shows that cryptocurrency investment products set a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-etp-record-3-85-billion-inflows-bitcoin-100k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 new record of $3.85 billion in inflows }}}\uc2  during the Dec. 2\u8211\'20\'13 Dec. 6 trading week.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s stalled rally attract buyers to altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index (SPX) has formed a rising wedge pattern, which is usually considered a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193ac5e-5df8-7ab9-95f9-f555f6753aa8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Yahoo, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500 }}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, if buyers drive the price above the resistance line of the wedge, it will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup. The failure of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pattern is a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sign. That could propel the index to 6,221 and, after that, to 6,500.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down from the current level, it will signal that the bears are selling near the resistance line. The index may drop to the 20-day exponential moving average (5,996) and then to the support line. A break and close below the support line will tilt the advantage in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 US dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The US dollar Index (DXY) is witnessing a tough battle between the bulls and the bears near the 20-day EMA (105.96).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193ac5e-fcef-711e-9f33-d199d35cf527"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Yahoo, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500 }}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price plummets below 105.42, the index may fall to the 50-day simple moving average (104.69). The bulls will try to defend the 50-day SMA because a break and close below it will bring the large 101 to 108 range into play.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to assert their supremacy, they will have to push the price above 106.73. If they do that, the index could retest the overhead resistance at 108. The bulls may find it challenging to overcome the barrier at 108, but if they can pull it off, the rally could reach 114.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s repeated failure to maintain above the psychologically critical level of $100,000 may result in a pullback to the 20-day EMA ($95,673).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193ac5f-97a0-7125-9953-48d05d89469e"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Yahoo, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500 }}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 A strong rebound off the 20-day EMA will suggest that the bulls remain in command and every minor dip is being purchased. That will increase the possibility of a retest of the all-time high at $104,088. A break and close above $104,088 could start the next leg of the uptrend to $113,331 and later to $125,000.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price continues lower and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bulls are booking profits. The BTC/USDT pair may drop to $90,000 and eventually to the 50-day SMA ($84,719).\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH }}}\uc2  ) turned down from $4,094 on Dec. 6, indicating that the bears are fiercely defending the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193ac60-31e7-7e9b-92f3-12e946a95276"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Yahoo, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500 }}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 Sellers will try to pull the price to the 20-day EMA ($3,633), which is a crucial near-term support to watch out for. If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA with force, it will signal a positive sentiment. That will improve the prospects of a break above $4,094. If that happens, the ETH/USDT pair may rally to $4,500.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the upmove, they will have to tug the price below the 20-day EMA. That may tempt short-term buyers to book profits, resulting in a fall to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP\u8217\'20\'19s ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP }}}\uc2  ) bounce fizzled out at $2.64 on Dec. 8, indicating that the bears are selling on relief rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193ac60-ccdb-7298-a61e-8c49f1ba8261"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Yahoo, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500 }}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to strengthen their position by pulling the price to the 20-day EMA ($1.99). If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA with strength, the bulls may again attempt to push the XRP/USDT pair toward $2.91.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, a break and close below the 20-day EMA will signal that the bulls are rushing to the exit. That suggests the pair may have topped out in the near term. The pair could descend to $1.90 and later to $1.68.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL }}}\uc2  ) turned down from the overhead resistance of $248 and dipped below the 20-day EMA ($232).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193ac61-59f8-7076-875c-665ce547d2f6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Yahoo, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500 }}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattening 20-day EMA and the relative strength index (RSI) near the midpoint suggest a possible range formation in the near term. The \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could drop to $210, where buyers are expected to step in. If the price rebounds off $210, the pair may rise to $248 and remain between these two levels for some time.\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to propel the price above the $248 to $264 resistance zone to seize control. On the downside, a break and close below $210 could suggest that the bears are back in the game.\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are finding it difficult to sustain BNB ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB }}}\uc2  ) above the crucial level of $722, indicating selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193ac61-eaf3-71dc-ac8e-11c517063480"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Yahoo, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500 }}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price maintains below $722, the BNB/USDT pair could decline to the 20-day EMA ($685). Buyers are expected to defend this level with all their might because a break below it could weaken the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum. The pair may descend to the 50-day SMA ($629).\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns up from the current level or the 20-day EMA, it will signal demand at lower levels. The bulls will then again attempt to thrust the price above $794. If this level is taken out, the pair may skyrocket to $861.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/xrp-price-to-5-3-charts-rally-isnt-over"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP price to $5 next? 3 charts suggest that the historic rally isn\u8217\'20\'19t over }}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to push Dogecoin ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE }}}\uc2  ) above $0.48 on Dec. 8, but the bears held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193ac62-8b08-72ed-a3bc-e48bb4a915fc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Yahoo, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500 }}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA ($0.41) and the RSI in the positive zone indicate that the path of least resistance is to the upside. If buyers propel the price above $0.48, the likelihood of a rally above the channel\u8217\'20\'19s resistance line increases. The DOGE/USDT pair could jump to $0.60.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns down and breaks below the channel. That could accelerate selling and pull the price to $0.33.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 The long tail on Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) Dec. 9 candlestick shows that the bulls are trying to defend the 50% Fibonacci retracement level of $1.10.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193ac63-12b7-78da-a2cb-c74dc0073c93"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Yahoo, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500 }}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to drive the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair above the $1.25 to $1.33 resistance zone to signal the resumption of the uptrend. The pair could surge to $1.64, which is expected to act as a stiff resistance.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, sellers will have to sink the price below the 20-day EMA ($1.05) to gain the upper hand. The pair could then plunge to $0.87. Such a deep fall could delay the start of the next leg of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX }}}\uc2  ) tried to resume the up move on Dec. 8, but the bears pulled the price back below the breakout level of $51 on Dec. 9.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193ac63-9821-752f-8832-fd667b0e9ec0"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Yahoo, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500 }}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 If sellers sustain the price below $51, the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair could drop to the 20-day EMA ($46.18). A strong bounce off the 20-day EMA will signal buying on dips. The bulls will then make one more attempt to push the pair above $56. If they do that, the pair may climb to $60 and subsequently to $65.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, a break and close below the 20-day EMA will suggest that the bulls are losing their grip. The pair may then slump to $38.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTIvMDE5M2FjNjItYmI2MC03YmVmLThiYzktMzE0ZjE0MTZkNGY0.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241209ekc9000b9\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 XRP\par \b \uc2 5 reasons crypto dino coins like XRP, \uc2 Tron\uc2  and  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2  are going parabolic\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Tom Mitchelhill \par \uc2 1,254 \uc2 words\par \uc2 9 December 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 A roster of so-called \u8220\'20\'1Cdino coins\u8221\'20\'1D including \uc2 Ripple\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s XRP, Cardano, Tron, and Hedera have rallied hard in the last few weeks. Crypto analysts shared five main reasons why these coins are performing so well.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTIvMDE5M2E4YzYtZWQwYS03ZmRmLTg0OTEtYzhlMjY3YWEyNjNl.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 5 reasons crypto dino coins like XRP, Tron and \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22  are going parabolic }}}\par \par \uc2 The blistering rallies staged by a swathe of \u8220\'20\'1Cdino coins,\u8221\'20\'1D including \uc2 Ripple\uc2 , Tron, Cardano, and Hedera, have left many crypto-natives in disbelief, seeming to have come out of nowhere on little news or with an obvious catalyst.\par \par \uc2 So what propelled the massive gains, and will it continue in 2025?\par \par \uc2 Leading the dino coin comeback is XRP ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP }}}\uc2  ), which rallied over 450% in a single month, adding around $100 billion to its market cap and surging past Solana ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL }}}\uc2  ) and Tether ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tether-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 USDT }}}\uc2  ) to become the third-largest cryptocurrency by total value.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193a8cc-c757-7d1f-b395-d5bff105c82c"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP, Cardano, Hedera, Features }}}\par \par \uc2 Ripple\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s XRP has staged a historic rally, gaining over 450% in a month. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Other old dinosaur projects are roaring back to life thanks to the market\u8217\'20\'19s renewed appetite for altcoins. In the 30 days to Dec. 9, \uc2 Tron\uc2  ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tron-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TRX }}}\uc2  ) is up 96.7%, Cardano ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) gained 145%, Algorand ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/algorand-algo-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ALGO }}}\uc2  ) has jumped 272%, VeChain ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/vechain-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 VET }}}\uc2  ) surged 194%, \uc2 Stellar\uc2  ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM }}}\uc2  ) is up 383%, and Hedera ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/hedera-hbar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HBAR }}}\uc2  ) gained 533%.\par \par \uc2 Regulatory clarity has been great for altcoins\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1COne major factor is the imminent regulatory clarity, which has a particularly positive impact on many altcoins,\u8221\'20\'1D Mads Eberhardt, senior cryptocurrency analyst at Steno Research, told Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 The election of \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  and the pro-crypto stance his administration has promised to take have been major catalysts for altcoins in particular, Eberhardt noted.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAltcoins have long lacked the regulatory certainty that Bitcoin and Ethereum have benefited from.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis is especially true for altcoins like XRP, which faced scrutiny from the SEC under Chair \uc2 Gary Gensler\uc2 . XRP\u8217\'20\'19s challenges were evident when many US-based exchanges delisted it in late 2020 and early 2021 due to the SEC lawsuit against \uc2 Ripple\uc2 ,\u8221\'20\'1D he said.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CXRP\u8217\'20\'19s performance during the 2021 bull market was relatively subdued compared to the broader market. Eberhardt said. \u8220\'20\'1CHowever, the situation has shifted positively following \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s victory in the 2024 US presidential election and the appointment of a new SEC chair, bringing much-needed clarity to altcoins like XRP.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Paul Atkins\uc2 , the Co-Chairman of the Digital Chamber\u8217\'20\'19s Token Alliance and a board member of the Digital Chamber of Commerce, has been nominated as the new SEC boss.\par \par \uc2 Investors expect \uc2 Ripple\uc2  to win legal battle with SEC under Trump\par \par \uc2 eToro\uc2  market analyst Josh Gilbert agreed, telling Cointelegraph a key reason for XRP\u8217\'20\'19s rally \u8212\'20\'14 and the boost it provided to other altcoins \u8212\'20\'14 was the belief that the years long legal battle raging between \uc2 Ripple Labs\uc2  and the SEC would finally come to an end.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CTrump\u8217\'20\'19s election and \uc2 Gary Gensler\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s expected resignation are huge boosts for crypto markets. Clearer \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2  and a better framework for crypto assets are also wins here, particularly for XRP,\u8221\'20\'1D said Gilbert.\par \par \uc2 Ripple\uc2  was an early major target of the SEC against a crypto or blockchain firm. The commission filed a lawsuit against \uc2 Ripple\uc2  in December 2020, alleging the company used the XRP token as an unregistered security to raise funds.\par \par \uc2 On Aug. 7, a judge {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-ripple-labs-liable-civil-penalty"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 found Ripple liable }}}\uc2  for just $125 million in the suit \u8212\'20\'14 a figure 94% lower than the SEC\u8217\'20\'19s request for $2 billion in fines \u8212\'20\'14 leading \uc2 Ripple\uc2  to celebrate the end of the case. However, the SEC appealed the judgment, breathing new life into the case.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193a8cf-c7aa-7a16-bab4-3ea8a2754079"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP, Cardano, Hedera, Features }}}\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/bgarlinghouse/status/1821289051191963861"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Brad Garlinghouse }}}\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe investor view is that a new SEC chair will end \uc2 Ripple\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s long legal nightmare \u8212\'20\'14 which has raged on for years \u8212\'20\'14 and see its stablecoin approved. This has helped drive a tailwind under these other legacy assets, which have spent a long time in the crypto winter,\u8221\'20\'1D said Gilbert.\par \par \uc2 South Korean investors love altcoins\par \par \uc2 In a recent {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://mail.10xresearch.co/p/this-altcoin-is-breaking-out-catching-the-next-wave"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 report }}}\uc2 , 10x Research founder Markus Thielen said retail crypto trading in South Korea was one of the largest catalysts of recent altcoin outperformance.\par \par \uc2 Retail crypto volumes reached their second-highest level of the year on Dec. 2, topping a staggering $18 billion on the day, with South Korean traders frenzying over a series of \u8220\'20\'1Chigh momentum\u8221\'20\'1D altcoins, namely XRP, Dogecoin (DOGE), and \uc2 Stellar\uc2  (XLM).\par \par \uc2 Thielen said that combining the recent uptick in trading activity for {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/what-is-an-altcoin-a-beginners-guide-to-cryptocurrencies-beyond-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 altcoins }}}\uc2  with a relatively \u8220\'20\'1Cmild\u8221\'20\'1D funding rate for Bitcoin was all but a surefire sign that an \u8220\'20\'1Calt season\u8221\'20\'1D could be underway.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193a8d2-9b84-73ac-a107-7db210503070"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP, Cardano, Hedera, Features }}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s funding rate is sitting at a \u8220\'20\'1Cmild\u8221\'20\'1D 15% while interest in altcoins skyrockets. Source: 10x Research\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe are seeing one of the largest divergences recorded between a relatively mild Bitcoin funding rate at 15% annualized while retail trading volumes in Korea have ramped up to $18bn.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe action is clearly in the altcoin market and everybody needs to have a strategy to catch these waves but still remain disciplined,\u8221\'20\'1D he added.\par \par \uc2 The brands are familiar to retail investors coming into the market\par \par \uc2 Another reason \u8220\'20\'1Cdino coins\u8221\'20\'1D may have pumped harder than newer tokens that have cropped up in the last two years is because they\u8217\'20\'19re already familiar brands to retail investors, said Eberhardt.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAltcoins such as XRP and \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  have become household names in the crypto space, meaning that retail investors are likely familiar with them or may have even held them in the past,\u8221\'20\'1D he said.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAs retail participation in the crypto market increases, these investors are more inclined to invest in cryptocurrencies they already know.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Dino coins are as cultish as memecoins \u8212\'20\'14 with a twist\par \par \uc2 Memecoin evangelist Murad Mahmudov {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/memecoin-supercycle-analysts-investment"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 traced the recent outperformance }}}\uc2  of older altcoins back to the \u8220\'20\'1Ccult\u8221\'20\'1D status of their communities, arguing that a delusional conviction was the primary driver behind the recent pumps for tokens like XRP and \uc2 TRON\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/altcoin-season-aggressive-profit-taking-venture-capitalists-cryptocurrency"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Altcoin season 'leg down will be ugly,' says venture capitalist }}}\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe most \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  thing you can have for a token is literally people becoming full-time, unpaid evangelists for the project. We\u8217\'20\'19ve already seen this a lot with \uc2 Ripple\uc2 , Chainlink, Cardano and Dogecoin,\u8221\'20\'1D he told Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 However, pseudonymous trader Kun took issue with the claim that all price performance can be traced back to the cult status of their communities, saying that a fundamental belief in the utility of a token \u8212\'20\'14 justified or not \u8212\'20\'14 is what really matters at the end of the day.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe difference is XRP holders truly believe in the fundamentals, they aren\u8217\'20\'19t buying them as social cults,\u8221\'20\'1D Kun said.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIf you said to an XRP holder it\u8217\'20\'19s a meme with no fundamentals to back, they would shred you down,\u8221\'20\'1D he said in a Dec. 3 X {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/0x_Kun/status/1863846483910598910"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 post }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Will dino coins continue upward?\par \par \uc2 Now that altcoins appear to be finally enjoying their moment in the sun, many investors are wary that it could just be a flash in the pan.\par \par \uc2 However, Eberhardt believes that altcoins are only just getting warmed up.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI think it is just the beginning of an altcoin season.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe regulatory clarity in the US is, in fact, much more positive for altcoins than, for instance, Bitcoin, while the decreasing interest rates also support that market participants are more inclined to make investments further out on the risk curve.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Magazine: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/crypto-four-years-grow-cant-be-shut-down-kain-warwick-infinex/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Crypto has 4 years to grow so big \u8216\'20\'18no one can shut it down\u8217\'20\'19 \u8212\'20\'14 Kain Warwick, Infinex }}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTIvMDE5M2E4YzYtZWQwYS03ZmRmLTg0OTEtYzhlMjY3YWEyNjNl.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241209ekc90008f\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Radiant Capital\par \b \uc2 Here\u8217\'20\'19s what happened in crypto today\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Cointelegraph \par \uc2 708 \uc2 words\par \uc2 9 December 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Need to know what happened in crypto today? Here is the latest news on daily trends and events impacting Bitcoin price, blockchain, DeFi, NFTs, Web3 and crypto \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvNzhkNzg3NjEtM2JkMi00NTY5LTk2YTctNjJhOTdmMGExYjBh.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Here\u8217\'20\'19s what happened in crypto today }}}\par \par \uc2 Today in crypto, El Salvador reportedly expects to reach an agreement with the \uc2 International Monetary Fund\uc2  (\uc2 IMF\uc2 ) on a $1.3 billion loan deal in return for changes in its Bitcoin Law, Radiant Capital says a North Korean-aligned attacker was behind the $50 million October hack on its platform, and the Cardano Foundation\u8217\'20\'19s X account was hacked to post a phishing scam.\par \par \uc2 El Salvador plans Bitcoin policy changes to secure $1.3 billion \uc2 IMF\uc2  loan \u8212\'20\'14 FT\par \par \uc2 El Salvador, the first country in the world to accept Bitcoin as legal tender, is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/el-salvador-1-3-billion-loan-imf-bitcoin-policy-change"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reportedly scaling back its BTC ambitions }}}\uc2  under pressure from the \uc2 IMF\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 El Salvador expects to reach an agreement with the \uc2 IMF\uc2  on a $1.3 billion loan deal in return for changes to its Bitcoin Law, the \uc2 Financial Times{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://ctmain.slack.com/archives/C051Z8HCML2/p1733746621229469?thread_ts=1733746569.357809&cid=C051Z8HCML2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported }}}\uc2  on Dec. 9, citing people familiar with the matter.\par \par \uc2 If confirmed, the deal would obligate the government of El Salvador to drop a legal requirement for businesses to accept Bitcoin ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC }}}\uc2  ) as payment, making it a voluntary payment method.\par \par \uc2 Expected to be finalized in the next two or three weeks, the deal is also expected to unlock another $1 billion of lending from the \uc2 World Bank\uc2  and $1 billion from the \uc2 Inter-American Development Bank\uc2  over the next few years.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 IMF\uc2  has long been opposed to El Salvador\u8217\'20\'19s adoption of Bitcoin, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/imf-issues-veiled-warning-against-el-salvador-s-bitcoin-law"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 repeatedly warning the government }}}\uc2  and Salvadoran President \uc2 Nayib Bukele\uc2  of the financial stability risks behind the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/september-7-is-bitcoin-day-in-el-salvador-as-btc-becomes-legal-tender"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 decision to adopt Bitcoin as legal tender }}}\uc2  in September 2021.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 IMF\uc2  and the Salvadoran government have been {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/imf-pressures-el-salvador-overhaul-bitcoin-regulations"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 discussing the $1.3 billion loan }}}\uc2  and possible changes to El Salvador\u8217\'20\'19s Bitcoin Law since at least October.\par \par \uc2 Radiant says North Korean posed as ex-contractor in $50 million hack\par \par \uc2 Radiant Capital said on Dec. 6 that the $50 million hack on its platform in October {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/radiant-capital-north-korean-impersonated-ex-contractor-50-million-hack"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 was carried out by a North Korea-aligned hacker }}}\uc2  posing as an ex-contractor who sent malware via Telegram.\par \par \uc2 The platform said a Radiant developer received a Telegram message with a zip file from a \u8220\'20\'1Ctrusted former contractor\u8221\'20\'1D in September, which investigating cybersecurity firm \uc2 Mandiant\uc2  said was \u8220\'20\'1Cattributable to a Democratic People\u8217\'20\'19s Republic of Korea (DPRK)-nexus threat actor.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis ZIP file, when shared for feedback among other developers, ultimately delivered malware that facilitated the subsequent intrusion,\u8221\'20\'1D Radiant added.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193a922-1e19-7e08-80de-0f55888b8061"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SEC, United States, Cybersecurity, Cardano, Hacks, El Salvador, Nayib Bukele, Policy }}}\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/RDNTCapital/status/1865201964625035526"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Radiant Capital }}}\par \par \uc2 It believes the actor responsible is known as \u8220\'20\'1CUNC4736,\u8221\'20\'1D also known as \u8220\'20\'1CCitrine Sleet\u8221\'20\'1D \u8212\'20\'14 believed to be aligned with North Korea\u8217\'20\'19s main intelligence agency, the Reconnaissance General Bureau (RGB), and speculated to be a sub-cluster of the hacking collective the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/people/top-people-in-crypto-and-blockchain-2023/lazarus-group/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Lazarus Group }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Radiant was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/radiant-capital-pauses-contracts-exploit-fears"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 forced to halt its lending markets }}}\uc2  on Oct. 16 after an attacker gained control of several signers\u8217\'20\'19 private keys and smart contracts. North Korean hacking groups have long targeted crypto platforms and have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/north-korean-hackers-stolen-crypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 stolen $3 billion }}}\uc2  in crypto between 2017 and 2023.\par \par \uc2 Cardano Foundation X account hacked\par \par \uc2 The Cardano Foundation\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-foundation-x-account-hacked-scam-links-posted-removed"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 X account was hacked }}}\uc2  on Dec. 8 by a threat actor who posted malicious links on the Foundation\u8217\'20\'19s social media page.\par \par \uc2 Initially, the hacker created a post advertising a fraudulent token called \u8220\'20\'1CADAsol,\u8221\'20\'1D which managed to rack up approximately $500,000 in trading volume before collapsing.\par \par \uc2 Following the promotion of the fake token, the hacker created a second fraudulent post claiming that the Cardano Foundation would drop support for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) due to scrutiny from the \uc2 United States Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  (SEC).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/0193a7c1-9753-7778-9fcf-c76766840056"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SEC, United States, Cybersecurity, Cardano, Hacks, El Salvador, Nayib Bukele, Policy }}}\par \par \uc2 One of the fraudulent posts from the Cardano Foundation\u8217\'20\'19s compromised X account. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.me/investigations/189"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ZackXBT }}}\par \par \uc2 Both posts have since been deleted, and the Cardano Foundation is working on regaining control of the social media account.\par \par \uc2 However, users are encouraged to stay clear of the account and not to interact with any links from the Cardano Foundation X page until the issue is fully resolved.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvNzhkNzg3NjEtM2JkMi00NTY5LTk2YTctNjJhOTdmMGExYjBh.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241209ekc90005m\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
