\par\par \b \uc2 Crypto Weekly Roundup: Bitcoin Hits $100k, Hawk Tuah Meltdown, & More\b0\par\par\uc2 Amara Khatri \par \uc2 633 \uc2 words\par \uc2 8 December 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Altcoins}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Business}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Web3}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22Regulation\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 It was a memorable week in crypto history, as Bitcoin surged past the $100,000 mark, achieving a $2 trillion market cap, while the U.S. government transferred $1.9 billion in seized BTC to Coinbase Prime.\par \par \uc2 Regulatory developments included Trump's pro-crypto appointments and the Czech Republic's tax reforms, alongside major business moves like Grayscale's Solana ETF filing and Binance's DeFi push.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ($BTC) is currently holding above {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/12/bitcoin-btc-nears-breakout-as-microstrategy-buys-again"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $95,000}}}\uc2 , and its imminent breakout of a short-term triangle could be up or down. Meanwhile, Michael Saylor\u8217\'20\'19s MicroStrategy has just bought another $1.5 billion BTC, and the U.S. Spot Bitcoin ETFs also chipped in on Monday with $ 4.22 billion in BTC.\par \par \uc2 From a high of over $98,000 on Monday, the $BTC price sank to a low of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/12/bitcoin-bulls-win-latest-battle-as-btc-price-climbs-again"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $93,600}}}\uc2  on Tuesday. However, the bulls stepped in and buoyed the price back up to $96,700.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin broke through the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/12/bitcoin-hits-100k-milestone-nudging-crypto-investors-and-fans-to-scramble"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $100,000}}}\uc2  psychological barrier on December 5, allowing it to achieve a market capitalization of over $2 trillion.\par \par \uc2 According to blockchain firm Arkham Intelligence, the United States government has moved {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/12/us-government-moves-19b-worth-of-btc-to-coinbase"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $1.9 billion}}}\uc2  worth of seized Bitcoin (BTC) to Coinbase Prime.\par \par \uc2 Altcoins\par \par \uc2 Amid the highly volatile crypto landscape that includes Solana (SOL) and Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/12/analysts-are-eyeing-this-new-ethereum-defi-coin-for-50x-profits-see-why-it-could-be-better-than-solana-and-cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 new Ethereum DeFi coin}}}\uc2  stands out with its advanced hybrid trading platform, providing an ideal blend of decentralized and centralized exchange features.\par \par \uc2 A new Ethereum-based token, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/12/trump-claims-credit-for-bitcoin-surging-past-100k-analysts-add-ethereum-and-new-viral-altcoin-yeti-ouro-predicted-for-same-parabolic-success"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Yeti Ouro}}}\uc2  (YETIO), is capturing attention, with analysts predicting it could follow Bitcoin's parabolic trajectory in the coming years.\par \par \uc2 With its revolutionary innovations like Proof of Intelligence (PoI) and the Artificial Intelligence Virtual Machine (AIVM), {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/12/traders-are-flocking-to-this-blockchain-poised-to-become-a-major-defi-contender"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Lightchain Protocol AI}}}\uc2  is working on combining blockchain and AI.\par \par \uc2 22-year-old internet sensation known for her viral "Hawk Tuah" TikTok video, Haliey Welch, is facing criticism after her memecoin {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/12/hawk-eyed-critics-slam-hawk-tuah-girls-meme-coin-meltdown"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $HAWK}}}\uc2  crashed 91% post-launch amid allegations of insider trading and poor management.\par \par \uc2 Business\par \par \uc2 Joining a competitive race amid Solana\u8217\'20\'19s significant market growth, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/12/race-for-solana-etfs-heats-up-as-grayscale-joins-the-fray"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Grayscale Investments}}}\uc2  has filed with the SEC to convert its Solana Trust into a spot ETF on NYSE Arca.\par \par \uc2 Web3\par \par \uc2 Backed, Chainlink, Sonic, and Fortlake Asset Management announced a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/12/backed-chainlink-and-sonic-in-revolutionary-collaboration-to-tokenize-fortlakes-sigma-fund"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 partnership}}}\uc2  to tokenize Fortlake's Sigma Opportunities Fund, marking a significant milestone in taking traditional financial assets to the blockchain.\par \par \uc2 Binance is making a bold move into decentralized finance (DeFi) with the launch of its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/12/binance-bridges-cefi-and-defi-with-babylon-btc-staking-through-on-chain-yields"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 On-Chain Yields program}}}\uc2 , set to debut on December 9.\par \par \uc2 Camino Network is joining forces with e-money provider Monerium to advance {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/12/monerium-partners-with-camino-network-to-drive-on-chain-payments-in-the-travel-industry"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 on-chain payments}}}\uc2  in the travel industry by bringing Monerium and its popular EURe, the on-chain euro, to the Camino Network, allowing users to execute transactions for travel businesses.\par \par \uc2 The EOS blockchain has taken a significant step toward building institutional engagement by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/12/eos-partners-with-ceffu-to-offer-institutional-custody-and-cedefi-services"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 partnering}}}\uc2  with Ceffu, the institutional custody arm of Binance.\par \par \uc2 Regulation\par \par \uc2 The Czech Republic is working on {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/12/czech-republic-moves-to-simplify-crypto-tax-regulations"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 advancing legislation}}}\uc2  to simplify crypto tax obligations and abolish capital gains tax on Bitcoin (BTC) held for at least three years starting in 2025.\par \par \uc2 President-elect Donald Trump has picked former PayPal COO {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/12/donald-trump-taps-ex-paypal-executive-as-white-house-ai-crypto-czar"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 David Sacks}}}\uc2  as his White House AI and Crypto Czar, which is a significant step towards overhauling US policy towards crypto.\par \par \uc2 President-elect Trump has appointed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/12/crypto-friendly-paul-atkins-named-sec-chair-a-shift-in-approach-for-crypto-regulation"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Paul Atkins}}}\uc2  as SEC Chair in a likely shift toward clearer and more crypto-friendly regulatory policies, contrasting sharply with Gary Gensler's enforcement-driven tenure.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/12/former-celsius-ceo-alex-mashinsky-pleads-guilty-to-two-fraud-counts"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Alex Mashinsky}}}\uc2 , the founder and former CEO of failed cryptocurrency lending platform Celsius Network, pleaded guilty to two counts of fraud.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020241209ekc80000w\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
