ldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.me/xyzverse"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Telegram}}}\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/xyz_verse"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 X}}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored press release and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020241208ekc70000s\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 12/6: BTC, ETH, XRP, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , BNB, DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , TON, SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,768 \uc2 words\par \uc2 6 December 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Buyers purchased the Bitcoin price dip on Dec. 5, propelling BTC price back above $100,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTIvMDE5MzljZDktNTMwYy03ZTdhLWE4ZDMtNTRjMjkxNWU4MjVl.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 12/6: BTC, ETH, XRP, SOL, BNB, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, TON, SHIB }}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC }}}\uc2  ) created a historic milestone on Dec. 5, as it reached the psychologically {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-hits-100-000-first-time-new-all-time-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 critical level of $100,000 }}}\uc2 . The bears pulled the price back toward $90,000, but the bulls purchased the dip and have succeeded in driving the price above $100,000 on Dec. 6.\par \par \uc2 Has Bitcoin topped out in the short term, or is every dip still a buying opportunity? This is one of the burning questions in traders\u8217\'20\'19 minds.\par \par \uc2 ARK Invest founder and CEO \uc2 Cathie Wood\uc2  said in a post on X that Bitcoin \u8220\'20\'1Cis still in early innings\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-still-early-100k-cathie-wood-ark"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 even after breaking out of $100,000 }}}\uc2 . She added that her firm believes \u8220\'20\'1CBitcoin is a much bigger idea than gold.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/01939d3d-7bc2-7e83-9743-e0c137138d70"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, ARK, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu }}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360 }}}\par \par \uc2 Although most analysts remain \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Bitcoin for the long term, some are turning cautious in the short term. IG market analyst Tony Sycamore said the sharp drop in Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-plummets-btc-price-longs-liquidated"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 does not mean the end of the bull }}}\uc2  run, but it could result in a \u8220\'20\'1Cconsolidation phase in the days/weeks ahead.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin break out of $104,088, or is a range-bound action possible in the near term? Will the attention shift to altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The long wick and the long tail on Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s Dec. 5 candlestick show selling at higher levels and buying on dips. The intraday high and low of the day assume significance because a breakout from it could start a sharp move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/01939cd7-a1e6-70d5-b0a6-fcfcd0aaed8c"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, ARK, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu }}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price holds $100,000, the BTC/USDT pair could challenge the all-time high of $104,088. Sellers are expected to defend this level with all their might. If the price turns down sharply from $104,088, the bears will try to pull the pair to $90,500, starting a potential range formation.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if buyers pierce the $104,088 resistance, the pair could jump to $113,331 and later to $125,000. Sellers will be back in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat if they tug the price below $90,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH }}}\uc2  ) has continued to move toward the $4,000 to $4,094 overhead resistance zone, where the bears are expected to pose a substantial challenge.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/01939cd8-3fd4-78ed-8007-7a584972f6d1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, ARK, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu }}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The critical support to watch on the downside is the 20-day exponential moving average ($3,523). If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA with strength, it will suggest that the sentiment remains positive and traders are viewing the dips as a buying opportunity. That increases the possibility of a rally above $4,094. The ETH/USDT pair could then soar to $4,500.\par \par \uc2 This optimistic view will be negated in the near term if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP }}}\uc2  ) has pulled back in a strong uptrend, indicating profit booking by the bulls near $3.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/01939cd8-e247-70c9-8a14-2f6aac2b7a7f"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, ARK, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu }}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The pullback is finding support in the range between the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $2.28 and the 50% retracement level of $2.09. The bulls will try to push the price toward $2.91 but are likely to face solid selling by the bears.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down and breaks below $2.09, it will suggest the start of a steep correction. The XRP/USDT pair could slump to the 20-day EMA ($1.79). A deep pullback could be followed by a period of consolidation as both the bulls and the bears regroup before the next trending move.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to push Solana ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL }}}\uc2  ) above the near-term resistance of $248, but the bears are not willing to relent.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/01939cd9-7a31-7403-9c19-10bac99b426d"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, ARK, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu }}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA ($231) and the relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) in the positive territory indicate a balance between supply and demand. If buyers shove the price above $248, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could surge to $264 and eventually to $300.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price slides below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the pair may trade between $210 and $248 for a while. The trend will favor the bears if they yank the pair below the 50-day simple moving average ($205).\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2  ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB }}}\uc2  ) broke above the $722 resistance on Dec. 3, but the bulls could not maintain the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/01939cda-05d9-7ac7-9133-c1e1144a0351"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, ARK, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu }}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price turned down from $794 on Dec. 4, indicating profit booking by short-term buyers. That pulled the price to the breakout level of $722, where the bulls and the bears are battling it out for supremacy.\par \par \uc2 If the price maintains above $722, the bulls will again try to thrust the BNB/USDT pair toward the pattern target of $810. On the contrary, a break below the 20-day EMA ($665) will bring the bears back into the game.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE }}}\uc2  ) continues to trade inside the ascending channel pattern, indicating a slight advantage to the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/01939cda-a505-73a6-9d1d-05aeea6b461c"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, ARK, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu }}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 There is minor resistance at $0.46, but if this level is crossed, the DOGE/USDT pair could rise to the channel\u8217\'20\'19s resistance line near $0.52. Sellers are expected to mount a strong defense at the resistance line.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of weakness will be a break and close below the channel\u8217\'20\'19s support line. Such a move will suggest that the bulls are losing their grip. The pair may then tumble to $0.33.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) turned down from the $1.33 overhead resistance on Dec. 3, indicating profit booking by select traders.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/01939cdb-3315-73cd-87d1-100855b78670"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, ARK, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu }}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The pullback is finding support near $1.10, the 50% Fibonacci retracement level of the latest leg of the rally. Buyers will again try to drive the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair above $1.33. If they succeed, the pair could ascend to $1.50.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down and breaks below $1.10, it will suggest that the traders are rushing the exit. That could sink the pair to the 20-day EMA ($1), which is likely to attract buyers.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-the-crypto-market-down-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is the crypto market down today? }}}\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX }}}\uc2  ) has been witnessing a tough battle between the bulls and the bears near the $51 level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/01939cdb-d650-7511-9e50-f7f315c6f62a"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, ARK, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu }}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA ($44.09) and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the overbought zone indicate that the bulls are in command. If buyers push the price above $56, the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair could climb to $60 and later to $65.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of weakness will be a break and close below the 20-day EMA. If this level gives way, it will suggest that the breakout above $51 may have been a bull trap. The pair may then drop to $38.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are finding it difficult to sustain Toncoin ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/toncoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TON }}}\uc2  ) above the $7 resistance, but a positive sign is that the price remains above the 20-day EMA ($6.29).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/01939cdc-699e-7a52-b656-3f251cec6bca"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, ARK, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu }}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers will again try to push and maintain the price above $7. If that happens, the TON/USDT pair could travel to $7.65. This level may act as a minor hurdle, but it is likely to be crossed. The pair could rise to the top of the range at $8.29.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will signal a lack of demand at higher levels. The pair may then slump to the 50-day SMA ($5.53).\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers tried to push Shiba Inu ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB }}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance of $0.000033 on Dec. 5, but the bears held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/01939cdd-0f13-7b0c-b3d9-dc6f15fa5f88"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, ARK, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu }}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA ($0.000027) and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the positive territory indicate advantage to buyers. If the price rebounds off $0.000030, the bulls will again try to push the SHIB/USDT pair above the $0.000033 resistance. If they manage to do that, the pair could rally to $0.000039.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, the price could skid to the 20-day EMA if the $0.000030 support fails to hold. Buyers are expected to fiercely defend the 20-day EMA because a break below it may open the doors for a fall to the 50-day SMA ($0.000023).\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTIvMDE5MzljZDktNTMwYy03ZTdhLWE4ZDMtNTRjMjkxNWU4MjVl.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241206ekc6000ba\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Why is the crypto market down today?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Nancy Lubale \par \uc2 788 \uc2 words\par \uc2 6 December 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The crypto market correction appears to be accelerating as fear mounts following Bitcoin's drop from all-time highs. Cointelegraph explains why.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvODAzMjgxMmQtMWQ1MC00NmFiLWI5NjUtYTBjYjZkZDQxYTYz.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is the crypto market down today? }}}\par \par \uc2 The cryptocurrency market took a hit today, with the total market capitalization dropping by over 3.1% to about $3.5 trillion on Dec. 6.\par \par \uc2 This sudden plunge has left many investors scratching their heads, trying to understand the core catalysts behind this downturn and whether more losses are on the horizon.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/01939baa-3ad6-7fda-b478-6c193d2a9fe8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Central Bank, Bitcoin Price, Bitcoin \b  \highlight22Regulation\b0 \highlight22 , Economy, Markets, Stocks, Inflation, Interest Rate, Binance, Stablecoin }}}\par \par \uc2 24-hour performance of large-cap cryptocurrencies. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360 }}}\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s look closer at the factors driving the crypto market down today.\par \par \uc2 Investors go risk-off following Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s flash crash\par \par \uc2 Today\u8217\'20\'19s crypto market decline is part of a correction that started during the late New York trading hours on Dec. 5 when Bitcoin ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC }}}\uc2  ) suddenly fell 5% within minutes to below $93,000.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin tumbled from an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-hits-100k-btc-price-hit-a-new-all-time-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 all-time high of $104,000 }}}\uc2  reached on Dec. 5 on \uc2 Coinbase\uc2 , dropping as much as 11.5% to a seven-day low of $92,055. It has since rebounded to $98,613 at the time of publication, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/?exchange=COINBASE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 according }}}\uc2  to data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://subscription.cointelegraph.com/?_gl=1*7499wx*_ga*MTQ0MzQ0NzI4Ny4xNzE2MzY1NTA0*_ga_53R24TEEB1*MTcxNjM2NTUwNC4xLjEuMTcxNjM2Njg2MC4wLjAuMA.."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro }}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-plummets-btc-price-longs-liquidated"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin sudden drop to $93K wipes out $303M of longs within minutes }}}\par \par \uc2 The sudden decline in BTC triggered panic selling among crypto investors, with cryptocurrencies dropping across the board.\par \par \uc2 XRP ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP }}}\uc2  ) extended its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/rip-altseason-xrp-price-down-13-bitcoin-100k#:~:text=At%20the%20same%20time%2C%20more,the%20downward%20pressure%20on%20price."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 three-day losses }}}\uc2 , dipping as low as $2.1 on Dec. 5 before recovering to the current price of around $2.29.\par \par \uc2 Other top-cap cryptocurrencies posting significant losses on Dec. 6 are BNB Chain\u8217\'20\'19s BNB ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB }}}\uc2  ), Dogecoin ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE }}}\uc2  ) and Cardano ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), which are down 1.98%, 3.2% and 4.6%, respectively.\par \par \uc2 Independent analyst Jelle said that the correction was nothing out of the ordinary, as is usually the case with \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  around milestone price levels.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe same happened around 10k and 20k - and the price pushed higher soon after. Hold on tight and enjoy the ride. \u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Long liquidations hurt crypto market bulls\par \par \uc2 The crypto market decline has accelerated further due to a mass long liquidation event over the last 24 hours.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.coinglass.com/LiquidationData"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Data from Coinglass }}}\uc2  shows that long traders\u8212\'20\'14those betting on the crypto market upside\u8212\'20\'14have witnessed approximately $732 million worth of liquidations in the last 24 hours. In comparison, short traders suffered over $160 million in liquidations in the same period.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/01939baa-c483-76a2-ac06-c3e195544ea4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Central Bank, Bitcoin Price, Bitcoin \b  \highlight22Regulation\b0 \highlight22 , Economy, Markets, Stocks, Inflation, Interest Rate, Binance, Stablecoin }}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market liquidation heatmap. Source: CoinGlass\par \par \uc2 Over 168,000 individual traders were liquidated, and the largest single liquidation order was on the crypto exchange OKX \u8212\'20\'14 a BTC/USD swap worth $18.9 million.\par \par \uc2 When long positions are liquidated, traders who are betting on prices going up are forced to sell their positions, often at a loss. This increased selling pressure has driven the crypto market valuation lower today.\par \par \uc2 Besides Bitcoin and Ether ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH }}}\uc2  ), futures tracking DOGE and XRP logged a cumulative $60 million in losses \u8212\'20\'14 as prices reversed from a month\u8217\'20\'19s rally in both tokens that sent open interest (OI) on their futures to record highs in November.\par \par \uc2 The decline caused the crypto Fear & Greed Index to fall from \u8220\'20\'1Cextreme greed\u8221\'20\'1D at 86 on Dec. 5 to\u8220\'20\'1C greed\u8221\'20\'1D at 72 on Dec. 6, its lowest level since Nov. 5.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/01939bac-186a-7329-b43d-09f795e4cffb"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Central Bank, Bitcoin Price, Bitcoin \b  \highlight22Regulation\b0 \highlight22 , Economy, Markets, Stocks, Inflation, Interest Rate, Binance, Stablecoin }}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto Fear & Greed Index. Source: Alternative.me\par \par \uc2 The sharp drop from 86 to 72 in less than 24 hours indicates mounting fear among investors, explaining the ongoing drop in crypto prices.\par \par \uc2 \u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0BA technical correction?\par \par \uc2 Today\u8217\'20\'19s decline in the crypto market comes following a rally that started after TOTAL\u8212\'20\'14the market capitalization of all cryptocurrencies\u8212\'20\'14broke above what appears to be a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-is-a-bull-flag-chart-pattern-and-how-to-spot-it"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 bull flag pattern }}}\uc2  on the weekly chart.\par \par \uc2 The market successfully surpassed the upper trendline of the bull flag at $2.25 trillion during the week ending Oct. 14. This breakout has resulted in a 55% uptick in the global crypto market capitalization to the current level of $3.48 trillion.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/01939bae-37ad-746e-a5c3-43016aa5aee5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Central Bank, Bitcoin Price, Bitcoin \b  \highlight22Regulation\b0 \highlight22 , Economy, Markets, Stocks, Inflation, Interest Rate, Binance, Stablecoin }}}\par \par \uc2 TOTAL market capitalization daily chart: Cointelegraph/ {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/UVgQeYcD/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 Therefore, more gains could follow toward the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  target of the flag at $6.06 trillion, up around 74% from current levels.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvODAzMjgxMmQtMWQ1MC00NmFiLWI5NjUtYTBjYjZkZDQxYTYz.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241206ekc60008h\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
